Fish generally spoils faster than red meat because of its high water activity, relatively mild postmortem acidity, and highly active spoilage enzymes and microorganisms.', '["Sentence A is correct","Sentence B is correct","Both sentences are correct","Both sentences are incorrect"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 2, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-10-23T13:48:09.285Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":1}'::jsonb, '"2026-10-22T13:48:09.285Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.039Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-22T13:48:09.488Z"'::jsonb),
