('anki-card-1758690714425-51', NULL, 'anki-deck-1758689429896-1790185671252', 'Food constituents that enhance calcium absorption. *', 'vitamins C & D', '', '["oxalates & phytates","none of the above","both a & b","vitamins C & D"]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 2, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-29T10:33:23.394Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":1}'::jsonb, '"2026-09-28T10:33:23.394Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-23T17:47:52.013Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-28T10:33:23.394Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758690732607-52', NULL, 'anki-deck-1758689429896-1790185671252', 'The pancreas secrete ____ when blood glucose levels increase and ____ when blood glucose levels decrease. *', 'insulin; glucagon', 'When blood glucose increases (e.g., after a meal): The beta cells of the pancreas secrete insulin. Insulin acts as a key to open cells, allowing them to absorb glucose from the bloodstream to be used for energy or stored as glycogen, thereby lowering blood sugar back to a normal range.

When blood glucose decreases (e.g., during fasting): The alpha cells of the pancreas secrete glucagon. Glucagon signals the liver to break down its stored glycogen back into glucose and release it into the bloodstream, raising blood sugar back up to normal levels.

• Glycogen is a starch-like molecule used for storing glucose in the liver and muscles; it is not a hormone secreted by the pancreas.', '["insulin; glucagon","glycogen; epinephrine","insulin; glycogen","glucagon; insulin"]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 3, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-11-04T08:09:04.914Z","interval":6,"easeFactor":2.1,"repetitions":3}'::jsonb, '"2026-10-29T08:09:04.914Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-23T17:47:52.013Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-29T08:09:05.236Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758690748974-53', NULL, 'anki-deck-1758689429896-1790185671252', 'In the digestive tract, disaccharides such as sucrose are hydrolyzed to monosaccharides mainly by enzymes located in the: *', 'brush border of the small intestine', 'brush border of the small intestine.', '["lumen of the large intestine","brush border of the small intestine","gastric secretions","salvia"]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 2, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-29T14:39:11.467Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":1}'::jsonb, '"2026-09-28T14:39:11.467Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-23T17:47:52.013Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-08T12:24:43.573Z"'::jsonb),
