('anki-card-1754882159992-16', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608681588-1790433140276-5f3w7', 'The period shortly after a slow growth period when the weight and height gains are likely to be faster than expected for age and gender.', 'Catch-up growth', 'Catch-up growth is the accelerated growth following a period of growth faltering, allowing a child to "catch up" toward their expected growth trajectory.

Growth spurt is the period of rapid growth (such as during adolescence) without necessarily following a preceding slow-growth or deficit period.', '["Growth spurt","Catch-up growth","All of the above","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-08-12T20:00:00.000Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":2}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.763Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-07T14:32:00.423Z"'::jsonb),
