('anki-card-1754882418497-19', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608681588-1790433140276-5f3w7', 'Victor is 35 years old. He is classified as ___', 'Young adult', '', '["Young adult","Middle adult","Older adult","Oldest adult"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-08-12T20:00:00.000Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":3}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.763Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1754882581489-20', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608681588-1790433140276-5f3w7', 'The following are normal food behaviors of preschool children EXCEPT:', 'Preference for sweet and spicy foods', 'Preschoolers typically show a preference for sweet and mild (not spicy) flavors, and an early preference for strongly spicy foods is not a typical, expected behavior at this age.', '["Erratic appetite","Unpredictable appetite","Food rituals are common","Preference for sweet and spicy foods"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.763Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-07T14:32:00.423Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1754882677218-21', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608681588-1790433140276-5f3w7', 'In the management of SAM, the following are the commodities that can be given EXCEPT:', 'Ready-to-use Supplementary Food', 'Ready-to-use Supplementary Food', '["Ready-to-use Therapeutic Food","Ready-to-use Supplementary Food","Formula 75","Formula 100"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.763Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-08T12:24:43.573Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1754882838809-22', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608681588-1790433140276-5f3w7', 'Which of the following is a common problem among elderly?', 'Depression', 'All of the above', '["Parasitism","Depression","Dental carries","Hyperactivity"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.763Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-08T12:24:43.573Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1754882879578-23', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608681588-1790433140276-5f3w7', 'What is the age range of older adults?', '60-80 years old', '', '["18-40 years old","40-60 years old","60-80 years old","80-100 years old"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.763Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1754882957522-24', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608681588-1790433140276-5f3w7', 'A theory of aging where cells are inactivated or defective as a result in DNA replication.', 'Somatic mutation theory', 'Somatic mutation theory', '["Genetic theory","Wear-and-tear theory","Somatic mutation theory","Cross-linkage theory"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.763Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-08T12:24:43.573Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1754883008503-25', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608681588-1790433140276-5f3w7', 'Psychological related factors resulting to malnutrition in elderly except:', 'Immobility', 'Immobility is a physical/biological factor: It refers to the physical inability to move around easily, which causes malnutrition by making it difficult for an elderly person to shop for groceries, lift heavy cooking utensils, or prepare meals independently.

The other options are psychological/social factors: Living alone (which leads to loneliness and isolation), depression, and anxiety are all mental, emotional, or psychological states that directly destroy an elderly person''s appetite, interest in food, and motivation to eat (a condition often called the "anorexia of aging").', '["Living alone","Depression","Anxiety","Immobility"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.763Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-07T14:32:00.423Z"'::jsonb),
