('anki-card-1754960243138-5', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608714172-1790433142615-7boq2', 'Which of the following statement/s is/are correct under PD 1286?', 'To pass the examination, a candidate must obtain an average of 70%, with no rating below 60% in any subject.', 'Only statement 2 is correct', '["To pass the examination, a candidate must obtain an average of 70%, with no rating below 60% in any subject.","An applicant who fails to obtain a passing average but who obtained at least 70% in one half of the total subjects given, may be permitted to take another examination.","Should the examinee fail in the set of subjects repeated in the second examination, he/she shall be required another examination on the subject in which he/she obtained a grade below 70%","Only statement 1 is correct"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 2, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-11-05T11:03:29.613Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.1,"repetitions":1}'::jsonb, '"2026-11-04T11:03:29.613Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.564Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-08T12:24:43.573Z"'::jsonb),
