('anki-card-1754961281356-15', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608714172-1790433142615-7boq2', 'Why are theories important in nutrition education?', 'They are used to shape the nutrition education interventions and answer the "why, what, and how".', 'The best answer is that theories are used to shape nutrition education interventions and answer the "why, what, and how" of behavior change, providing the conceptual foundation for designing effective programs. 

• The other choices each describe legitimate but narrower functions of theory (serving as the basis for behavior change, identifying target audiences, or identifying moderators of change), while the correct answer most comprehensively captures theory''s overall guiding role in shaping the full intervention design process.', '["They are the bases and center of behavior change.","They are used to shape the nutrition education interventions and answer the \"why, what, and how\".","They are useful in identifying the target audience of nutrition education.","They help nutrition educators identify and modify the specific set of moderators of behavior change."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 2, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-11-07T10:41:37.567Z","interval":3,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":4}'::jsonb, '"2026-11-04T10:41:37.567Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.564Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-07T14:32:00.423Z"'::jsonb),
