Rice gruel', 'Rice gruel', 'When introducing complementary foods to an infant at six months, the ideal first semi-solid food is a simple, easily digestible, hypoallergenic preparation such as soft rice gruel (lugaw).

• Orange juice / Milk formula / Strained meat: Introduced later or alongside complementary feeds.', '["Orange juice c. Milk formula","Strained meat"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:06:49.769Z"'::jsonb)
