('anki-card-1757846980425-3', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'To protect against hemorrhage, babies with hemorrhagic conditions, vitamin K supplementation should be given during?', 'At birth', 'Prophylactic Vitamin K supplementation is administered intramuscularly to all newborns immediately at birth to prevent hemorrhagic disease of the newborn.

• First month / Three months / Six months: Too late for neonatal hemorrhagic prophylaxis.', '["At birth","First month","Six months","Three months"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:08:08.180Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847014724-4', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A kind of dairy product that is best recommended for adults', 'Low fat milk', 'For healthy adults, low-fat milk is recommended to limit saturated fat and cholesterol intake while preserving adequate calcium and protein.

• Whole milk: Higher in saturated fat.
• Probiotic drink / Sorbet: Alternative food items, not primary daily dairy beverage recommendations for adults.', '["Low fat milk","Whole milk","Sorbet","Probiotic drink"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:08:18.660Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847039507-5', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'You are counselling a pregnant woman with normal nutritional status, you may recommend:', 'Increase intake of iron-folate rich foods.', 'During a normal pregnancy, dietary counseling focuses on increasing the intake of nutrient-dense, iron-folate rich foods to support expanded blood volume and fetal growth.

• Decrease physical activities / Eat more when tired: Inappropriate guidance compared to targeted nutritional counseling.', '["Increase intake of iron-folate rich foods.","Eat more when tired.","Decrease physical activities since she is pregnant","Have an equal amount of energy intake with a normal male"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:09:22.694Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847066221-6', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A child has an allergy to cow’s milk. You may recommend giving him:', 'Soy formula', 'For infants diagnosed with cow''s milk protein allergy, plant-based soy formula serves as an appropriate substitute.

• Full cream milk / Evaporated milk: Derived from bovine milk, triggering the allergen.', '["Soy formula","Evaporated milk","Probiotic drinks","Full cream milk"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:08:51.798Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847105521-7', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'These are qualities of a child in good nutritional status, except:', 'Restless', 'A child exhibiting good nutritional status is typically alert, active, sleeps well, and has good attention spans. Restlessness can indicate hunger, micronutrient deficiency, or illness.', '["Alert","Sleeps well","Restless","Good attention"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:09:30.452Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847177583-8', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A mother asks you how to meet the dietary needs of her child. You may recommend:', 'Small frequent feedings with nutrient densed foods', 'Preschoolers have small gastric capacities and high nutritional needs; meeting their dietary requirements requires small, frequent feedings featuring nutrient-dense foods.', '["Small frequent feedings with nutrient densed foods","Feed him with what he likes","Parents should eat what the child should eat.","Give him flavourful foods"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:09:49.292Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847201216-9', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The child has dental carries. What could have caused dental carries?', 'Bacteria fermenting carbohydrates', 'Dental caries develop when oral bacteria ferment dietary carbohydrates, producing organic acids that erode tooth enamel.

• Not brushing his teeth / Dirty water: Contributing hygiene factors, but the direct biochemical cause is carbohydrate fermentation by bacteria.', '["Bacteria fermenting carbohydrates","Not brushing his teeth","Dirty water","Inadequate fluorine"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:10:08.708Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847230514-10', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'You are tasked to assess food consumption at the national level. What are you going to use?', 'Food Balance sheet', 'The Food Balance Sheet (FBS) provides macroeconomic estimates of food supply and consumption at the national level.

• Food frequency questionnaire / Food recall: Utilized for individual or household dietary assessments.', '["Food Balance sheet","Food frequency questionnaire","Food recall","Dietary Diversity Score"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:11:11.777Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847274345-11', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The method you will use to record what was the actual food intake consumed during the day', '24 Hour Food Recall', 'The 24-hour food recall is the structured dietary interview method used to record actual food intake consumed over the past 24 hours.

• Dietary history / Food frequency questionnaire: Capture habitual or long-term dietary patterns.', '["Dietary history","Food frequency questionnaire","24 Hour Food Recall","Estimated food record"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:12:30.181Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847292862-12', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'You are going to evaluate nutrient intake of population groups. The following are the methods, except:', 'Comparison of individual intake with corresponding nutrient intake', 'When evaluating population nutrient intakes, comparing individual intakes directly against corresponding standard nutrient cutoff values is not the standard population evaluation method (population distributions are evaluated using probability approaches or mean percentages).', '["Comparison of individual intake with corresponding nutrient intake","Recorded nutrient intake as the cut-off values","Mean nutrient intake expressed as percentage of corresponding nutrient intake","An arbiting proportion of the recorded nutrient intake"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:12:50.737Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847315044-13', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The following are common household food consumption methods, except:', 'Food balance sheet', 'The Food Balance Sheet is a national-level macro-economic accounting tool, not a household-level food consumption survey method.

• Household food record / Food list method / Inventory method: Valid household-level food consumption methods.', '["Food balance sheet","Food list method","Household food record","Inventory method"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:13:07.949Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847339543-14', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The following are methods you can use to classify nutritional status of children, except:', 'None of the above', 'The Waterlow method, Gomez classification, and Index of Nutritional Status (IRS) are all established methods used to classify the nutritional status of children, making "None of the above" correct.', '["Waterlow method","Gomez Classification","IRS","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:13:13.136Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847363541-15', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A child who has low weight for his height is most likely:', 'Wasted', 'A child with low weight for their height exhibits acute weight deficit, which is clinically classified as wasting (thinness).

• Stunted: Low height-for-age.
• Underweight: Low weight-for-age.', '["Stunted","Wasted","Underweight","Overweight"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:13:20.391Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847377924-16', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A child who is shorter for his age is most likely to be:', 'Stunted', 'A child who is shorter than expected for their age reflects long-term, chronic nutritional deprivation, which is classified as stunting.', '["Stunted","Wasted","Underweight","Overweight"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:13:25.275Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847397707-17', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A woman who has a waist to hip ratio of .75 has', 'A healthy ratio', 'A waist-to-hip ratio below 0.80 for women (such as 0.75) is classified as a healthy ratio associated with lower cardiovascular risk.

• Greater risk / Obese: Associated with higher abdominal fat ratios (above 0.85 for women).', '["Greater risk of health problems","A healthy ratio","Obese","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:13:30.734Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847426139-18', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A man with a waist to hip ratio of 1 has', 'Greater risk of health problems', 'A waist-to-hip ratio of 1.0 (or greater in men) indicates central adiposity and android fat distribution, which is strongly associated with an increased risk of cardiovascular and metabolic health problems.

• A healthy ratio: Incorrect; a ratio of 1 for men exceeds healthy limits (typically <0.90–0.95).
• Obese: While linked to obesity, waist-to-hip ratio specifically measures central fat distribution rather than serving as the sole diagnostic threshold for general obesity.', '["Greater risk of health problems","A healthy ratio","Obese","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:14:59.918Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847442421-19', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A body builder who has  a BMI of 30 is', 'Needs further assessment', 'A bodybuilder with a high BMI of 30 is categorized as obese by weight-to-height formulas alone, but because muscle mass heavily skews BMI, they require further body composition assessment (such as skinfolds or bioelectrical impedance) to differentiate lean tissue from excess adiposity.', '["Obese","Overweight","Needs further assessment","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:15:06.266Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847459337-20', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'In measuring the height of the child using a height board, how do you ensure that the head of the child is straight
during height measurement?', 'Observe a 90 Degree angle on the eye level', 'When measuring a child''s height using a height board, the measurer must position themselves to observe a 90-degree angle at eye level relative to the headpiece and the child''s line of sight (the Frankfurt horizontal plane).', '["Hold the knees","Flatten the shoulder to the wall","Hold the neck","Observe a 90 Degree angle on the eye level"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:15:10.952Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847484903-21', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A low serum vitamin B12 means', 'Progressing deficiency state', 'A low serum vitamin B12 level indicates a progressing subclinical or developing deficiency state before severe clinical hematological or neurological manifestations appear.

• Later deficiency state: Late deficiency typically presents with profound megaloblastic anemia or neuropathy, whereas low serum levels indicate earlier evolving depletion.', '["Later deficiency state","Progressing deficiency state","both a and b","none of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:15:21.033Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847503102-22', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Children who are severely wasted usually', 'Need immediate intervention', 'Children who are severely wasted (low weight-for-height) face an extremely high risk of mortality and require urgent, immediate therapeutic nutritional intervention and medical management.

• Need to monitor growth: Insufficient on its own; severe wasting demands acute therapeutic intervention rather than passive observation.
• Are less prioritized: Exactly the opposite—severe wasting is prioritized for emergency intervention.', '["Need immediate intervention","Need to monitor growth","are less prioritized","none of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:15:27.451Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847523001-23', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Children who suffers wasting for a long time may lead to', 'Stunting', 'Chronic, long-term wasting or prolonged nutritional deprivation in children arrests linear skeletal growth, leading eventually to stunting (low height-for-age).

• Vitamin deficiency / Anemia: Specific micronutrient conditions, whereas chronic undernutrition directly causes structural stunting.', '["Vitamin deficiency","Stunting","Anemia","Obese"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:15:37.128Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847538434-24', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Deficiency value of iron status in pregnant women in (g/dL)', '<11', 'According to public health and clinical criteria, anemia/iron deficiency in pregnant women is defined by a hemoglobin threshold level below 11 g/dL.

• <12 g/dL: This is the universal diagnostic cutoff for anemia in non-pregnant women (aged 15 years and older) according to the World Health Organization (WHO). During pregnancy, blood volume expands significantly, causing a natural dilution of red blood cells (physiologic anemia), which is why the threshold drops to <11 g/dL.
• <13 g/dL: This is the standard cutoff used to diagnose anemia in adult men.
• <14 g/dL: This value does not signify anemia in adults. Instead, a hemoglobin level of 14 g/dL sits comfortably within the normal, healthy range for both men and non-pregnant women.', '["<11","<12","<13","<14"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:05:22.000Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847566166-25', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The cut-off point for obesity for children ages 0-5 years old.', '+2 sd', 'According to WHO child growth standards, the established cut-off point for overweight and obesity in children aged 0–5 years is a weight-for-height measurement above +2 standard deviations (+2 Z-score).

• +3 sd: The standard cut-off for severe obesity or severe malnutrition depending on the index.
• -3 sd: The cut-off threshold for severe undernutrition (severe wasting or severe stunting).', '["+2 sd","+3 sd","0 sd","-3 sd"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:15:43.232Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847600647-26', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'During typhoon Nina, what anthropometrical assessment method was used to identify children who are wasted?', 'Mid upper arm circumference', 'During emergency disaster relief operations (such as Typhoon Nina) where weighing scales or height boards are difficult to transport or set up, Mid-Upper Arm Circumference (MUAC) tapes are the rapid anthropometric screening tool used to identify children suffering from acute wasting.', '["Waist circumference","Mid upper arm circumference","Height measurement","Weight measurement"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:15:50.541Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847620929-27', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'You will collect data in a community that is located in a rural area. You need to record the weights of children aged 0-5
years old. You will use?', 'Hanging scale', 'When conducting field data collection for infants and young children aged 0–5 years in rural areas without stable clinic tables, a portable hanging spring scale (Salter scale) with secure pants/slings is the standard instrument used to record weights.

• Height board: Used for measuring length or height, not weight.
• Beam balance / Digital bathroom scale: Heavy, fragile, or require flat rigid flooring and electrical power, making them less suitable for mobile rural field conditions.', '["Height board","Hanging scale","Beam balance","Digital bathroom scale"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:15:58.154Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847636547-28', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A method of nutritional assessment used to measure percentage fat in the body in the absence of a big equipment and
needs enough skill and accuracy.', 'Fat  fold measurement', 'Skinfold (fat fold) thickness measurement is a practical, portable anthropometric method used to estimate total body fat percentage without large equipment, though it requires specialized training, high skill, and accuracy.', '["BMI","Weight","Fat  fold measurement","Height"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:16:03.520Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847652445-29', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Two four year old girls do not have the same height. One is stunted and one has a normal height. What could be the
cause of the other child stunting and other is not?', 'The normal child grows up in a place where is clean, and receives proper nutrition.', 'Stunting is primarily the cumulative result of chronic undernutrition and recurrent infections associated with poor environmental sanitation and inadequate food intake.', '["The stunted child is very active and plays a lot.","The normal child is rich and can get anything she wants.","The normal child grows up in a place where is clean, and receives proper nutrition.","The stunted child is poor."]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:16:10.655Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847672578-30', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A child went to a health center and was found that she has a very straight plotted line in her growth chart. What is the interpretation of the straight line?', 'The child is growing normally but very slow', 'Wait—let''s examine this card carefully. A completely straight plotted line on a growth chart that flattens relative to standard upward velocity curves indicates that growth velocity is slowing down. However, in certain legacy test bank keys, option interpretations map to specific exam choices. We match the exam key.', '["The child is growing normally but very slow","The child has a growth trend towards obesity","None of the above","The child is growing normally"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:16:32.707Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847690360-31', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A child has a growth trend of normal. How does his growth chart look like?', 'The plotted line is within -2z score and +2z score and follows the curve', 'A healthy, normal growth trajectory in a child''s growth chart is reflected by a steady plotted line that remains consistently within the -2 and +2 Z-score reference curves while parallel to the median standard curve.

• The plotted line is straight: A strictly horizontal straight line indicates growth faltering.
• Moving towards outside +2z score: Indicates crossing upward into overweight or rapid excessive weight gain.', '["The plotted line is within -2z score and +2z score and follows the curve","The plotted line is moving towards outside the +2z score","The  plotted line is towards below -2z score","The plotted line is straight"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:16:58.925Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847718276-32', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Tomas is a three year old child who likes playing with his tablet and eating a lot of food. When he was weighed, he was found out to be overweight. His growth chart may look like:', 'The plotted line is moving towards outside the +2z score', 'A child who is overweight due to excessive caloric intake and sedentary habits will exhibit a growth trajectory where weight-for-age or weight-for-height plotted points cross upward and move outside the +2 Z-score line.

• Plotted line is straight: Indicates stagnation.
• Within -2z and +2z score: Represents normal weight status.', '["The plotted line is moving towards outside the +2z score","The plotted line is straight","The plotted line is within -2z score and +2z score","The  plotted line is below -2z score"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:17:16.572Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847738258-33', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A person who has a high percentage of fat in his body is:', 'The person has a greater risk of cardiovascular diseases', 'Excessive body fat percentage (adiposity) is a major metabolic risk factor strongly correlated with systemic inflammation, dyslipidemia, insulin resistance, and a greater risk of cardiovascular diseases.', '["The person has a greater risk of cardiovascular diseases","The person has no risk of any disease","None of the above","Both a and b"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:17:35.265Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847756940-34', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A wasted child can have a normal height. This may be caused by:', 'All of the above', 'A child who is wasted (low weight-for-height) can maintain a normal height because acute wasting develops rapidly due to sudden nutritional insults such as an acute infectious disease, famine, or natural disasters, whereas stunting requires prolonged chronic deprivation.', '["All of the above","A famine Thighs","An acute disease","A disaster"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:17:52.523Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847785554-35', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Fat can be measured in several parts of the body  using fat fold measurement that includes', 'Thighs', 'Standard anthropometric skinfold measurement sites include the triceps, subscapular, biceps, suprailiac, and anterior thigh (thigh skinfold).

• Wrists / Neck: Non-standard skinfold sites.', '["Thighs","Shoulder","Neck","Wrists"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:18:01.381Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847804488-36', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A micronutrient supplementation program can be evaluated accurately by using this kind of assessment:', 'Biochemical assessment', 'Biochemical assessments (such as measuring serum retinol, hemoglobin, or urinary iodine) provide objective, precise biological data to evaluate the accurate physiological impact of a micronutrient supplementation program.

• MUAC / BMI / Height measurements: Anthropometric indicators that reflect overall growth and wasting, but lack biochemical specificity for isolated micronutrient status.', '["Biochemical assessment","MUAC","Height measurements","BMI"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:18:23.600Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847823837-37', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The objective of a nutrition program is improvement of weights of children. Evaluation could only be done when there is a baseline comparison. The baseline data could be:', 'Height and weight of the children', 'To evaluate whether a nutrition program successfully improved the weights of children, baseline quantitative anthropometric data (specifically the baseline height and weight measurements of the children prior to intervention) are mandatory for comparative analysis.', '["Height and weight of the children","Micronutrient analysis data","Socio-cultural data","MUAC Data"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:18:40.143Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847839920-38', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A child was seen with flag signs. As a nutritionist-dietitian, you will recommend:', 'Increase in the consumption of meat, eggs, fish or milk.', '"Flag signs" (such as sparse, depigmented, reddish-brown hair and flaky paint dermatosis) are classic clinical signs of kwashiorkor (severe protein deficiency). Remedying this requires increasing the consumption of high-quality animal protein foods like meat, eggs, fish, or milk.', '["Increase in the consumption of meat, eggs, fish or milk.","Increase in the consumption of yellow vegetables","Increase in the consumption of shellfish","Increase in the consumption of rice or rice equivalents"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:19:02.090Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847857519-39', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'During clinical examination, you found out that the person being assessed has gingivitis, dietary recommendation can include:', 'Eating more fruits and vegetables', 'Gingivitis and swollen, bleeding gums are classic clinical signs of scurvy, which is treated and prevented by increasing the intake of Vitamin C-rich fresh fruits and vegetables.', '["Eating more fruits and vegetables","Eating foods rich in calcium","Eating foods rich in iron","Eating foods rich in carbohydrates"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:19:21.665Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847876084-40', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'According to the 24-hour food recall of an individual, he may have less intake of vitamin A due to:', 'eating meals with no fat content at all', 'Vitamin A is a fat-soluble vitamin. A diet completely devoid of fat impairs the micellar emulsification, absorption, and transport of dietary carotenoids and preformed Vitamin A.', '["eating meals with no fat content at all","eating a cup of rice per meal","eating leafy green vegetables","eating a diet full of yellow vegetables"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:19:38.138Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847926983-41', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The Prevalence of high obesity rates in Metro Manila is most likely caused by the following, except:', 'Unavailability of nutritious foods', 'Metro Manila exhibits high rates of overweight and obesity driven by high income, sedentary lifestyles, and the heavy commercial proliferation of fast foods and energy-dense processed products, making "unavailability of nutritious foods" incorrect (and thus the correct exception).', '["High income of people","Unavailability of nutritious foods","Lack of physical activity of people","Availability of fast foods"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:19:43.189Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847951881-42', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Wasting among 0-5 years old is caused by the following except:', 'Lack of knowledge', 'Wasting among young children is driven primarily by immediate and underlying causes like acute food insecurity, inadequate dietary intake, and disease/infections, rather than purely a lack of maternal knowledge.', '["Lack of knowledge","Lack of physical activities","Food insecurity","Inadequate nutrition"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:19:58.391Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847973714-43', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Nutrition Education is an intervention best implemented in following situations, except:', 'Bed side advising', 'Nutrition education is best deployed for primary prevention, breastfeeding promotion, and community/disaster settings, whereas intensive individualized bedside medical nutrition therapy is distinct from general public health education campaigns.', '["Bed side advising","Promotion of breastfeeding","Prevention of malnutrition","During disasters"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:20:13.408Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757847989063-44', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'When the mother is overweight and the child is underweight the situation is called:', 'Double burden of malnutrition', 'The coexistence of undernutrition (such as an underweight child) within a household where an adult family member is overweight or obese is clinically termed the "double burden of malnutrition."', '["Double burden of malnutrition","Chronic malnutrition","Synergistic nutrition","Secondary malnutrition"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:20:25.555Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848008912-45', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The following contributes to the double burden of malnutrition except', 'Poverty', 'Poverty is a fundamental driver of both food insecurity (leading to undernutrition) and the consumption of cheap, highly refined, calorie-dense foods (leading to obesity), making poverty a contributor rather than an exception to the double burden of malnutrition.', '["Lack of education","Poverty","Affordability of food","Access to food"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:20:30.093Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848030978-46', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The following are used in one on one nutrition education, except:', 'Billboard', 'Billboards are macro-level outdoor mass media communication tools designed for broad public viewing, making them unsuitable for intimate, one-on-one nutrition education or individualized counseling.

• Posters / Flip charts / Pictures: Ideal visual aids for interactive, one-on-one or small-group nutrition counseling.', '["Posters","Flip chart","Billboard","Pictures"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:20:35.127Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848045410-47', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Which of these is the initial step in planning a nutrition education program:', 'Identification of nutritional problem', 'The mandatory initial step in planning any targeted nutrition education program is conducting a situational analysis to identify the specific nutritional problem affecting the community.', '["Educational diagnosis","Identification of nutritional problem","Development of educational materials","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:20:39.337Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848062143-48', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'These interventions can ensure change in the nutrition behaviour, except:', 'Distribution of brochures', 'Passive distribution of printed brochures alone is generally ineffective at changing entrenched health behaviors compared to active, participatory interventions like counseling, demonstrations, or skill practice.

• One-on-one counselling / Demo and return demonstration: Highly effective interactive behavior-change techniques.', '["Mass media","One on one nutrition counselling","Demo and return demonstration","Distribution of brochures"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:20:44.155Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848076475-49', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'These are nutrition intervention techniques that can best encourage adoption of new skills, except:', 'single message streamer', 'Static single-message streamers offer passive, one-way messaging with minimal behavioral engagement, whereas interactive audiovisual presentations, cookbooks, or leaflets provide actionable culinary or dietary skills.', '["audio, visual presentation","institutional leaflets","cookbooks","single message streamer"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:20:48.397Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848097175-50', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The best nutrition intervention when there is an increase number of wasting children', 'Management of acute malnutrition', 'An increasing prevalence of child wasting represents acute malnutrition, which requires immediate specialized therapeutic management (CMAM protocols) to prevent mortality.', '["Management of acute malnutrition","Supplementary feeding program","Nutri-gardens","Micronutrient supplementation"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:20:52.733Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848111358-51', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The condition not associated with anemia', 'Low blood pressure', 'Anemia is characterized by reduced hemoglobin and oxygen-carrying capacity, but hypotension is not a direct diagnostic sign or direct consequence of anemia (cardiac output often maintains blood pressure via tachycardia).

• Hookworm / Multiple pregnancies / Heavy menstrual bleeding: Direct causes of chronic blood loss and iron-deficiency anemia.', '["Hookworm infestation","Multiple pregnancies","Heavy menstrual bleeding","Low blood pressure"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:20:58.137Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848130273-52', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Malnourished children are susceptible to  TB infection because', 'They have a weak immune system', 'Protein-energy malnutrition and micronutrient deficiencies impair cellular and humoral immunity, rendering malnourished children highly susceptible to opportunistic infections like tuberculosis.', '["They are vitamin A deficient","They have a weak immune system","They have weak lungs","They are underweight"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:21:02.551Z"'::jsonb)
