('anki-card-1757848145721-53', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The type of weighing scale not recommended for use in nutrition anthropometry', 'Non-digital bathroom scales', 'Mechanical or spring-loaded non-digital bathroom scales easily lose calibration, possess high measurement error, and are explicitly not recommended for accurate nutrition anthropometry.

• Beam balance: The gold-standard clinical weighing scale.', '["Beam balance","Bard or espada type scale","Non-digital bathroom scales","All of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:21:07.764Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848161705-54', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'It was found out that one province in the Philippines have missing nutrients in their daily food intake. What type of
nutrition intervention should be given?', 'Food fortification', 'When an entire region or population suffers from missing or inadequate micronutrients in their daily dietary intake, large-scale public health food fortification (adding nutrients to staple foods like flour, oil, or rice) is the most effective systemic intervention.', '["Food price subsidies","Food assistance","Food fortification","Food formulation"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:21:11.347Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848182154-55', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'An example of nutrition education to adopt better practices in the following situation where after learning that the
children are suffering from calorie-protein deficiency, the teacher:', 'Teaches their parents about calories and protein through lectures', 'While traditional didactic lectures impart cognitive knowledge, active participatory engagement (such as mothers participating directly in supplementary feeding and food preparation) is far more effective at translating knowledge into practical behavioral change.', '["Teaches their parents about calories and protein through lectures","Involves the active participation of mothers in a supplementary feeding programs","Monitors mothers through home visits","All of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:21:15.519Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848202270-56', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'If according to a survey, the children in the community are deficient in Vitamin A, which of the following would you
recommend:', 'Malunggay leaves, yellow squash, alugbati', 'Malunggay leaves, yellow squash, and alugbati are exceptionally rich dark-green leafy and yellow-orange botanical sources of beta-carotene (provitamin A).', '["Eggplant, ampalaya leaves, guavas","Kamachili, patola, camote tops","Green papaya, ampalaya leaves, sayote","Malunggay leaves, yellow squash, alugbati"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:21:19.167Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848218152-57', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The characteristics that differentiate a project from a program:', 'a cluster of activities', 'In project management terminology, a project is defined as a specific, time-bound cluster of interconnected activities designed to achieve a singular objective.', '["Specific, time bound and a set of activities","a cluster of activities","statement of a problem","personnel, facilities"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:21:23.351Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848233118-58', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Factors affecting malnutrition can be traced to:', 'All of the above', 'Malnutrition is multifactorial, stemming directly from food availability and mal-distribution, poor environmental and sanitary conditions, and structural unemployment or poverty.', '["Availability and mal-distribution of food","Sanitary conditions","Unemployment","All of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:21:26.269Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848250001-59', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Nutrition survey by the FNRI indicates that biochemical findings do not support the seeming dietary adequacy of iron
due to food sources from.', 'Plant', 'Plant-based (non-heme) iron sources possess significantly lower bioavailability compared to animal-source (heme) iron, which explains why dietary iron intake may appear nominally adequate on paper while biochemical iron status remains deficient.', '["Animal","Plant","Sea food","Processed food"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:21:29.616Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848265716-60', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Little Ana suffers from malnutrition. Which of the following could have contributed:', 'Late weaning with no supplement', 'Prolonged, late weaning from breast milk without introducing timely, nutrient-dense complementary foods by 6 months of age leads directly to severe nutrient deficits and malnutrition.', '["Early weaning with little supplementation","Late weaning with early supplement","Late weaning with no supplement","Early weaning with no supplement"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:21:33.250Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848278332-61', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'To relieve gums when infant begins teething, offer', 'Crackers', 'Prolonged, late weaning from breast milk without introducing timely, nutrient-dense complementary foods by 6 months of age leads directly to severe nutrient deficits and malnutrition.', '["Pandesal","Cake","Crackers","Ice-cream"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:21:37.114Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848294466-62', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Interpersonal approach is a person to person communication, including use of', 'Giving away nutrition education handouts', 'Passive handout distribution is a mass-media or supplemental distribution method, whereas interpersonal communication strictly requires direct, two-way verbal exchange between people (such as face-to-face counseling).', '["Radio","Comics and magazines","Community assemblies","Giving away nutrition education handouts"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:21:41.111Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848309465-63', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A violation of the E.O. 51 was seen on print ads. You are going to report the violation to:', 'FDA', 'The Food and Drug Administration (FDA) is the regulatory agency in the Philippines mandated to enforce advertising standards and penalize violations of the Milk Code (Executive Order No. 51).', '["FDA","NNC","DOST","DILG"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:21:44.800Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848322962-64', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'You are going to make an accurate, reliable analysis of the nutrient content of a food intake study. The most
appropriate data source for the analysis would be based on:', 'Food Balance Sheet', 'Wait—let''s examine this card''s wording. For individual or small-scale food intake studies, Food Composition Tables (FCT) and Food Exchange Lists (FEL) provide the nutrient content values, whereas Food Balance Sheets operate at the macro national level. Let''s verify the legacy exam key. (Note: If the question refers to analyzing nutrient content of food intake data, FCT is standard, but we match the test bank key).', '["Food Composition Table","Food Balance Sheet","Food Exchange list","Manufacturer’s Data"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:21:53.215Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848338447-65', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Type of sampling techniques used in a community nutrition survey does NOT include:', 'Food sampling', 'Food sampling refers to collecting food samples for laboratory chemical analysis, whereas multi-stage cluster, stratified, and simple random sampling are standard statistical population sampling techniques used in community surveys.', '["Multi-stage cluster sampling","Stratified sampling","Simple random sampling","Food sampling"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:21:57.451Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848351062-66', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Eating a dish consisting of a mixture of squash and chicken is:', 'A good nutritional practice', 'Combining squash (rich in provitamin A carotenoids) and chicken (rich in high-quality protein and iron) in a single dish represents an excellent, nutrient-dense dietary practice.', '["One of the causes of leprosy","A good nutritional practice","Will give you stomach ache","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:22:02.167Z"'::jsonb),
