('anki-card-1757848389444-68', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'In the Philippines, the severely malnourished with medical complication are usually referred for nutritional
rehabilitation to', 'Malnutrition ward', 'In the Philippines, severely malnourished children presenting with acute medical complications are referred for specialized inpatient care in dedicated hospital malnutrition wards (or stabilization centers).', '["Hospital ward","Malnutrition ward","Nutri-huts","Only b and c"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:22:10.002Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848404844-69', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Food intake of the Filipinos is adequate in', 'Cereals', 'National food consumption surveys in the Philippines consistently show that the Filipino diet is adequate primarily in cereals (rice and corn), which serve as the primary bulk energy source, while frequently falling short in fruits, vegetables, and quality protein foods.

• Roots and tubers / Green leafy vegetables / Fruits: Consistently consumed below recommended optimal levels across national nutritional intake surveys.', '["Roots and tubers","Cereals","Green leafy vegetables","Fruits"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:25:38.840Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848423710-70', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The diet of a child is inadequate. His protein intake will be used', 'For energy', 'When a child''s diet is inadequate in calories and overall energy, dietary protein is diverted away from structural growth, tissue repair, and hormone synthesis, and is instead catabolized and oxidized to be used for energy.

• To synthesize hormones / For growth / For repair: Primary metabolic destinations of protein under conditions of adequate overall energy intake.', '["To synthesize hormones","For growth","For repair","For energy"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:04:44.075Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848442185-71', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Ms. Santos, a food demonstrator prepared excellent guava jelly, pineapple preserves which are good source of', 'Ascorbic acid', 'Guavas and pineapples are exceptionally rich natural sources of Vitamin C (ascorbic acid).

• Vitamin A / Minerals / Carbohydrates: While present in traces, guava and pineapple products are classic high-content sources of ascorbic acid.', '["Vitamin A","Ascorbic acid","Minerals","Carbohydrates"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:05:28.929Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848456024-72', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The nutrition intervention program is the immediate direct approach to attack malnutrition. These are composed of', 'All of the above.', 'Direct approaches to combat malnutrition require multi-faceted interventions comprising nutrition education, direct food assistance, specialized nutrition services, incremental food production, and community growth monitoring.', '["Nutrition education","Food assistance, nutrition and nutrition related services","Incremental food production, growth monitoring","All of the above."]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:25:45.200Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848482824-73', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The following are the methods used in giving nutrition education, except:', 'Advocacy', 'Advocacy is a high-level policy mobilization strategy, whereas food demonstrations, hostess parties, and role-playing are direct methods of delivering nutrition education to groups.', '["Food demonstration","Hostess party","Role playing","Advocacy"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:35:23.422Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848548937-74', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The following are educational media and aids, except:', 'All of the above', 'Real objects, biological specimens, anatomical models, and flannel boards are all standard visual and tactile educational media and aids used in teaching.', '["Real objects and specimen","Models","Flannel board","All of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:35:27.929Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848565253-75', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'You need to monitor progress during a nutrition education implementation you will this kind of evaluation:', 'Process evaluation', 'Process evaluation is conducted during the implementation of a program or education initiative to monitor progress, operational delivery, and immediate operational milestones.

