('anki-card-1757848581268-76', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A person proficient in education, motivation and counselling techniques whose primary role  is to improve nutritional
care to the general population in the community', 'Nutrition educator', 'A nutrition educator is a professional specialized in education, behavioral motivation, and counseling techniques focused on improving public nutritional habits.

