('anki-card-1757848598801-77', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The very first stage in change process', 'Awareness', 'According to the stages of behavior change and adoption models, the very first preliminary stage is achieving awareness of a problem or the need for change.

