('anki-card-1757848651765-80', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The following are types of planning in nutrition programs except:', 'None of the above', 'The choices listed represent valid operational definitions, making "None of the above" correct since no false types of planning are presented.', '["Pre-determined","Joint planning","Self-determined","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:06:29.792Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848669781-81', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The first step need to consider when planning', 'What to do?', 'The foundational step when initiating any planning process is determining "What to do?" (identifying the core problem, scope, and objectives).

• How to do it? / When to do it? / Who has to do what?: Operational implementation steps following initial scope definition.', '["How to do it?","What to do?","When to do it?","Who has to do what?"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:06:35.410Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848681498-82', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'In choosing technologies in planning a program it is best to choose', 'Complex and high technology', 'In community and sustainable program planning, selecting cheap, appropriate, and feasible technologies ensures local adoption, affordability, and long-term sustainability.

• Complex and high technology: Often impractical, costly, and unsustainable in resource-limited settings.', '["Cheap and feasible technologies","Complex and high technology","The use of big equipment","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:06:40.295Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848708863-83', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'It is part of the process of defining a problem', 'Nutrition assessment', 'Nutrition assessment is the systematic diagnostic process of gathering anthropometric, biochemical, clinical, and dietary data that forms part of defining a nutritional problem.

• Implementation / Monitoring / Program evaluation: Subsequent phases of the program management cycle.', '["Nutrition assessment","Nutrition program evaluation","Implementation","Monitoring"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:06:44.608Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848729545-84', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'You are most likely to fail a program if:', 'You lack clear delegation of authority', 'In management and program planning, failing to establish a clear delegation of authority creates operational ambiguity, overlapping duties, and execution failure.', '["You lack clear delegation of authority","You have enough control and monitoring techniques","You have top management support","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:25:50.459Z"'::jsonb),
