community, you are going to:', 'Prioritize problems', 'When multiple community problems contribute to malnutrition, resource constraints make it necessary to prioritize problems based on severity, urgency, and feasibility.', '["Prioritize problems","Ignore other problems that are not important","Choose a problem that is most likely to be solved","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:25:56.711Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848763010-86', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Children with Xerosis suggests that a child has a vitamin A deficiency, this is due to :', 'Diets low in Fat', 'Xerosis and clinical signs of Vitamin A deficiency are exacerbated by diets extremely low in fat, because dietary fats are required for the micellar solubilization, absorption, and transport of fat-soluble vitamins like Vitamin A.

• Diet low in carbohydrate / Diet low in protein: Macro-imbalances that affect overall energy and growth, but lipid availability specifically dictates fat-soluble vitamin absorption efficiency.', '["Diet low in carbohydrate","Diet that is low in protein","Diets low in Fat","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:26:04.648Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848780808-87', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The Philippines has a stunting rate of 30%. This means that stunting in the Philippines has:', 'High public health significance', 'According to WHO classification thresholds for public health indicators, a stunting rate of 30% or higher among children under five represents a high public health significance requiring urgent programmatic attention.

• Low / Medium / No public health significance: Thresholds below 20% represent low or medium public health concern.', '["Low public health significance","High public health significance","No public health significance","Medium public health significance"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:26:13.828Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848808425-88', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Chronic malnutrition may lead to stunting. A child that has been stunted may have a chances of:', 'Low productivity', 'Early childhood stunting causes irreversible physical and cognitive deficits, resulting in diminished human capital, lower adult working capacity, and low economic productivity.

• Reverse stunting by eating nutritious food / Become taller again: Stunting is largely permanent after the critical first 1,000-day window and cannot be fully reversed by later catch-up growth.', '["Low productivity","Reverse stunting by eating nutritious food","Become taller again","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:26:27.078Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848824708-89', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'According to the National Nutrition Survey, there is a very slow decline of stunting rate of pre-schoolers over the past
ten years. This is due to:', 'Some local governments did not invest in nutrition programs', 'The slow decline in national stunting rates over past decades has been attributed heavily to decentralized governance where varying degrees of local government unit (LGU) political will, prioritization, and financial investment in nutrition programs created uneven progress.', '["Some local governments did not invest in nutrition programs","There are no nutrition programs in the Philippines","There are no nutrition workers in all areas in the Philippines","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:35:33.121Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848845907-90', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'This situation will repeat the malnutrition cycle', 'Unemployment and underemployment', 'Unemployment and underemployment drive household poverty, which restricts purchasing power, limits food access, and perpetuates the intergenerational cycle of malnutrition.', '["Planned programs","Unemployment and underemployment","Investing in nutrition","none of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:35:36.802Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848860739-91', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'This program will help solve vitamin A deficiency in a very large population', 'Garantisadong Pambata', 'Garantisadong Pambata is a nationwide DOH synchronized child health campaign delivering high-impact services, including massive Vitamin A capsule distribution to solve deficiency across large pediatric populations.', '["LAKASS","Garantisadong Pambata","Community Gardening","Four P’s"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:35:41.081Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848879921-92', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'When you are requesting a program to be implemented provincial wide, the first local official you will approach is:', 'Governor', 'When requesting province-wide nutrition programs or policy interventions, the primary local chief executive to approach is the provincial Governor.', '["DILG Regional Director","Governor","Mayor","DILG Secretary"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:35:45.202Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848896971-93', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'You are going to ask for help in the assistance of some barangay level nutrition programs, you are going to coordinate
with the:', 'Mayor', 'When requesting administrative assistance, funding, or coordination for municipal-level nutrition programs, the local chief executive to coordinate with is the municipal or city Mayor.', '["Mayor","Vice Mayor","Councilor","All of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:34:47.700Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848914069-94', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'You are going to plan a new nutrition program in a community. To line with the current thrust of the Philippine
Government, you need to refer to the:', 'PPAN', 'When planning new community nutrition programs aligned with current national government directives, nutritionists refer directly to the Philippine Plan of Action for Nutrition (PPAN).', '["Philippine Constitution","PPAN","Barangay ordinances","Local Ordinances"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:34:51.360Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848929184-95', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Examples of food assistance are the following, except:', 'ECCD', '', '["ECCD","Nutripan","Breakfast Feeding Program","Tindahan ni Gloria"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848944451-96', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Examples of food production and distribution are the following, except:', 'Kalusugan para umunlad si Mare', '"Kalusugan para umunlad si Mare" is a health education and maternal health promotion campaign rather than a direct agricultural food production and distribution project (unlike May Gulay, Alay Tanim, or FAITH gardening).', '["May Gulay project","Alay Tanim at Pangkabuhayan","Kalusugan para umunlad si Mare","FAITH"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:35:01.315Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848961550-97', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'These are government agencies that are members of the NNC, except:', 'BOC', 'The Bureau of Customs (BOC) is an operational revenue-collecting agency under the Department of Finance and is not a member agency of the National Nutrition Council governing board.

• DOH / DILG / DTI: Core government agencies sitting on the NNC board.', '["DOH","DILG","DTI","BOC"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:35:08.579Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848975434-98', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'These are direct nutrition interventions, except:', 'Human resource development', 'Human resource development (training personnel and capacity building) is an institutional capacity-building strategy, whereas food formulation, supplementary feeding, and fortification are direct nutritional interventions.', '["Food Formulation","Supplementary Feeding","Food Fortification","Human resource development"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:35:13.694Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757848992383-99', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The following are nutrition-related interventions, except:', 'Advocacy', 'Advocacy is an enabling and mobilizing strategy, whereas growth monitoring, food-for-work, and livelihood assistance are direct operational nutrition-related support interventions.', '["Growth monitoring","Food for work","Livelihood assistance","Advocacy"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.398Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:35:17.357Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849009815-100', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A pathological state resulting from relative lack or absolute deficiency or excess of one or more essential
nutrients.', 'Malnutrition', 'Malnutrition is defined broadly as a pathological state resulting from a relative lack, absolute deficiency, or excess of one or more essential nutrients.

• Overnutrition / Undernutrition: Specific sub-categories of malnutrition.
• Hidden hunger: Micronutrient deficiency states.', '["Overnutrition","Malnutrition","Hidden hunger","Undernutrition"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:05:40.641Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849021415-101', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A pathological state resulting from the consumption of an inadequate quantity of food over an extended
period of time.', 'Undernutrition', 'Undernutrition is a pathological state resulting from the consumption of an inadequate quantity or quality of food over an extended period.

• Overnutrition: Excess caloric intake.
• Specific deficiency: Lack of a singular isolated micronutrient.', '["Imbalance","Overnutrition","Specific deficiency","Undernutrition"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:06:57.389Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849048414-102', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'This indicator is used for evaluating and monitoring nutritional status of infants', 'Weight for age', 'Weight-for-age is the standard anthropometric indicator utilized for routine community evaluation and growth monitoring of infants.

• Height for age: Assesses chronic stunting.
• Birth weight: Evaluates natal status rather than longitudinal infant progress.
• Biochemical signs: Laboratory assessments.', '["Birth weight","Weight for age","Biochemical signs","Height for age"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:05:45.113Z"'::jsonb)
