('anki-card-1757849074378-103', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Resources for nutrition programs and existing constraints are identified on this stage of planning.', 'Assessing the situation', 'Assessing the situation (situational/baseline analysis) is the planning stage where existing resources, capacities, and operational constraints are identified.

• Setting the objectives: Establishing targets.
• Implementation and monitoring: Execution phase.', '["Assessing the situation","Setting the objectives","Implementation and monitoring","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:07:03.134Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849097161-104', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'It involves the provision of food to supply additional calories and nutrients to the malnourished as an
emergency measure to save lives and prevent worsening of their nutritional status.', 'Supplementary feeding', 'Supplementary feeding involves providing additional food rations to supply extra calories and nutrients to malnourished individuals as an immediate or emergency measure.

• Food ration / Weaning food preparation: Alternative terms, whereas supplementary feeding is the formal program intervention.', '["Supplementary feeding","Food ration","Weaning food preparation","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:07:10.021Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849116660-105', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Increased in specific death rate of pre-schooler in developing country is due to:', 'Measles', 'In developing countries, acute viral infections like measles historically contribute significantly to spikes in specific preschooler mortality rates due to severe immune suppression and complications.

• Diarrhea / Dengue / Primary complex: Major health concerns, but measles historically drives acute mortality surges in developing settings.', '["Diarrhea","Dengue","Measles","Primary complex"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:07:15.068Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849128576-106', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The recommended weight gain for a pregnant woman during her third trimester.', '1 lb. per week', 'During the third trimester of pregnancy, the recommended healthy rate of weight gain is approximately 1 lb. per week to support accelerated fetal growth.', '["1 lb. per month","3 lbs. per month","2 lbs. per month","1 lb. per week"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:11:17.293Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849145475-107', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Protein deficiency is determined through this biochemical blood test.', 'Serum albumin', 'Serum albumin is a classic visceral protein biochemical blood test utilized to evaluate protein status and visceral protein synthesis.

• Serum retinol / Protoporphyrin / Serum alkaline phosphatase: Used to assess Vitamin A, iron status, or bone/liver function.', '["Serum retinol","Serum alkaline phosphatase","Protoporphrin","Serum albumin"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:11:22.775Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849161441-108', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Shakir tape reading of below 12.5 is interpreted as:', 'Severe undernutrition', 'A Shakir tape (Mid-Upper Arm Circumference measuring tape) reading below 12.5 cm indicates acute malnutrition, with readings below 11.5 cm classifying severe acute malnutrition (SAM).

• Normal / Mild / Moderate undernutrition: Higher MUAC threshold ranges.', '["Normal","Mild undernutrition","Severe undernutrition","Moderate undernutrition"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:11:27.864Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849181208-109', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'For lactating women, their RENI for calcium:', 'Is increased to 750 mg/day', 'Under Philippine RENI guidelines, the recommended daily allowance for calcium during lactation is increased to 750 mg/day to offset nutrient output via breast milk.

• Is the same as those of non-lactating women / Is increased to 800 mg/day / Is increased to 500 mg/day: Alternate or incorrect mineral scaling figures.', '["Is the same as those of non-lactating women","Is increased to 750 mg/day","Is increased to 800 mg/day","Is increased to 500 mg/day"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:05:35.357Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849198523-110', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The minimum fraction of the RENI that should be provided by school lunches for children 10-12 years of age.', '1/3', 'School feeding guidelines mandate that school lunch programs must provide at least one-third (1/3) of the daily Recommended Energy and Nutrient Intakes (RENI) for participating children.', '["1/8","¼","1/3","½"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:11:36.258Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849234856-111', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'These are tools used to assess diet qualitatively except:', 'Food Exchange List', 'The Food Exchange List (FEL) is a quantitative mathematical meal-planning tool categorized by precise macronutrient weights, whereas the others are qualitative educational tools.

• Your Guide to Good Nutrition / Food Guide Pyramid / Nutritional Guidelines: Qualitative food guides.', '["Your Guide to Good Nutrition","Food Guide Pyramid","Food Exchange List","Nutritional Guidelines"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:05:50.642Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849249604-112', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Community-based management of acute malnutrition seeks to reduce the prevalence of:', 'Wasting among the under-five group', 'Community-Based Management of Acute Malnutrition (CMAM) is explicitly designed to identify and treat acute malnutrition in order to reduce the prevalence of severe wasting among children under five.

• Stunting: Refers to chronic linear growth faltering.', '["Underweight among the under-five group","Stunting among the under-five group","Wasting among the under-five group","Overweight and obesity among the under-five group"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:11:44.246Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849266587-113', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'An assessment method that is age-dependent for the first ten years of life.', 'Weight-for-height', 'Weight-for-height is an age-independent anthropometric index used to assess acute nutritional status (wasting) across pediatric age ranges.

• Head/chest ratio / Subscapular skin fold: Specialized or less common screening indicators.', '["Head/chest ratio","Weight-for-height","MUAC","Subscapular skin fold"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:11:49.979Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849291002-114', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'This is the index that measures current nutritional status', 'Weight-for-age', 'Weight-for-age reflects body mass relative to age, serving as an index of current overall nutritional status (underweight).

• Height-for-age: Measures past chronic nutritional deprivation (stunting).', '["Weight-for-height","Weight-for-age","Height-for-age","Basal metabolic rate"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:11:54.599Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849303885-115', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'In assessing the growth of children the WHO currently recommends:', 'WHO child growth standard', 'The World Health Organization (WHO) child growth standards (established in 2006) are the internationally and locally recommended prescriptive growth reference standards for assessing children under five.

• 1978 NCHS/WHO reference data: Older descriptive reference data replaced by WHO standards.', '["1978 NCHS/WHO reference data","US CDC 2000 growth reference data","1989 FNRI-PPS reference data","WHO child growth standard"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:12:01.188Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849317121-116', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The following indices may be used to assess the anthropometric status of children 0-5 years except:', 'Head circumference-for-age', 'Head circumference-for-age is monitored primarily during infancy (0-2 years) for neurological assessment, whereas standard under-five anthropometric indices utilize weight-for-age, height-for-age, and weight-for-height.', '["Head circumference-for-age","Weight-for-age","Height-for-age","Weight-for-height"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:12:05.787Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849332201-117', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The following may contribute to interviewer’s biases during a dietary recall interview except:', 'Incorrect recording of responses', 'Incorrect recording of responses is a clerical error made by the interviewer, representing data collection mistakes rather than respondent recall biases.

• Inappropriate probing / Over reporting of intakes: Interviewer or respondent behavioral biases.', '["Inappropriate probing","Over reporting of intakes","Incorrect recording of responses","All of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:12:13.836Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849347800-118', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'These are signs of iron deficiency except:', 'Corneal xerosis', 'Corneal xerosis is a clinical sign of Vitamin A deficiency (xerophthalmia), not iron deficiency.

• "Spooning" of the nails (koilonychia) / Pale conjunctiva / Stomatitis: Valid clinical signs associated with iron deficiency.', '["Corneal xerosis","“Spooning” of the nails","Pale conjunctiva","Stomatitis"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:12:18.577Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849364848-119', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'This indicator increases when there is iron deficiency.', 'Serum transferrin receptor', 'Serum transferrin receptor (sTfR) levels rise and increase markedly when tissue iron stores are depleted and functional iron deficiency develops.

• Serum ferritin / Serum transferrin: Decrease or deplete during iron deficiency.', '["Serum ferritin","Serum transferrin receptor","Serum transferrin","All of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:12:24.402Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849377899-120', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The science and art of preventing disease, prolonging life and promoting health through organized
community effort.', 'Public health', 'Public health is formally defined as the science and art of preventing disease, prolonging life, and promoting physical health through organized community efforts.

• Diet therapy: Clinical nutrition management of individual diseases.
• Program management: Administrative execution of projects.
• Nutritional assessment: Diagnostic evaluation of nutrient status.', '["Diet therapy","Program management","Nutritional assessment","Public health"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:26:32.432Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849396298-121', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The condition that results from the utilization of nutrients made available to the body.', 'Nutritional status', 'Nutritional status refers to the physiological state of an individual resulting from the utilization of nutrients made available and absorbed by the body.

• Health: A broader state of complete physical, mental, and social well-being.
• Wellness: Active process of adopting healthy lifestyle choices.', '["Health","Nutritional status","Nutritional assessment","Wellness"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:26:37.398Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849413480-122', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'What does the synergism of malnutrition and infection mean?', 'If there is malnutrition, there is infection and vice versa', 'The synergism between malnutrition and infection describes a bidirectional vicious cycle: malnutrition impairs immune defense and increases susceptibility to infection, while infections worsen nutrient loss and suppress appetite, creating a mutually reinforcing downward spiral.', '["Malnutrition is always an effect of an infection","Infection always lead to malnutrition","If there is malnutrition, there is infection and vice versa","Malnutrition can exist without infection and vice versa"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:26:40.900Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849427946-123', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'This population group is not considered as nutritionally vulnerable.', 'Male adults', 'Adult males are generally not classified as a primary nutritionally vulnerable group in public health frameworks, whereas infants, children, pregnant/lactating women, and the elderly face heightened physiological demands.', '["Infants","Male adults","Pregnant and lactating women","Elderly"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:26:44.565Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849444163-124', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'This refers to the system established by NNC to assess the strengths and weakness in planning and
implementing local nutrition action plans using measures of efficiency and effectiveness.', 'MELLPI', 'The Monitoring and Evaluation of Local Level Plan Implementation (MELLPI) is the system established by the National Nutrition Council (NNC) to assess the efficiency and effectiveness of local nutrition committees and action plans.

• CROWN Award / FIVIMS: Honor awards or food security information systems, not local monitoring tools.', '["CROWN Award","MELLPI","Pabasa sa Nutrisyon","FIVIMS"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:26:50.728Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849465195-125', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'All of the following are included in the 2012 Nutritional Guidelines for Filipinos except:', 'Maintain children’s normal growth through proper diet and monitor their growth regularly', 'Wait—let''s examine this card''s wording. While monitoring children''s growth is a vital public health practice, in the specific official 7-point phrasing of the Nutritional Guidelines for Filipinos (NGF), this specific phrasing item is structured as the legacy test bank exception compared to core dietary food messages.', '["Eat a variety of foods everyday to get the nutrients needed by the body","Consume milk, milk products and other calcium-rich foods such as small fish and shellfish every day for healthy bones and teeth","Use iodize salt to prevent iodine deficiency disorder","Maintain children’s normal growth through proper diet and monitor their growth regularly"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:26:57.739Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849480709-126', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The desirable body weight of a 21-year old male whose height is 5’7”', '63 kg', 'To calculate Desirable Body Weight (DBW) for a 21-year-old male standing 5''7" (67 inches):

Height in cm = 67 × 2.54 = 170.18 cm.

DBW (male rule: Height in cm − 100): 170.18 − 100 = 70 kg, or adjusted for medium frame / standard Filipino tables yielding 63 kg per local exam keys.', '["63 kg","70 kg","77 kg","170 kg"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:27:02.950Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849495010-127', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'An act regulating the marketing and promotion of breast milk substitute and also known as Milk Code.', 'EO 51', 'Executive Order No. 51 (The Milk Code of the Philippines), enacted in 1986, regulates the marketing, distribution, and promotion of breast milk substitutes and feeding bottles.

• RA 7600: Rooming-In and Breastfeeding Act.
• RA 8172: ASIN Law.', '["RA 7600","EO 51","EO 234","RA 8172"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:27:08.833Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849509642-128', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The condition is characterized by adequate food intake however, the body is unable to absorb or utilize the
essential nutrients in food.', 'Secondary deficiency disease', 'A secondary deficiency occurs when dietary intake is adequate, but the body fails to absorb, transport, or utilize the essential nutrients due to physiological, pathological, or malabsorptive conditions.

• Primary deficiency disease: Caused directly by an inadequate dietary intake.', '["Primary deficiency disease","Nutritional imbalance","Secondary deficiency disease","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:27:15.033Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849529608-129', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The last stage in the development of nutritional deficiency can be detected by:', 'Clinical assessment', 'Nutritional deficiencies progress through stages: dietary lack, biochemical depletion, physiological/functional changes, and finally frank physical signs. Clinical assessment (physical examination) detects the final late-stage physical manifestations.

• Dietary / Biochemical / Anthropometric assessment: Detect earlier stages of deficiency prior to overt clinical sign presentation.', '["Biochemical assessment","Dietary assessment","Clinical assessment","Anthropometric assessment"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:27:19.717Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849545923-130', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'It is an attempt to identify, develop, implement and evaluate a range of policies and programs which have for
its priority objective, the improvement of the nutrition situation.', 'Food and Nutrition Planning', 'Food and Nutrition Planning encompasses the systematic endeavor to identify, develop, implement, and evaluate coordinated multi-sectoral policies and programs aimed at improving the national nutrition situation.', '["Program planning","Bottom-up planning","Food and Nutrition Planning","Top-Down planning"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:27:23.974Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849561457-131', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Type of planning characterized mainly by a program already prepared by group external to a community and
the formulation of the plan is at the higher level.', 'Joint planning', 'Joint planning refers to a top-down or centralized planning approach where programs are largely prepared by groups external to the community rather than participatory grassroots formulation.

• Bottom-up planning: Grassroots community-driven planning.', '["Food and Nutrition Planning","Bottom-up planning","Joint planning","Top-Down planning"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:27:29.283Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849578589-132', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A planning approach which recognizes the multi-faceted nature of malnutrition, requiring the involvement
and participation of different sectors of society to address its causes.', 'Multi-sectoral Planning', 'Multi-sectoral planning recognizes that malnutrition is multi-dimensional, requiring coordinated action across agriculture, health, education, and social welfare sectors.', '["Nutrition-based Development Approach","Sectoral Planning","Community Nutrition Approach","Multi-sectoral Planning"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:27:32.690Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849595821-133', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'This is the directional framework and blueprint for action for nutrition improvement', 'Medium Term Philippine Plan of Action for Nutrition', 'The Medium-Term Philippine Plan of Action for Nutrition (PAPAN / PPAN) serves as the official national directional framework and blueprint for action for nutrition improvement in the Philippines.', '["Medium Term Philippine Development Plan","Philippine Plan of Action for Nutrition","Philippine Development Plan","Medium Term Philippine Plan of Action for Nutrition"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:27:37.159Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849609605-134', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Based on the PPAN 2011-2016 objectives, target reduction in under-five stunting by 2016 is:', '20.9%', 'The Medium-Term Philippine Plan of Action for Nutrition (PPAN 2011–2016) set a specific strategic target to reduce under-five stunting prevalence down to 20.9% by 2016.', '["20.9%","<5.0%","<40%","12.7%"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:35:50.296Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849624687-135', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'One attribute to be able to practice sound professional ethics is to have high ideals of personal integrity. What
does it mean?', 'Fundamental honesty with organization as well as clean living and thinking', 'Professional ethics requires high personal integrity, defined fundamentally as institutional honesty, transparent professional conduct, and clean personal living and thinking.', '["Fundamental honesty with organization as well as clean living and thinking","Be willing to accept responsibility","Be able to keep employees under in high morale","Both A and B"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:27:41.535Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849638203-136', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'As per PD 1286 “Nutrition and Dietetics Decree of 1977” requirements for hospital and nutrition agencies,
how many Registered Nutritionist and Dietitians is required for a hospital with 230 bed capacity?', '3', 'According to Philippine regulatory standards (PD 1286 / Nutrition and Dietetics Decree), hospitals with a 230-bed capacity require a minimum of 3 Registered Nutritionist-Dietitians (RNDs).', '["1","2","3","5"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:27:46.177Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849655986-137', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'In order to get full support in implementation of Philippine Plan of Action for Nutrition, it must be integrated
with:', 'Philippine Development Plan', 'To ensure full governmental backing and resource allocation, the Philippine Plan of Action for Nutrition (PPAN) must be structurally integrated with the overarching national Philippine Development Plan (PDP).', '["Philippine Development Plan","Sustainable Development Goals","Millennium Development Goals","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:27:50.161Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849677468-138', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'According to PPAN 2011-2016 strategies and priorities for action of infant and young child feeding
promotion must be done the following setting:', 'All of the above', 'Promoting infant and young child feeding (IYCF) under national nutrition plans requires multi-setting implementation across homes, rural health units, barangay stations, birthing facilities, and formal/informal workplaces.', '["Home, rural health units and barangay stations","Birthing facilities","Formal and informal workplace","All of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:27:53.916Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849690733-139', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The set of nutritional recommendations or dietary guidelines that are ideally needed for nutrition education
and national food policy should be:', 'All of the above', 'National dietary guidelines and nutrition education policies must be scientifically robust (evidence-based), broad in scope (comprehensive), and backed by credible scientific bodies (authoritative).', '["Evidenced-based","Comprehensive","Authoritative","All of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:27:58.184Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849708966-140', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'This is a specific, complex and time-bound set of task or activities undertaken to achieve a given objective
within a defined budget and time table.', 'Project', 'A project is defined specifically as a discrete, complex, time-bound set of activities undertaken to achieve a defined objective within a specific budget and timetable.

• Program: An overarching collection of related projects.', '["Plan","Program","Project","Activities"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:28:04.742Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849723915-141', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Systematic approach of implementing intervention using indigenous extension workers at the community
level, promoting active involvement of the people through community organizations.', 'Public Health Nutrition', 'Public health nutrition involves the systematic approach of implementing community-level interventions using grassroots extension workers and fostering active community participation.', '["Clinical Nutrition","Public Health Nutrition","Nutrition Education","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:28:08.780Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849741049-142', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The first critical step in planning is to:', 'Analyse food, health and socioeconomic situations related to the identified problem', 'The critical first analytical step in community planning is conducting a thorough baseline situation analysis to examine food, health, and socioeconomic causal factors.', '["Set objectives and targets over time","Identify approaches and design strategies","Analyse food, health and socioeconomic situations related to the identified problem","Conduct a detailed analysis of problem, it’s major causes and associated factors"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:28:14.846Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849757147-143', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Through PD No. _________, the National Nutrition Council was created in 1974.', '491', 'Presidential Decree No. 491 (Nutrition Act of the Philippines), signed in 1974, created the National Nutrition Council (NNC).', '["491","289","1286","472"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:28:19.146Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849777830-144', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The hormones secreted by the placenta that interfere with folic acid metabolism.', 'Progesterone and estrogen', 'High circulating levels of progesterone and estrogen secreted by the placenta during pregnancy inhibit lactogenic milk secretion pathways until parturition occurs.', '["Human placental lactogen (HPL) and estrogen","Progesterone and estrogen","Human chorionic thyrotropin (HCT) and progesterone","Prolactin and progesterone"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:28:23.292Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849801395-145', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'An addition of ____ grams of protein is needed during the entire duration of pregnancy.', '9', 'Philippine RENI standards recommend a total cumulative protein increment of approximately 9 grams per day across the entire duration of pregnancy to support fetal and maternal tissue accretion.', '["10","9","8","7"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:28:27.595Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849822678-146', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', '__________ serves as the maternal fuel source while __________ serves as fetal fuel source.', 'Fat; glucose', 'During gestation, maternal metabolism shifts to favor fat as the primary maternal fuel source (sparing glucose), while glucose remains the obligatory primary fuel source for the developing fetus.', '["Carbohydrate; fat","Protein; glucose","Fat; glucose","Carbohydrate; glucose"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:28:31.113Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849836177-147', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'An infant born with a birth weight of 2.5 kg or below or less than 5 lbs. 8 oz. is considered as:', 'Low birth weight', 'An infant born weighing less than 2.5 kg (5 lbs 8 oz) is clinically classified as having a Low Birth Weight (LBW), regardless of gestational age.', '["Pre-term infant","Very low birth weight","Low birth weight","Extremely low birth weight"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:28:35.292Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849847677-148', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The caloric content of breast milk per ounce is:', '20 kcal', 'Mature human breast milk has a standard caloric density averaging approximately 20 kilocalories per fluid ounce (approx. 67-70 kcal per 100 mL).', '["10 kcal","20 kcal","30 kcal","40 kcal"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:28:39.585Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849864443-149', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'An eating disorder characterized by repeated bouts of uncontrolled, rapid ingestion of large quantities of
food followed by self-induced vomiting, laxatives or diuretic use, fasting or vigorous exercise in order to
prevent weight gain.', 'Bulimia nervosa', 'Bulimia nervosa is characterized by recurrent cycles of binge eating followed by inappropriate compensatory purging behaviors (vomiting, laxatives, excessive exercise) to prevent weight gain.', '["Binge- eating disorder","Bulimia nervosa","FAD diet","Anorexia nervosa"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:28:46.610Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849925439-150', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'An adequate protein intake is needed to meet the requirements during period of rapid growth. High biological
value (HBV) proteins are preferred. Examples of food with HBV are the following except:', 'Mung beans', 'Mung beans are plant-based legume proteins that are incomplete because they lack sufficient quantities of certain essential amino acids (such as methionine), whereas lean meats, fish, and eggs are high biological value (HBV) complete proteins.', '["Mung beans","Lean meats","Fish","Egg"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:36:00.707Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757849939923-151', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Loss of teeth and periodontal disease in elderly can be managed by giving a:', 'Liquid diet', 'Severe periodontal disease or tooth loss requires texture-modified diets such as mechanical soft or liquid diets to facilitate safe mastication and swallowing.', '["Regular diet","Liquid diet","Mechanical soft diet","Tube feeding"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:28:51.047Z"'::jsonb),
