('anki-card-1757849998453-153', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The research design to use depends on:', '1, 2 &4', 'The appropriate research design depends strictly on the study objectives, the nature of the research problem, and available operational resources (budget and manpower), whereas data processing is handled post-design.', '["Study objectives","Research problem","Data processing","Budget and manpower available","1, 2 & 3","2, 3 & 4","1, 3 & 4","1, 2 &4"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:28:59.584Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850013200-154', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A study will be conducted to test the effects on the fat content of fried liempo using two different frying
techniques. The appropriate research design to use is:', 'Experimental research', 'Testing the effects of two different frying techniques on fat content involves active manipulation of variables under controlled conditions, classifying it as experimental research.', '["Experimental research","Observation studies","Correlational research","Descriptive survey"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:29:18.351Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850029685-155', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Pinggang Pinoy Food Guide complements and supplements __________.', 'Food Pyramid', 'The Pinggang Pinoy (Plate Model) serves as a visual, proportional food guide that complements and supplements the traditional Food Guide Pyramid.', '["Your Guide to Good Nutrition","Food Composition Table","Food Pyramid","Recommended Energy and Nutrient Intakes"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:29:23.813Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850055366-156', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The diet planning principle that refers to the concept of providing enough but not too much of a substance.', 'Moderation', 'The dietary planning principle of moderation refers to providing enough of a substance without excess (avoiding overconsumption).

• Balance: Eating foods from all food groups.
• Variety: Choosing different foods within each food group.
• Adequacy: Providing all essential nutrients in sufficient amounts.', '["Balance","Moderation","Variety","Adequacy"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:29:28.702Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850078432-157', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The recommended amount of fish and alternatives for adults (19 – 59 y/o) based on the Pinggang Pinoy.', '½ slice', 'Based on the Pinggang Pinoy visual food guide for healthy Filipino adults, the recommended portion for fish and fish alternatives per meal is approximately one-half (1/2) slice of medium-sized fish.', '["1 slice","½ slice","2 pieces","3 pieces"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:29:32.190Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850106148-158', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Dietary requirement is the minimum amount of energy and nutrients needed to attain good health under
specific conditions such as:
I. Age
II. Weight
III. Physical activity
IV. Sex
V. Physiological conditions', 'I, II, III, IV & V', 'Dietary requirements represent the minimum physiological intake needed to maintain health, varying based on age, weight, physical activity, sex, and physiological conditions (pregnancy, lactation).', '["I, II & III","I, II, III & IV","I, II, III, IV & V","I, II, IV & V"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:29:36.809Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850123412-159', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'This is the process of developing highly nutritious foods for the nutritionally at risk groups', 'Food formulation', 'Food formulation is the specialized food science process of developing, blending, and fortifying highly nutritious food products tailored for vulnerable population groups.', '["Food fortification","Food subsidy","Food formulation","Food assistance"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:29:40.296Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850138496-160', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Based on the RENI, what is the percent adequacy energy intake of a 25 year-old male with an intake of 2400
kcal?', '96%', 'To calculate percentage adequacy relative to standard recommendations (assuming a reference RENI baseline of ~2,500 kcal for an active 25-year-old male):

Intake = 2,400 kcal.

% Adequacy = (2,400 ÷ 2,500) × 100 = 96%.', '["84%","96%","100%","110%"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:29:44.832Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850157261-161', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'It refers to clinical signs of VAD:', 'Xerophalmia', 'Xerophthalmia is the formal medical term encompassing the entire spectrum of clinical ocular signs associated with Vitamin A deficiency (including night blindness, Bitot''s spots, and corneal xerosis/keratomalacia).', '["Keratomalacia","Xerophalmia","Xerosis","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:29:49.184Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850180493-162', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The symptoms for the deficiency of this vitamin are RBC breakage and nerve damage', 'Vitamin E', 'Vitamin E acts as a vital cellular antioxidant protecting red blood cell membranes from oxidative hemolysis; deficiency leads to erythrocyte hemolysis and neurological nerve damage.', '["Vitamin A","Vitamin E","Vitamin C","Folate"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:29:53.634Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850266507-163', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The prevalence of underweight 0 – 5 years old children ___________ compared to the 2008 NNS.', 'Decreased', 'National Nutrition Surveys conducted by the Food and Nutrition Research Institute (FNRI) document a progressive downward trend in the national prevalence of underweight among children aged 0 to 5 years.', '["Increased","Decreased","Remained the same","Doubled"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:29:57.399Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850306589-164', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The regions with significantly higher prevalence of both underweight and stunting among the 5 – 10 year old
children than the national average are:
I. Bicol
II. NCR
III. Eastern Visayas
IV. CAR
V. CALABARZON
VI. Zamboanga Peninsula', 'I, III & VI', 'National Nutrition Survey (NNS) geographical disaggregation data identifies regions consistently exhibiting significantly higher prevalence rates of both underweight and stunting among school-age children (5-10 years old) relative to national averages, specifically including Bicol (Region V), Eastern Visayas (Region VIII), and Zamboanga Peninsula (Region IX).

• NCR / CAR / CALABARZON: Generally exhibit lower or mixed stunting and underweight prevalence rates compared to economically depressed island and regional groups.', '["I, II & III","I, III & V","I, IV & VI","I, III & VI"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:32:04.495Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850323038-165', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The prevalence of overweight 5-10 years old children __________ compared to the 2008 NNS.', 'Decreased', 'Comparative analysis between successive FNRI National Nutrition Survey cycles documented a downward trend in the prevalence of overweight among school-aged children (5-10 years old).', '["Increased","Decreased","Remained the same","Doubled"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:32:07.585Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850339754-166', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The prevalence of overweight and obese among adults in 2013 is positively related to:', 'Wealth', 'Epidemiological data from national nutrition surveys consistently reveal that the prevalence of overweight and obesity among adults correlates positively with higher household wealth and socio-economic status.

• Age / Place of residence: While influential, socioeconomic wealth gradient is a predominant driver of adult obesity trends in developing transitions.', '["Wealth","Age","Place of residence","All of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:32:14.062Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850360703-167', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'From 2008 to 2013, there is a/an _________ trend of high waist circumference and a/an _________ trend of high
waist to hip ratio for both males and females.', 'Increasing, decreasing', 'National nutrition survey tracking among adults indicates an increasing trend in high waist circumference (abdominal adiposity) coupled with a decreasing or shifting trend in waist-to-hip ratio profiles across specific demographic cohorts.', '["Increasing, increasing","Decreasing, increasing","Increasing, decreasing","Decreasing, decreasing"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:32:19.051Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850387252-168', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The prevalence of nutritionally at risk pregnant women in 2013 __________ compared to the 2008 NNS.', 'Decreased', 'FNRI National Nutrition Surveys demonstrated a progressive decrease in the overall national prevalence of nutritionally at-risk pregnant women.', '["Increased","Decreased","Remained the same","Doubled"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:32:23.390Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850402433-169', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The prevalence of anemia is of high magnitude and considered a public health-problem among _________.', '6 months to <1 year old children and pregnant women', 'Public health surveillance data classify iron deficiency anemia as a severe public health problem of high magnitude primarily among infants aged 6 months to under 1 year and pregnant women.', '["6 months to <1 year old children and pregnant women","6-12 year old children and adolescents","Adults and elderly","Children and lactating mothers"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:32:27.150Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850417416-170', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The prevalence of anemia among children, pregnant and lactating mother _________ in 2013 compared to 2008
NNS.', 'Decreased', 'Nutritional survey evaluations record an overall declining trend in anemia prevalence across vulnerable cohorts such as children and lactating mothers over recent survey intervals.', '["Increased","Decreased","Remained the same","Doubled"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:32:31.381Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850440566-171', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The typical Filipino household diet contains the following except:', 'Meat', 'The traditional and predominant Filipino household diet centers around rice (cereals), vegetables, and fish/marine products, whereas meat consumption constitutes a smaller proportion due to economic availability.

• Rice / Vegetables / Fish: Core staples of the typical Filipino household diet.', '["Rice","Vegetables","Meat","Fish"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:32:36.913Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850456099-172', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Lowest region with the lowest prevalence of alcohol consumption is found in _________.', 'ARMM', 'National health and nutrition surveys consistently report the Autonomous Region in Muslim Mindanao (ARMM) as having the lowest regional prevalence of alcohol consumption, heavily influenced by cultural and religious practices.', '["CAR","ARMM","Eastern Visayas","MIMAROPA"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:32:46.961Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850471680-173', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A rough measure of mortality because it is largely influenced by age and sex composition of the population.', 'Crude death rate', 'The Crude Death Rate (CDR) is a rough overall measure of mortality because it is unadjusted and heavily influenced by the underlying age and sex structural composition of the population.

• Age-specific death rate: Adjusted for specific age cohorts.', '["Cause-specific mortality","Prevalence rate of deaths","Crude death rate","Age-specific death rate"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:32:52.932Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850486113-174', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'This phase of COPAR consist of activities such as site selection, preliminary social investigation, networking
with local government units, NGOs and others.', 'Pre-entry phase', 'The pre-entry phase of Community Organizing Participatory Action Research (COPAR) encompasses preliminary groundwork, including site selection, initial social investigation, and networking with local government units and NGOs.

• Entry phase: Involves actual physical integration into the community.', '["Pre-entry phase","Organization-building phase","Entry phase","Community action phase"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:32:59.135Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850501879-175', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'It mandated the mandatory fortification of staples and voluntary fortification of foods through the Sangkap
Pinoy Seal Program.', 'RA 8976', 'Republic Act No. 8976 (Philippine Food Fortification Act of 2000) mandates the fortification of staple foods (rice and wheat flour with iron/vitamin A, oil and sugar with vitamin A) and establishes voluntary guidelines through the Sangkap Pinoy Seal Program.

• RA 8172: The ASIN Law (salt iodization).
• RA 8980: Early Childhood Care and Development Act.', '["RA 8172","RA 8980","RA 8976","RA 7394"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:33:04.959Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850515696-176', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The following are short term nutrition intervention except:', 'Nutrition education', 'Nutrition education is a long-term behavioral and educational strategy, whereas supplementary feeding, operation timbang, and micronutrient supplementation represent immediate short-term nutrition interventions.', '["Supplementary feeding","Nutrition education","Operation timbang","Micronutrient supplementation"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:33:08.501Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850531528-177', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'If PD 491 is an example of a Nutrition Policy; PPAN as Nutrition Plan and NNEP as Nutrition Program, a good
example of Nutrition Activity is __________.', 'Promotion of IYCF', 'PPAN represents a macro Nutrition Plan, and EO 51 / Sangkap Pinoy represent policy frameworks, whereas the promotion of Infant and Young Child Feeding (IYCF) is a concrete, operational community Nutrition Activity.', '["Sangkap Pinoy Seal","Philippine Food Fortification Strategic Plan","Promotion of IYCF","EO 51"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:33:13.331Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850548226-178', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'When an infant reaches six months of age, this nutrient reserve is almost depleted:', 'Iron', 'Infants are born with congenital iron stores derived from maternal transfer that are sufficient for approximately the first 4 to 6 months of life, after which they are almost entirely depleted and require exogenous iron-rich complementary foods.

• Calcium / Vitamin A / Fat: Maintained via breast milk and hepatic reserves, whereas iron stores deplete rapidly around 6 months.', '["Fat","Iron","Calcium","Vitamin A"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:33:18.606Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850561744-179', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The haemoglobin value for non-pregnant women below which anemia is said to exist:', '12g/100ml', 'According to WHO public health criteria, anemia in non-pregnant adult women is diagnosed when hemoglobin concentrations fall below 12 g/100 mL (12 g/dL).

• 13g/100ml: Adult male anemia threshold.
• 11g/100ml: Pregnant woman anemia threshold.', '["13g/100ml","12g/100ml","11g/100ml","10g/100ml"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:33:23.451Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850575543-180', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The WHO-Multiple Growth Reference Standards,', 'Defines how children should grow', 'The WHO Child Growth Standards (Multi-center Growth Reference Study) are prescriptive standards that establish how children should grow under optimal environmental, health, and nutritional conditions.', '["Describes how children grow","Describes why children need to grow","Defines how children should grow","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:28:42.814Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850591159-181', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Infectious disease and inadequate diet also interacts synergistically, each aggravating the effects of the other
to produce what referred to as:', 'Malnutrition and Infection Cycle', 'The synergistic, mutually aggravating interaction between infectious diseases and inadequate dietary intake is clinically termed the Malnutrition-Infection Cycle.', '["Causal Model of Malnutrition","Ecology of Food and Nutrition","Nutrition in the Life Stages","Malnutrition and Infection Cycle"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:33:32.510Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850603908-182', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Agency that assists in the establishment of functional nutrition committees in every region, province, city,
municipality and barangay.', 'DILG', 'The Department of the Interior and Local Government (DILG) is the executive agency mandated to assist local government units in establishing functional nutrition committees across all administrative tiers.', '["DA","DSWD","DOH","DILG"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:33:36.781Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850619724-183', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'As a community organizer, a nutritionist-dietitian engages in:', 'Discovering potential leaders in the community', 'A core principle of community organizing for a nutritionist-dietitian is empowering the community by discovering, identifying, and fostering potential grassroots leaders.', '["Helping people to alleviate their problem","Supervising field personnel","Discovering potential leaders in the community","Knowing the local leaders in the community"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:33:41.857Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850639740-184', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Underlying cause of malnutrition except:', 'Presence of infection and other disease', 'In the conceptual framework of malnutrition, underlying causes include inadequate household food security, poor environmental sanitation, and inadequate maternal/child care. The presence of infection is classified as an immediate biological cause rather than an underlying cause.', '["Poor environmental sanitation","Inadequate food supply in the area","Presence of infection and other disease","Inadequate income to buy the right kind and amount of food"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:33:45.418Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850658272-185', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Behaviour change in the individual occurs in stages. The first stage involve:', 'Awareness of need of change', 'According to behavioral adoption models, the mandatory first stage in individual behavior change is achieving cognitive awareness of the problem and the need for change.', '["Acquiring information","A desire to change behaviour in others","Awareness of need of change","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:33:49.712Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850671321-186', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Feeding problem of pre-schoolers who play with food during meal times.', 'Dawdling', 'Dawdling (playing with food, slow eating, and dragging out meal times) is a classic behavioral feeding problem commonly observed among preschoolers.

