('anki-card-1757850688871-187', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The continuous assessment of nutritional status in order to detect changes in the trends or distribution of
malnourished case so that corrective measures can be implemented.', 'Nutrition surveillance', 'Nutrition surveillance is the continuous, systematic collection and assessment of nutritional status data to track trends, detect shifts, and guide corrective public health policy measures.

• Nutrition screening: Rapid triage to identify individuals at immediate risk.', '["Nutritional epidemiology","Nutrition screening","Nutrition monitoring","Nutrition surveillance"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:33:59.137Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850707120-188', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'It is not a component of Burke dietary history method of measuring individual food intake.', 'Food inventory', 'The Burke dietary history method integrates a 24-hour recall, a 3-day food record, and a cross-check food frequency questionnaire. A food inventory is used in household-level supply assessments, making it the correct exception.', '["24-hour recall","day food recall","Food inventory","Food frequency questionnaire"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:34:03.529Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850721485-189', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'Goiter is considered endemic if:', '10% of the population have goiter Grade 1 or above', 'According to WHO epidemiological criteria, an iodine deficiency disorder like goiter is classified as endemic in a community if 10% or more of the surveyed population presents with palpable or visible goiter (Grade 1 or above).', '["10% of the population have goiter Grade 1 or above","12% of the population have goiter Grade 1 or above","5% of the population have goiter Grade 1 or above","15% of the population have goiter Grade 1 or above"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:34:08.303Z"'::jsonb),
