• Tap water / Rain water from open drum / Open well: Risk contamination with pathogens.', '["1 glass tap water","1 glass rain water from an open drum","1 glass bottled water","1 glass of water form an open well"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:34:15.492Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850752300-191', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'All are macro minerals except:', 'Zinc', 'Zinc is classified as a trace element (micromineral), whereas sodium, sulfur, and chloride are major minerals (macrominerals) required in larger daily quantities.', '["Sodium","Sulphur","Zinc","Chloride"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:34:19.013Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850770966-192', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'A “calorie-free” claim in food label means:', 'It contains less than 5kcal/serving', 'According to FDA food labeling regulations, a "calorie-free" nutritional claim means the food item contains fewer than 5 kilocalories per standardized serving.', '["It does not contain calories","It contains less than 5kcal/serving","It contains <40 kcal/serving","It contains <10 kcal/serving"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.919Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:34:24.278Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757850787765-193', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608745420-1790433140510-u6mf8', 'The energy density of 450 grams breakfast provides 500 kcal. Its energy density is:', '1 kcal/g', 'To calculate energy density:

