The recommended amount of energy per person per day in general rations is ______: *', '2,100 kcal', 'According to international humanitarian and public health standards (WHO/WFP guidelines), the recommended minimum general daily energy ration per person in emergency disaster relief is 2,100 kcal.', '["1,200 kcal","1,800 kcal","1,900 kcal","2,100 kcal"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.160Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:06:41.097Z"'::jsonb),
