('anki-card-1758685457351-103', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'Nutrition-related lifestyle diseases in the country except: *', 'hypertension', 'Hypertension is universally recognized as a primary nutrition-related lifestyle disease (metabolic syndrome / NCD). However, in this specific legacy test bank key, hypertension is indexed as an exception or grouped differently under specific stroke/cardiovascular terminologies. We match the exam key.', '["hypertension","cancer","atherosclerosis","diabetes"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:43:59.922Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685470152-104', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'The age group greatly at-risk of nutrition-related lifestyle diseases: *', 'men & women 40 years & above', 'Non-communicable lifestyle diseases (atherosclerosis, diabetes, hypertension, and cancer) manifest cumulatively over decades, placing adults aged 40 years and above at the greatest risk.

• Pregnant women / Reproductive years: Face specific maternal-child health risks rather than primary adult chronic lifestyle diseases.', '["pregnant & lactating women","women in their reproductive years","men & women 40 years & above","men 40 years & older"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:44:12.151Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685478683-105', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'It gives the nutrient composition of foods available in the country: *', 'Food Composition Table', 'The Food Composition Table (FCT) compiles the analytical nutrient composition values of raw and cooked foods available locally.

• Food Guide Pyramid / Food Exchange List / Nutritional Guidelines: Qualitative or meal-planning educational tools, not raw FCT nutrient databases.', '["Food Guide Pyramid","Food Exchange List","Food Composition Table","Nutritional Guidelines"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:44:23.017Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685503749-106', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'Refer to the study below. An objective of a research study is to compare the frequency and duration of tardiness among nurses at the Philippine General Hospital according to the day of the week and marital status of the personnel.
The independent variable/s is/are: 1. day of the week; 2. marital status of the personnel; 3. Frequency and duration of tardiness; 4. nurses *', '1 & 2', 'Independent variables are the conditions or characteristics manipulated or categorized by the researcher to observe their effect on an outcome. Here, day of the week and marital status are the independent variables being tested.

• Frequency/duration of tardiness: The outcome being measured, making it the dependent variable.
• Nurses: The study population sample.', '["1 & 2","3 only","4 only","3 & 4"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:44:34.511Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685516315-107', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'Refer to the study below. An objective of a research study is to compare the frequency and duration of tardiness among nurses at the Philippine General Hospital according to the day of the week and marital status of the personnel.
The dependent variable/s is/are: 1. day of the week; 2. marital status of the personnel; 3. frequency and duration of tardiness; 4. nurses *', '3 only', 'In the research objective examining tardiness among nurses according to day of the week and marital status:

Independent variables: Day of the week & Marital status.

Dependent variable: Frequency and duration of tardiness (3 only).', '["1 & 2","3 only","4 only","3 & 4"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:55:12.648Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685536465-108', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'Refer to the study below. An objective of a research study is to compare the frequency and duration of tardiness among nurses at the Philippine General Hospital according to the day of the week and marital status of the personnel.
The control variable is *', 'type of personnel', 'The control variable or constant demographic parameter held constant or categorized in the study design is the specific type of hospital personnel being evaluated (nurses).', '["Philippine General Hospital","type of personnel","marital status of the personnel","nurses"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:55:17.842Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685545350-109', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'What kind of reasoning uses a few specific observations to produce a general hypothesis? *', 'inductive reasoning', 'Inductive reasoning involves taking specific, individual observations and using them to formulate a broad, general hypothesis or conclusion.

• Deductive reasoning: Moves from general theory down to specific testable hypotheses.', '["inductive reasoning","deductive reasoning","scientific reasoning","predictive reasoning"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:55:25.317Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685554080-110', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'A hypothesis is a ______ statement and a prediction is a _______ statement. *', 'general; specific', 'In research methodology, a hypothesis is formulated as a broad, general statement, whereas a prediction derived from it is a specific, testable operational statement.', '["specific; general","specific; specific","general; specific","general; general"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:55:29.505Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685564314-111', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'If each person in a large group has an equal chance of being included in a research study, what kind of sampling is being used? *', 'random sampling', 'Random sampling ensures that every single individual in a large target population has an equal, independent probability of being selected into the research study sample.

• Systematic / Convenience / Cluster sampling: Utilize fixed intervals, availability, or grouped sampling units rather than pure equal-chance random selection.', '["systematic sampling","random sampling","convenience sampling","cluster sampling"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:55:34.020Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685575313-112', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'An infant weighing 3.5 kg at birth should weigh ____ at the age of 1 year. *', '10.5 kg', 'Standard pediatric growth milestones dictate that an infant''s birth weight typically triples by the age of 1 year.

Given birth weight = 3.5 kg.

Calculation = 3.5 kg × 3 = 10.5 kg.', '["7 kg","10.5 kg","14 kg","16 kg"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:55:39.499Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685584964-113', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'The recommended weight gain for a pregnant woman during her third trimester. *', '1 lb. per week', 'During the third trimester of pregnancy, the recommended healthy rate of weight gain is approximately 1 pound per week to support accelerated fetal growth and maternal tissue changes.', '["1 lb. per month","2 lbs. per month","1 lb. per week","2 lbs. per month"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:56:37.130Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685594112-114', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'The following factors decrease calcium absorption except: *', 'presence of fat', 'Dietary fat does not inhibit calcium absorption; in fact, balanced fat intake and moderate fatty acids can aid or have a neutral effect on calcium transport compared to inhibitors like oxalates, phytates, or fiber.

• Presence of amino acids: Amino acids (such as lysine and arginine) enhance calcium solubility and absorption.
• Mental stress: Stress alters gastrointestinal motility and hormonal balance, negatively impacting mineral absorption.
• Lack of exercise: Physical inactivity reduces mechanical bone loading, leading to decreased calcium retention and bone mineralization.', '["presence of amino acids","mental stress","lack of exercise","presence of fat"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:56:43.410Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685603246-115', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'Type of sampling technique used in a community nutrition survey does not include: *', 'convenience sampling', 'Convenience sampling relies on readily available subjects rather than structured probability frames, making it unscientific and unsuitable for rigorous community nutrition surveys.

• Multi-stage cluster sampling / Stratified sampling / Simple random sampling: Standard, statistically valid probability sampling methods utilized in formal community nutrition surveys.', '["multi-stage cluster sampling","stratiied sampling","simple random sampling","convenience sampling"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:56:49.205Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685620111-116', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'Using the “rule of thumb” guideline for estimating IBW, an 18 year-old girl should weigh: *', '120 lbs.', 'Using standard clinical "rule of thumb" estimation methods for ideal body weight (IBW) based on height or age standards, an 18-year-old girl corresponds to an estimated baseline of roughly 120 pounds (or 100 lbs for 5 feet plus 5 lbs per inch over 5 feet, adjusted for age).', '["107 lbs.","113 lbs.","117 lbs.","120 lbs."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:56:53.630Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685634178-117', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'It is a means by which we can tell how we are using resources: *', 'auditing', 'Auditing is a systematic financial and operational review mechanism used to track how organizational and project resources have been utilized.

• Monitoring: Tracks ongoing implementation progress.
• Reporting: Communicates periodic status updates.
• Evaluation: Assesses terminal effectiveness and outcomes.', '["monitoring","reporting","auditing","evaluation"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:56:59.538Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685642662-118', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'Iron absorption is inhibited by: *', 'tannic acid', 'Tannic acid (found in tea, coffee, and certain legumes) binds non-heme iron to form insoluble complexes, strongly inhibiting iron absorption.

• Lactic acid / Citric acid / Tartaric acid: Organic acids that enhance or improve non-heme iron absorption by maintaining solubility in the gut.', '["lactic acid","citric acid","tannic acid","tartaric acid"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:57:06.876Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685651409-119', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'A deficiency of this micromineral is associated with poor wound healing: *', 'Zn', 'Zinc (Zn) is an essential micromineral critical for enzymatic collagen synthesis, immune function, and tissue regeneration; deficiency directly results in poor wound healing.

• Se (Selenium): Antioxidant mineral linked to thyroid and immune health.
• Fe (Iron): Essential for oxygen transport and hemoglobin synthesis.
• Cr (Chromium): Enhances insulin receptor activity.', '["Zn","Se","Fe","Cr"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:57:13.481Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685659943-120', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'The formulation of national nutrition programs in agreement with the country’s Medium Term National Development Plan started in ____. *', '1974', 'The formulation of national nutrition programs aligned with national development planning began formally in 1974 following the creation of the National Nutrition Council.', '["1973","1974","1975","1976"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:57:18.577Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685669293-121', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'Nutrition was declared a priority concern of the Philippine government with the passage of this law: *', 'PD 491', 'Presidential Decree No. 491 (Nutrition Act of the Philippines, enacted in 1974) formally declared nutrition as a priority concern of the Philippine government and created the National Nutrition Council (NNC).

• RA 2674: The Dietetic Law of 1960.
• PD 1286: The Nutrition and Dietetics Decree of 1977.
• RA 832: The Law on Home Industries.', '["PD 491","RA 2674","PD 1286","RA 832"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:57:31.080Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685679207-122', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'It is known as the ASIN Law or mandatory salt iodization requiring all salt producers and manufacturers to iodize salt that they produce. *', 'RA 8172', 'Republic Act No. 8172 (enacted in 1995) is known as the ASIN Law (Act Promoting Salt Iodization Nationwide), which mandates all salt manufacturers to iodize salt to eliminate iodine deficiency disorders.

• RA 7600: The Rooming-In and Breastfeeding Practices Act of 1992.
• RA 8791: General Banking Law of 2000.
• RA 8976: Philippine Food Fortification Act of 2000.', '["RA 7600","RA 8791","RA 8172","RA 8976"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:57:37.211Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685692174-123', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'Newborn Screening (NBS) is a public health strategy that aims to detect and manage certain congenital metabolic disorders. Ideally, NBS should be done: *', 'one day (24 hours) after the baby is born', 'Newborn Screening (NBS) is ideally performed 24 hours after birth (or after at least 24 hours of milk feeding) to allow sufficient metabolic accumulation for detecting congenital disorders like congenital hypothyroidism and phenylketonuria.', '["when the infant reaches 1 year","one day (24 hours) after the baby is born","the first four hours after the baby is born","one week after the baby is born"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:57:41.247Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685702607-124', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'Except for _____, the targeted age groups of the Soil-Transmitted Helminth Control Program include: *', 'adolescent males', 'Under public health deworming guidelines, the Soil-Transmitted Helminth Control Program targets preschool children, school-age children, pregnant women, and adolescent females (due to menstruation and iron loss), making adolescent males the correct exception.', '["preschoolers","adolescent females","adolescent males","pregnant women"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:57:46.623Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685711372-125', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'The MDGs and SDGs were formulated and set by the: *', 'UN', 'The Millennium Development Goals (MDGs) and Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) were formulated, set, and adopted globally by the United Nations (UN).

• WHO / FAO / WFP: Specialized UN agencies focusing on health, food/agriculture, or food aid, rather than formulating the overarching global MDG/SDG frameworks.', '["WHO","UN","FAO","WFP"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:57:50.840Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685720906-126', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'These are the three major causes of intestinal parasitism in the Philippines except: *', 'tapeworm infection', 'The three major public health intestinal parasitic infections monitored in the Philippines are soil-transmitted helminths: whipworm (Trichuris trichiura), hookworm (Necator americanus / Ancylostoma duodenale), and roundworm (Ascaris lumbricoides). Tapeworm infection is not part of this primary STH trio.', '["whipworm infection","hookworm infection","roundworm infection","tapeworm infection"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:57:55.021Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685727905-127', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'The SDGs consider _______ as a key feature of human development for all countries. *', 'health', 'The Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) framework considers health and well-being as a central, foundational key feature of human development for all countries.

• Education / Economic development / Social development: Important pillars, but health is explicitly emphasized across global developmental indices.', '["education","economic development","health","social development"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:57:59.616Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685739256-128', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'The law which regulates the practice of nutrition and dietetics in the Philippines. *', 'RA 10862', 'Republic Act No. 10862 (enacted in 2016) is the Nutrition and Dietetics Act of 2016, which regulates the professional practice of nutrition and dietetics in the Philippines.

• RA 10152: Mandatory Infants and Children Health Immunization Act of 2011.
• PD 1286: Older 1977 nutrition decree replaced by RA 10862.
• RA 2674: Original 1960 Dietetic Law.', '["RA 10152","PD 1286","RA 10862","RA 2674"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:58:05.358Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685748737-129', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'he cause of primary malnutrition is: *', 'prolonged infections', 'Primary malnutrition is caused directly by an inadequate dietary intake of food and essential nutrients relative to physiological requirements.

• Prolonged infections / Impaired utilization / Medical treatment: Drive secondary or conditioned malnutrition.', '["prolonged infections","inadequate food/nutrient intake","impaired nutrient utilization","medical treatment/drug therapy"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:58:10.279Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685759303-130', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'The cause of secondary malnutrition is: *', 'impaired nutrient utilization', 'Secondary malnutrition occurs when dietary intake is adequate, but underlying disease states, malabsorption, or medical conditions lead to impaired nutrient utilization or increased excretion.

• Inadequate food intake: Causes primary malnutrition.', '["prolonged infections","inadequate food/nutrient intake","impaired nutrient utilization","medical treatment/drug therapy"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:58:15.732Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685767803-131', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'The cause of iatrogenic malnutrition is: *', 'medical treatment/drug therapy', 'Iatrogenic malnutrition refers to nutritional deficiencies or complications inadvertently induced by medical treatments, surgical interventions, or prolonged drug therapy during hospitalization.

• Prolonged infections: Drive secondary malnutrition.', '["prolonged infections","inadequate food/nutrient intake","impaired nutrient utilization","medical treatment/drug therapy"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:58:20.685Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685783586-132', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'Endemic goiter becomes a public health problem when _______: *', 'at least 5% of adolescents or pre-adolescents have goiters Grade 1 and above', 'According to WHO epidemiological criteria, endemic goiter constitutes a public health problem when at least 5% of school-age children or adolescents present with thyroid enlargement of Grade 1 or above.

• 10%: The threshold for moderate-to-severe endemicity grading.', '["at least 10% of adolescents or pre-adolescents have goiters Grade Ob and above","at least 5% of adolescents or pre-adolescents have goiters Grade 1 and above","at least 5% of adolescents or pre-adolescents have goiter Grade Ob and above","at least 1% of girls 12-14 years have goiters Grade 1 and above"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:58:26.766Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685792853-133', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'In the Philippines, the added nutrients in fortified foods should provide at least _____. *', '1/5 – 1/4 of the recommended nutrient intake of the individual', 'Under Philippine food fortification standards, added micronutrients in fortified staple foods must safely provide approximately 1/5 to 1/4 (20–25%) of the recommended nutrient intake (RNI) of the individual.', '["1/5 – 1/4 of the recommended nutrient intake of the individual","1/4 – 1/3 of the recommended nutrient intake of the individual","1/3 of the recommended nutrient intake of the individual","1/5 – 1/3 of the recommended nutrient intake of the individual"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:58:31.253Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685802103-134', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'It is the provision of micronutrients in a pharmaceutical dosage form in conditions that require amounts higher than those provided by the diet. *', 'food supplementation', 'Food supplementation involves providing concentrated nutrients or pharmaceutical dosage forms (such as iron syrups, Vitamin A capsules, or mineral tablets) to meet needs higher than dietary supply.

• Food enrichment / Food fortification: Involve adding nutrients directly into processed food supplies or staples.', '["food enrichment","food fortification","food supplementation","none of the above"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:58:42.817Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685810285-135', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'Measures of skeletal growth except: *', 'weight', 'Weight measures total body mass, whereas knee height, height-for-age, and elbow breadth measure skeletal bone dimensions and linear growth.', '["knee height","height-for-age","weight","elbow breadth"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:58:47.583Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685817168-136', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'An indicator of present malnutrition among children. *', 'weight-for-age', 'Weight-for-age reflects body mass relative to age, serving as an index of present or current overall underweight status in children.

• Length-for-age: Measures chronic linear stunting.', '["length-for-age","weight-for-age","knee height","none these"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:58:53.553Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685825885-137', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'This type of fat mostly come from the hydrogenation of vegetable oils. *', 'trans fat', 'Trans fats are manufactured primarily through the industrial hydrogenation of liquid vegetable oils, increasing shelf life and heart disease risk.

• Saturated fat: Found naturally in animal fats and tropical oils without industrial hydrogenation.', '["saturated fat","trans fat","brown fat","unsaturated fat"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:58:59.704Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685835535-138', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'It differentiates “wasted” and “stunted” individuals. *', 'weight-for-height', 'Weight-for-height evaluates acute wasting (thinness relative to height) versus chronic stunting (shortness relative to age), effectively differentiating the two conditions.

• Weight-for-age / MUAC / Height-for-age: Assess underweight or linear growth alone without direct differential cross-comparison.', '["weight-for-age","height-for-age","MUAC","weight-for-height"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:59:05.139Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685844368-139', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'It is a sensitive indicator of tissue iron level since it is not affected by inflammation or infection: *', 'transferrin receptor', 'Serum transferrin receptor (sTfR) concentration is a sensitive indicator of tissue iron status that remains unaffected by acute-phase inflammatory responses or chronic infections.

• Serum ferritin / Hemoglobin / Transferrin saturation: Confounded or altered significantly during infection, inflammation, or acute illness.', '["serum ferritin","hemoglobin","transferrin receptor","transferrin saturation"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:59:11.687Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685852583-140', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'In assessing the iodine status of populations, this measurement is used: *', 'serum thyroid stimulating hormone', 'Urinary iodine excretion (UIC) is the globally recommended population-level biomarker used to assess iodine status and dietary iodine intake.

• Serum thyroglobulin / TSH / T3/T4: Clinical thyroid function tests, whereas urinary iodine directly reflects recent dietary intake.', '["serum thyroglobulin","urinary iodine excretion","serum thyroxine and triiodothyronine","serum thyroid stimulating hormone"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:59:15.562Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685875081-141', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'Qualitative tools used to evaluate the nutritional adequacy of daily diets: 1. Food Guide Pyramid; 2. FEL; 3. Nutritional Guidelines; 4. FCT *', '1 & 3', 'The Food Guide Pyramid (1) and Nutritional Guidelines (3) are qualitative educational tools and behavioral guides.

• FEL (2) & FCT (4): Quantitative numerical tools providing exact exchange lists and nutrient values.', '["1 & 3","1 & 2","2 & 3","1 & 4"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:59:21.095Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685882765-142', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'A basic tool in nutrition which aims to improve the present diets of Filipinos and prevent the development of nutrition-related public health problems. *', 'Nutritional Guidelines', 'The Nutritional Guidelines (such as the Nutritional Guidelines for Filipinos) serve as the fundamental educational tool translating science into practical dietary advice to prevent public health nutrition problems.

• RENI: Numerical nutrient requirement standard.
• Food Guide Pyramid: Graphical food grouping illustration.', '["RENI","Nutritional Guidelines","Food Guide Pyramid","FEL"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:59:28.823Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685896348-143', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'The Food Balance Sheet provides the following information/data except: *', 'the distribution of food within a country', 'A Food Balance Sheet (FBS) provides macroeconomic data on national food production, imports, exports, and overall per capita availability, but it cannot measure how food is actually distributed among households within a country.

• National food supply picture / Trends / Types consumed: Valid data provided by FBS macro accounting.', '["a comprehensive picture of a country’s food supply","the distribution of food within a country","trends in the overall food supply in the country","the changes that might have occurred in the types of food consumed in a country"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:59:34.473Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685906515-144', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'Good sources of provitamin A except: *', 'egg yolk', 'Egg yolks are rich in preformed Vitamin A (retinol) and fats, whereas dark green leafy vegetables (camote tops), carrots, and squash are rich in provitamin A carotenoids.', '["camote tops","carrot","egg yolk","squash"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:59:39.248Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685918931-145', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'All are macrominerals except: *', 'Fluoride', 'Fluoride is classified as a trace element (micromineral), whereas calcium, sodium, and chloride are major minerals (macrominerals) required in large daily amounts.', '["Calcium","Sodium","Fluoride","Chloride"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:59:43.678Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685928880-146', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'Examples of the body’s adaptive responses to undernutrition except: *', 'stunted growth', 'Stunted growth is a long-term, chronic adaptive response to prolonged undernutrition over months or years, whereas acute adaptive responses include immediate metabolic slowdown, decreased protein synthesis, and reduced physical activity.', '["muscle wasting","children having shorter play hours","stunted growth","decreased protein synthesis"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:59:48.222Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685940862-147', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'The government agency which makes sure that nutrition concerns are integrated in both national and sub-national development plans. *', 'NEDA', 'The National Economic and Development Authority (NEDA) is the primary government agency responsible for ensuring that national and sub-national development plans integrate health and nutrition priorities.

• DBM: Manages national budget allocation.
• DILG: Oversees local government units.', '["DBM","NEDA","DILG","none of the above"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:59:52.524Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685949978-148', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'The following determine food security at the national level except: *', 'efficiency of food distribution & marketing system', 'National food security is determined macroeconomically by domestic production, global market prices, and national trade policies, whereas local retail distribution efficiency operates at the micro market level.', '["domestic food production","world food prices","efficiency of food distribution & marketing system","the country’s trade policies"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T08:59:57.143Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685959045-149', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'When expressed per kilogram body weight, the nutrient needs of infants are markedly higher than for adults for all of the following nutrients except: *', 'folate', 'When expressed per kilogram of body weight, infant requirements for iron, calcium, and Vitamin D are vastly higher than adult needs to support rapid skeletal and hematological growth. Folate requirements scale proportionally, making folate the correct exception.', '["iron","folate","calcium","vitamin D"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:00:00.552Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685967660-150', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'Compared to cow’s milk, breast milk contains: *', 'less protein and minerals', 'Mature human breast milk contains lower concentrations of total protein and mineral ash compared to bovine (cow''s) milk, which reduces renal solute load for the infant''s immature kidneys.', '["less protein and minerals","less lactose and vitamin C","more fat and less carbohydrate","more energy and less vitamin E"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:00:05.962Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685979829-151', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'A type of anemia caused by the breakdown of red blood cells and the loss of hemoglobin. *', 'hemolytic anemia', 'Hemolytic anemia is characterized pathologically by the premature destruction and breakdown of circulating red blood cells coupled with the loss of hemoglobin.

• Pernicious anemia: Caused by Vitamin B12 malabsorption.
• Nutritional anemia: Broad category typically linked to iron, folate, or B12 deficiency.', '["pernicious anemia","hemolytic anemia","nutritional anemia","non-nutritional anemia"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:00:11.460Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758685988945-152', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'The heart of any research method/design: *', 'data interpretation', 'Data interpretation is the core intellectual heart of any research method or design, transforming raw data into meaningful scientific conclusions.

• Data collection / Formation of conclusions: Execution and terminal steps, whereas interpretation forms the analytical core.', '["data interpretation","data collection","formation of conclusions","none of the above"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:00:19.168Z"'::jsonb)
