('anki-card-1758695370104-3', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'This measurement does not belong to the group: *', 'waist circumference', 'Waist circumference is an abdominal adiposity and risk indicator, whereas body weight, height, and head circumference are classic foundational linear/mass anthropometric growth measurements.', '["waist circumference","body weight","height","head circumference"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:59:32.216Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695379938-4', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'All are biological factors affecting growth except: *', 'one’s nutrition', 'Genetics, age, and birth order are fixed biological factors influencing human growth, whereas nutrition is an environmental and behavioral determinant rather than an inherent biological trait.', '["one’s nutrition","one’s age","one’s genetic make-up","one’s birth order"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:59:35.962Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695389468-5', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'Which of the following level of prevention aims to prevent disease by controlling the risk factors related to the disease? *', 'primary prevention', 'Primary prevention encompasses public health measures aimed at preventing the initial onset of disease by controlling and modifying underlying risk factors.', '["primary prevention","secondary prevention","tertiary prevention","none of the above"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:59:39.684Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695402817-6', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'A determinant of health which includes physical activity, diet, hobbies, use of drugs, and stress management among others. *a. biology', 'lifestyle', 'Lifestyle determinants of health include controllable behavioral choices such as physical activity, dietary patterns, substance use, and stress management.', '["community conditions","lifestyle","background conditions"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:59:44.491Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695410802-7', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'Nutriture is synonymous with: *', 'nutritional status', '"Nutriture" is the professional clinical synonym for an individual''s overall nutritional status resulting from nutrient intake and utilization.', '["nutrition","nutritional status","nutrition support","none of the above"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:59:48.245Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695421302-8', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'The malnutrition problem should be addressed appropriately to prevent the following consequences: *', 'all of the above', 'Unaddressed malnutrition results in severe downstream consequences, including high infection and mortality rates, irreversible physical and mental developmental impairment, and stunted national economic development.', '["high infection and death rates","impaired physical and mental development","impaired national development","all of the above"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:59:52.564Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695431551-9', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'Infants and preschool children are at-risk of the following malnutrition problems except: *', 'IDD', 'Infants and preschool children are primary risk groups for Protein-Energy Malnutrition (PEM), Vitamin A Deficiency (VAD), and Iron Deficiency Anemia (IDA). Iodine Deficiency Disorders (IDD) affect entire populations regionally based on soil/water iodine content rather than isolating infants as the exclusive high-risk pediatric group.', '["PEM","VAD","IDD","IDA"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:40:10.514Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695441817-10', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'Which of the following is not characteristic of marasmus? *', 'It affects brain development only minimally.', 'This statement is false, making it the correct key. Severe marasmus during early infancy affects central nervous system growth and brain development significantly, making the claim of "minimal effect" untrue.', '["It results in a low resistance to disease.","It affects brain development only minimally.","It occurs most commonly in children 6-18 months of age.","It results in little or no fat under the skin to insulate against a cold environment."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:40:16.573Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695456383-11', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'The maximum daily dosage of vitamin A considered safe for pregnant women: *', '10,000 IU', 'To prevent potential teratogenic risks and fetal vitamin A toxicity during gestation, public health guidelines establish 10,000 IU daily as the maximum safe upper dosage threshold for vitamin A supplementation during pregnancy.', '["1,000 IU","10,000 IU","100,000 IU","200,000 IU"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:40:21.575Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695467183-12', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'It is not considered a qualitative dietary tool: *', 'Food Composition Tables', 'Food Composition Tables (FCTs) provide quantitative numerical nutrient values per 100g of food items, classifying them as a quantitative dietary assessment tool rather than qualitative.', '["Nutritional Guidelines","Food Composition Tables","Plate Model","Food Guide Pyramid"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:40:26.395Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695476750-13', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'The Food Guide Pyramid recommends ____ servings of vegetables daily. *', '3', 'Traditional Food Guide Pyramid serving recommendations advise consuming approximately 3 to 5 servings of vegetables daily (with 3 servings serving as a standard baseline reference point).', '["2","3","4","5"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:36:36.711Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695488382-14', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'A serving of fruit based on the YGGN and Food Guide Pyramid is equivalent to all of the following except: *', '12 pieces of small fruits', 'Standard local food exchange and YGGN serving sizes for one fruit portion include 1 medium piece, 1 slice of large fruit (like papaya/pineapple), or 6 to 8 pieces of small fruits (like lanzones or grapes). 12 pieces is an excessive portion, making it the correct exception.', '["1 medium piece","1 slice of big fruit","12 pieces of small fruits","6 pieces of small fruits"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:38:04.892Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695496915-15', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'The following are included in the Nutritional Guidelines for Filipinos except: *', 'Reduce intake of saturated fats.', '', '["Eat more vegetables, fruits, and root crops.","Eat clean and safe foods.","Use iodized salt but avoid excessive intake of salty foods.","Reduce intake of saturated fats."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695530063-16', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'Consider the following information based on FCT values of a 100g egg, chicken, yolk. Retinol = 625 β-carotene = 120 Protein = 14.3 Niacin = 0.4 Niacin value from tryptophan = 6.9
The total vitamin A (RE) of the 100 g egg, chicken, yolk is ____ug. *', '645', 'To calculate total Vitamin A in Retinol Equivalents (RE):

Formula: RE = mcg Retinol + (mcg Beta-carotene ÷ 6) + (mg Niacin equivalent from tryptophan ÷ 60... wait, standard RE conversion factor).

Given values: Retinol = 625 mcg; Beta-carotene = 120 mcg.

Calculation: 625 + (120 ÷ 6) = 625 + 20 = 645 mcg RE.', '["625","120","745","645"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:38:15.084Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695543829-17', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'Consider the following information based on FCT values of a 100g egg, chicken, yolk. Retinol = 625 β-carotene = 120 Protein = 14.3 Niacin = 0.4 Niacin value from tryptophan = 6.9
A 100g egg, chicken, yolk contains ____NE. *', '7.3', 'To calculate Niacin Equivalents (NE):

Formula: NE = mg Preformed Niacin + (mg Tryptophan ÷ 60... or using direct given values from the prompt data table).

Given values: Niacin = 0.4 mg; Niacin value from tryptophan = 6.9 mg.

Calculation: 0.4 + 6.9 = 7.3 NE.', '["0.4","6.9","7.3","8"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:38:22.214Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695558766-18', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'The EP weight of bangus with 250g A.P. weight and 65% E.P. is: *', '162', 'To calculate Edible Portion (EP) weight from As-Purchased (AP) weight:

Formula = AP Weight × EP Percentage

Given values: AP = 250g; EP % = 65% (0.65).

Calculation = 250g × 0.65 = 162.5g, rounding to 162g.', '["88","162","185","none of the above"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:38:28.663Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695578043-19', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'Which of the following nutrients in the RENI is based on the average intake? *', 'protein', 'Among macronutrients in nutrient reference standards (such as RENI / RNI), protein requirements are established based on the average population intake requirements adjusted for body weight and quality. Energy recommendations reflect mean population requirements to prevent positive/negative energy imbalance.', '["vitamin A","energy","iron","protein"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:38:32.914Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695623293-20', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'Iron deficiency is synonymous with iron deficiency anemia. The first stage in the development of iron deficiency anemia is iron deficient erythropoiesis. *', 'Both statements are incorrect.', 'Statement 1 is incorrect because iron deficiency (depleted stores) is not strictly synonymous with iron deficiency anemia (which involves compromised hemoglobin synthesis). 

Statement 2 is incorrect because the first stage of iron deficiency is depleted iron stores (ferritin depletion), followed by iron-deficient erythropoiesis, and finally frank anemia.', '["Both statements are correct.","The first statement is correct but the second statement is incorrect.","The first statement is incorrect but the second statement is correct.","Both statements are incorrect."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:38:41.322Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695643375-21', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'A single 24-hour recall can be used to assess the usual nutrient intake of individuals. Repeated 24-hour recall is used for large scale field surveys. *', 'Both statements are incorrect.', 'Statement 1 is incorrect because a single 24-hour recall captures only recent intake and cannot establish usual habitual nutrient intake without statistical adjustments. 

Statement 2 is incorrect because repeated 24-hour recalls are utilized in population surveys to estimate usual intake distributions, whereas single recalls are common for quick assessments.', '["Both statements are correct.","The first statement is correct but the second statement is incorrect.","The first statement is incorrect but the second statement is correct.","Both statements are incorrect."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:38:49.209Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695658256-22', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'Food consumption data can be expressed both in terms of nutrients and food consumed. Food consumption data can be measured both quantitatively and qualitatively. *', 'Both statements are correct.', 'Food consumption data can indeed be expressed in terms of raw/cooked food weights (food consumed) as well as converted into nutrient values; furthermore, consumption surveys can be measured quantitatively (weighed food, exact records) or qualitatively (diet history, food frequency).', '["Both statements are correct.","The first statement is correct but the second statement is incorrect.","The first statement is incorrect but the second statement is correct.","Both statements are incorrect."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:38:55.686Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695670855-23', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'Dietary fat is an important source of calories in a young child’s diet. The amount of saturated fat should not be restricted in a young child’s diet. *', 'The first statement is correct but the second statement is incorrect.', 'Statement 1 is correct: dietary fat provides concentrated calories and essential fatty acids vital for infant brain and neural development. 

Statement 2 is incorrect: saturated fat intake should be monitored and moderated even in young children after age 2 to prevent early atherosclerotic tracking, making the absolute prohibition of restriction false.', '["Both statements are correct.","The first statement is correct but the second statement is incorrect.","The first statement is incorrect but the second statement is correct.","Both statements are incorrect."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:39:04.141Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695684788-24', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'A 24-hour recall requires a literate respondent. Food Frequency Questionnaire (FFQ) can be self-administered or an interview is conducted. *', 'The first statement is incorrect but the second statement is correct.', 'Statement 1 is incorrect because a 24-hour recall relies on verbal memory and can be administered to illiterate respondents (using food models or picture cards). 

Statement 2 is correct because a Food Frequency Questionnaire (FFQ) can be self-administered or conducted via interviewer assistance.', '["Both statements are correct.","The first statement is correct but the second statement is incorrect.","The first statement is incorrect but the second statement is correct.","Both statements are incorrect"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:40:32.464Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695695171-25', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'Public health nutrition focuses on specific nutritional concerns of individuals. Public health nutrition focuses on the promotion of good health through nutrition *', 'The first statement is incorrect but the second statement is correct.', 'Statement 1 is incorrect because public health nutrition focuses on population-wide community health promotion and nutrition strategies, whereas clinical nutrition targets individual nutritional concerns. 

Statement 2 is correct: public health nutrition promotes overall population health through nutrition.', '["Both statements are correct.","The first statement is correct but the second statement is incorrect.","The first statement is incorrect but the second statement is correct.","Both statements are incorrect."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:40:41.143Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695707088-26', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'Nutrient recommendations such as RENI apply to all people. All persons need the same nutrients in the same amounts. *', 'Both statements are incorrect.', 'Statement 1 is incorrect because nutrient recommendations like RENI apply to specific population subgroups categorized by age, physiological state, and gender, not universally to all people alike. 

Statement 2 is incorrect because different individuals have diverse physiological needs and nutrient requirements based on body size, metabolic rate, and activity.', '["Both statements are correct.","The first statement is correct but the second statement is incorrect.","The first statement is incorrect but the second statement is correct.","Both statements are incorrect."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:40:48.072Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695717737-27', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'Hematocrit represents the red cell compartment of blood. Hematocrit is a sensitive indicator of iron status. *', 'The first statement is correct but the second statement is incorrect.', 'Statement 1 is correct: hematocrit represents the volume percentage of red blood cells in blood. 

Statement 2 is incorrect because hematocrit is a relatively nonsensitive and late indicator of iron status (since hydration and other anemias easily confound it), whereas serum ferritin or transferrin saturation are far more sensitive.', '["Both statements are correct.","The first statement is correct but the second statement is incorrect.","The first statement is incorrect but the second statement is correct.","Both statements are incorrect."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:40:56.036Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695729602-28', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'FFQ can obtain both qualitative and quantitative dietary data. FFQ is used to obtain accurate measurements of food consumed. *', 'The first statement is correct but the second statement is incorrect.', 'Statement 1 is correct: an FFQ can collect both qualitative data (habitual food types) and semi-quantitative data (portion sizes). 

Statement 2 is incorrect because an FFQ is designed to capture habitual intake patterns, not exact, highly precise daily weighed food measurements (which require weighed food records).', '["Both statements are correct.","The first statement is correct but the second statement is incorrect.","The first statement is incorrect but the second statement is correct.","Both statements are incorrect."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:41:03.478Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695745403-29', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'Food enrichment refers to the mandatory addition of micronutrients to staple foods. As an intervention, food fortification targets the specific segments of the population. *', 'Both statements are incorrect.', 'Statement 1 is incorrect because food enrichment usually refers to the addition of nutrients to foods to replace losses incurred during processing (or mandatory fortification laws). 

Statement 2 is incorrect because food fortification is a broad public health strategy targeting the general population (via staple foods like iodized salt or fortified flour) rather than exclusively isolating specific clinical segments.', '["Both statements are correct.","The first statement is correct but the second statement is incorrect.","The first statement is incorrect but the second statement is correct.","Both statements are incorrect."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:41:10.170Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695759568-30', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'Urinary iodine excretion is indicative of recent iodine intake. Urinary iodine is generally used to assess iodine status in the community. *', 'Both statements are correct.', 'Urinary iodine excretion (UIC) reflects recent dietary iodine intake (over the past 24-48 hours) and is globally validated and widely used as the primary biomarker to assess population and community iodine nutritional status.', '["Both statements are correct.","The first statement is correct but the second statement is incorrect.","The first statement is incorrect but the second statement is correct.","Both statements are incorrect."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:37:48.051Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695769904-31', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'In dietary assessment, it refers to the respondent’s tendency to respond in such a way as to avoid criticism: *', 'social desirability', 'Social desirability bias in dietary assessment refers to the respondent''s psychological tendency to alter reported food intake to conform to social norms and avoid criticism from the dietitian.', '["social control","social approval","social desirability","response bias"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:41:13.811Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695788569-32', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'It is used to investigate relationship between diet and disease causation. *', 'diet history', 'A comprehensive diet history (which explores eating patterns over extended periods alongside clinical and lifestyle data) is the clinical dietary tool most commonly utilized to investigate long-term epidemiological relationships between diet and chronic disease causation.', '["food record Option 2","24-hour recall","diet history","none of the above"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:41:16.714Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695799066-33', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'It may reflect a long-term habitual intake of an individual. *', 'food frequency questionnaire', 'A Food Frequency Questionnaire (FFQ) asks about intake over weeks or months, making it the primary dietary tool designed to reflect an individual''s long-term habitual dietary intake.', '["food recall","food record","food frequency questionnaire","none of the above"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:41:21.559Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695807949-34', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'Which of the following is considered a demographic indicator? *', 'family composition', 'Family composition (household size, age structure, dependents) is a demographic indicator used in socio-economic and nutritional community profiling.

• Morbidity rate: Health/epidemiological indicator.
• Food expenditure: Economic indicator.', '["dietary pattern","family composition","morbidity rate","food expenditure"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:41:26.899Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695817800-35', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'The two food items used by the National Nutrition Council in their experimental food discount project to increase the energy intake of Filipinos: 1. Rice 2. Sugar', '1 & 3', 'In national nutrition economic projects aimed at increasing cheap dietary energy intake among vulnerable populations, the National Nutrition Council utilized staple carbohydrates (Rice) combined with energy-dense fats/oils (Oil) to boost caloric density. (Options 1 [Rice] and 3 [Oil]).', '["Oil","Flour *","2 & 4","1 & 3","1 & 4","2 & 3"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:41:31.341Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695827883-36', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'A step in program planning that helps define the objectives and the course of action: *', 'assessing the situation', 'Assessing the situation (situational analysis) is the foundational preliminary step in program planning that helps evaluate current conditions, define objectives, and determine the appropriate course of action.', '["evaluating the program","planning the program","setting the objectives","assessing the situation"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:44:48.207Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695838216-37', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'Goat’s milk is inappropriate for infants due to its low content of _____. *', 'folate', 'Goat''s milk is notoriously deficient in folate (Vitamin B9) and Vitamin B12, making unfortified goat''s milk inappropriate as a primary milk source for infants due to the high risk of megaloblastic anemia.

• Iron: Goat''s milk is also low in iron, but folate is the classic micronutrient deficiency uniquely tied to goat''s milk anemia.
• Calcium / Protein: Goat''s milk provides adequate protein and calcium concentrations relative to human nutritional standards.', '["iron","calcium","folate","protein"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:44:53.088Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695854998-38', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'The first step to do when you want to set-up a nutrition program in a barangay: *', 'inform the local officials of the plan', 'The foundational protocol when initiating any community nutrition program in a barangay is to first brief, coordinate with, and secure the approval and support of local barangay officials.', '["inform the local officials of the plan","meet the barangay residents","implement the program activities","ask for resources"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:39:09.421Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695867081-39', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'The food with the highest natural source of vitamin A is: *', 'fish liver oil', 'Fish liver oils (such as cod liver oil) contain exceptionally high concentrations of preformed Vitamin A (retinol) per gram, far exceeding typical plant or dairy sources.

• Shellfish: Contain protein and zinc, but modest Vitamin A compared to liver oils.
• Carrot: Rich in beta-carotene (provitamin A), but fish liver oil provides concentrated preformed retinol.
• Fortified margarine: Fortified artificially, whereas fish liver oil is a natural source.', '["fish liver oil","shellfish","carrot","fortified margarine"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:44:58.875Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695876746-40', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'Which of the following is/are the dissecting concept/s of the Food Pyramid? *', 'balance', 'The foundational concepts (or guidelines) of the Food Guide Pyramid and dietary guides revolve around balance, variety, and moderation to achieve nutritional adequacy.

• Aesthetic appeal / Cost: Practical or cultural factors, but physiological dietary design concepts focus specifically on balance.', '["aesthetic appeal","balance","cost","all of the above"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:36:31.668Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695885612-41', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'A qualitative dietary tool which measures the variety of foods eaten. *', 'Diet Diversity Score', 'The Diet Diversity Score (DDS) is a qualitative dietary assessment tool that measures the number of different food groups consumed over a given reference period, serving as an indicator of dietary quality and nutrient adequacy.

• 24-hour recall: A quantitative or semi-quantitative single-day intake recall tool.
• Diet Rating / YGGN: General nutritional evaluation tools or food guides, whereas DDS specifically counts food group variety.', '["24-hour recall","Diet Diversity Score","Diet Rating","YGGN"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:45:03.541Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695895896-42', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'It is not a component of the Burke dietary history method of measuring individual food consumption. *', 'food inventory', 'The Burke dietary history method comprises three components: a 24-hour recall, a 3-day food record, and a cross-check dietary history interview. A food inventory is used in household-level consumption surveys, making it the correct exception.

• 24-hour recall: Included as the initial baseline intake assessment.
• 3-day food record: Included to capture current prospective intake data.
• FFQ: Utilized as a cross-check mechanism within the comprehensive Burke history method.', '["24-hour recall","day food record","food inventory","FFQ"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:45:08.239Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695906511-43', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'Interviewer biases during a dietary recall interview may arise due to the following reasons except: *', 'over reporting of intakes', 'Interviewer biases during dietary recalls typically arise from improper technique, leading respondents to under-report socially undesirable foods or portion sizes (social desirability bias), rather than systematic interviewer-driven over-reporting.

• Inappropriate probing: A direct source of interviewer bias that can skew recall data.
• Incorrect recording of responses: Clerical error representing classic interviewer bias.', '["inappropriate probing","incorrect recording of responses","over reporting of intakes","none of the above"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:45:15.556Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695918862-44', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'Which is not a sign of iron deficiency? *', 'corneal xerosis', 'Corneal xerosis, Bitot''s spots, and night blindness are clinical deficiency signs of Vitamin A (xerophthalmia), not iron deficiency.

• "Spooning" of the fingernails: Koilonychia is a classic physical sign of chronic iron deficiency anemia.
• Pale conjunctiva: Reflects low hemoglobin and anemia resulting from iron depletion.
• Stomatitis: Can accompany iron and B-complex deficiencies.', '["corneal xerosis","“spooning” of the fingernails","pale conjunctiva","stomatitis"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:45:20.550Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695930393-45', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'This indicator increases when there is iron deficiency: *', 'erythrocyte protoporphyrin', 'Erythrocyte protoporphyrin accumulates in red blood cells when iron availability for heme synthesis becomes inadequate, making it an indicator that increases during iron deficiency.

• Hemoglobin / Serum ferritin / Serum transferrin: These clinical biomarkers universally decrease or become depleted during progressive iron deficiency.', '["erythrocyte protoporphyrin","hemoglobin","serum ferritin","serum transferrin"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:45:25.177Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695939462-46', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'The movable rod on a platform scale is not recommended for measuring height because: *', 'all of the above', 'Platform scales with movable rods are unreliable for exact height measurement because height can vary based on posture/weight compression, there is often no fixed rigid vertical headboard against which to position the body correctly, and movable sliding headpieces easily become misaligned.', '["height will vary depending on patient’s weight","there is no rigid surface against which to position the body","headboard is not always correctly aligned","all of the above"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:45:30.363Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695948743-47', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'The age group that is not considered nutritionally vulnerable in the Philippines: *', 'male adults', 'In public health nutrition, vulnerable groups prioritized for nutritional risk include infants, young children, pregnant and lactating women, and the elderly due to high physiological demands. Adult males generally exhibit the lowest baseline nutritional vulnerability.

• Infants / Pregnant & lactating women / Elderly: High-priority nutritionally vulnerable cohorts facing rapid growth or physiological stress.', '["infants","male adults","pregnant & lactating women","elderly"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:45:36.467Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695960192-48', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'The age group considered the primary target in iron supplement: *', 'pregnant women', 'Pregnant women represent the primary target cohort for routine public health iron and folate supplementation programs to prevent maternal anemia and low birth weight.

• Adolescents / Elderly: Targeted selectively based on screening, whereas pregnant women receive universal programmatic supplementation.', '["adolescents","elderly","pregnant women","all of the above"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:45:41.616Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695970310-49', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'A program that encourages the fortification of processed foods with iodine, iron, and/or vitamin A by awarding a seal of acceptance from the DOH. *', 'Sangkap Pinoy Seal Program', 'The Sangkap Pinoy Seal Program (SPSP) is a DOH-NNC strategy that encourages food manufacturers to voluntarily fortify processed foods with Vitamin A, iron, and iodine, awarding a recognizable seal of acceptance for compliant consumer products.

• Garantisadong Pambata: A DOH child health campaign delivering integrated services.
• Food Fortification Program: The broader legislative framework (RA 8976).
• Salt Iodization Program: Specifically targeted at universal salt iodization (ASIN Law).', '["Garantisadong Pambata","Food Fortification Program","Salt Iodization Program","Sangkap Pinoy Seal Program"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:45:47.587Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695980141-50', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'The law that regulates the practice of nutrition and dietetics in the Philippines. *', 'RA 10862', 'Republic Act No. 10862 is the Nutrition and Dietetics Act of 2016, which repealed older legislation and regulates the professional practice of nutrition and dietetics in the Philippines.

• RA 2674: The original historic Dietetic Law of 1960.
• PD 1286 / PD 491: PD 491 created the National Nutrition Council.', '["RA 2674","PD 1286","RA 10862","PD 491"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:45:51.896Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758695991442-51', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'Who heads the Provincial Nutrition Committee? *', 'Governor', 'At the provincial administrative level, the Provincial Nutrition Committee is headed by the provincial Governor (just as city mayors head city committees and municipal mayors head municipal committees).

• Barangay Captain: Heads the Barangay Nutrition Committee.
• Mayor: Heads municipal or city nutrition committees.
• Regional Director: Heads regional offices or line agencies.', '["Barangay Captain","Governor","Mayor","Regional Director"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:45:57.471Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758696000358-52', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608795320-1790433140288-uhh76', 'Which of the following is not true about RA 8976? *', 'Salt must be fortified with iodine.', 'Republic Act No. 8976 (Philippine Food Fortification Act of 2000) mandates the fortification of rice (with iron), wheat flour (with vitamin A and iron), refined sugar (with vitamin A), and cooking oil (with vitamin A). Salt fortification with iodine is mandated separately under RA 8172 (ASIN Law), making option A the correct exception statement regarding RA 8976 specifically.

• Wheat flour must be fortified with iron and vitamin A: Mandated under RA 8976.
• Refined sugar must be fortified with vitamin A: Mandated under RA 8976.', '["Salt must be fortified with iodine.","Wheat flour must be fortified with iron and vitamin A.","Refined sugar must be fortified with vitamin A.","None of the above"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.385Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T07:46:12.425Z"'::jsonb)
