How much kilocalories does the meal contain? *', '700 kcal', 'Calculation based on Food Exchange List (FEL) values for the specified lunch meal pattern (fried chicken, rice, sautéed squash, fresh milk, and ripe mango): The total energy content sums exactly to 700 kcal.', '["650 kcal","700 kcal","730 kcal","775 kcal"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.933Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:17:54.491Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758812874125-94', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'Which of the following are qualitative dietary tools? I. Food Pyramid IV. Nutrition Facts Label II. Food Composition Tables V. Your Guide to Good Nutrition III. Pinggang Pinoy *a. I, II, III, IV, V', 'I, III, V only', 'Qualitative dietary assessment tools evaluate dietary patterns without relying on exact quantitative nutrient weighing. These include the Food Pyramid (I), Pinggang Pinoy (III), and Your Guide to Good Nutrition (V).

• Food Composition Tables (II) and Nutrition Facts Labels (IV) provide quantitative nutrient data.', '["I, II, III, V only","I, II, III only","I, III, V only"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.933Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:06:15.131Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758812881543-95', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'The recommended amount of green leafy vegetables and yellow vegetables based on Your Guide to Good Nutrition is _______. *', '¾ cup', 'According to Your Guide to Good Nutrition (the Philippine food guide predecessor), the recommended daily household portion allocation for green leafy and yellow vegetables is ¾ cup.', '["¼ cup","½ cup","¾ cup","1 cup"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.933Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:06:20.002Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758812889557-96', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'The Pinggang Pinoy is made for _______. *', 'adults', 'The Pinggang Pinoy food guide is developed specifically as a visual food plate model for healthy Filipino adults, with separate adapted versions designated for children, adolescents, pregnant/lactating women, and older persons.', '["children","adolescents","adults","older persons"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.933Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:06:04.486Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758812896907-97', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'Pinggang Pinoy food guide complements and supplements the __________. *', 'Food Pyramid', 'The Pinggang Pinoy food plate model was developed by the Food and Nutrition Research Institute (FNRI) to complement and visually translate the conceptual messages of the traditional Food Pyramid into an easy-to-understand meal plate.', '["Your Guide to Good Nutrition","Food Pyramid","Food Composition Tables","Recommended Energy and Nutrient Intakes"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.933Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:06:23.564Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758812906307-98', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'The diet planning principle that refers to the concept of providing enough but not too much of a substance is called ________. *', 'moderation', 'The diet planning principle of moderation dictates providing enough of a food or nutrient to support health without going to excess (providing enough but not too much).', '["balance","moderation","variety","adequacy"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.933Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:17:58.842Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758812915223-99', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'The recommended amount of fish and alternatives based on Pinggang Pinoy is _________. *', '½ cup', 'According to the Pinggang Pinoy healthy plate model for adults, the recommended food portion allocation for "Go, Grow, and Glow" includes roughly ½ cup allocated for fish, meat, poultry, and alternatives (Grow foods).', '["¼ cup","½ cup","¾ cup","1 cup"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.933Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:20:31.565Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758812927739-100', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'Rice and alternatives in the Pinggang Pinoy comprise _________ of the plate. *', '33%', 'In the Pinggang Pinoy visual food plate model, "Go" foods (rice, root crops, and alternatives providing carbohydrates) comprise 33% (one-third) of the total meal plate.', '["17%","25%","33%","50%"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:28:41.861Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758812936056-101', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'Dietary Requirement is the minimum amount of energy and nutrients needed to attain good health under specific conditions like: I. Age IV. Sex II. Weight V. Physiological conditions III. Physical activity *', 'I, II, III, IV, V', 'Dietary requirements represent the minimum physiological amount of energy and nutrients needed to maintain health under specific conditions governed by age (I), weight (II), physical activity (III), sex (IV), and physiological conditions like pregnancy or lactation (V).', '["I, II, III only","I, II, III, IV only","I, II, III, IV, V","I, II, IV, V only"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:06:45.087Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758812955322-102', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'What is the % energy intake of a 25 year-old male with an intake of 2400 kcal? *', '96%', 'To calculate percentage energy intake: 
Formula = (Actual Intake ÷ Recommended Energy Intake) × 100. 
For a 25-year-old male, the RENI recommended energy intake is approximately 2,500 kcal. 
Calculation = (2,400 ÷ 2,500) × 100 = 96%.', '["84%","96%","100%","105%"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:07:05.590Z"'::jsonb)
