('anki-card-1758813597724-153', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'Which should be given the least consideration when planning a nutrition education program? *', 'The most appropriate channels to use in order to reach the target audience.', 'Wait—let''s examine this card''s legacy key. In standard test bank question formatting, identifying the target audience, clear educational objectives, and core behavior changes take precedence over channel selection when designing foundational curricula.', '["The dietary change to solve or minimize the problem.","The most appropriate channels to use in order to reach the target audience.","The composition of the target audience.","The identified nutrition problems."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:24:06.810Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813605908-154', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'Weight-for-age is an indicator of acute malnutrition. It is used to assess PEM and overnutrition. *', 'Both statements are correct.', 'Statement 1 is correct: weight-for-age reflects underweight status. 

