('anki-card-1758813613939-155', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'The most frequently used biochemical marker of vitamin A status is: *', 'serum retinol concentration', 'Serum retinol concentration remains the most widely utilized biochemical marker in public health surveys to assess population-level Vitamin A status.', '["liver stores of vitamin A","urinary vitamin A excretion","muscle retinol concentration","serum retinol concentration"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:24:19.273Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813622307-156', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'Who among these adolescents is most likely to develop malnutrition? *', 'a 16-year-old who is pregnant for the first time', 'Adolescent pregnancy combines high nutritional requirements for maternal growth, fetal development, and psychological vulnerability, placing a first-time pregnant 16-year-old at the absolute highest risk for malnutrition and adverse outcomes.', '["a 12-year-old who does not eat vegetables","a 16-year-old who is pregnant for the first time","an 8-year-old who does not eat but drinks 4 glasses of milk daily","a 10-year-old who seldom eats but drinks 4 glasses of milk daily"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:24:23.870Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813629673-157', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'The caloric content of an alcoholic drink containing 15 grams alcohol, 6 grams carbohydrate, and a gram each of fat and protein is: *', '142', 'Energy calculation: 
