('anki-card-1758813637122-158', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'It is not a good source of calcium: *', 'butter', 'Butter is a concentrated dairy fat containing negligible calcium, whereas dark green leafy vegetables, canned fish with bones (bangus), and tofu (tokwa) are rich sources of calcium.', '["black beans","butter","canned bangus","tokwa"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:24:29.802Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813644906-159', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'Which of the following is a sign of a vitamin deficiency? *', 'keratinization of epithelial cells', 'Vitamin A deficiency causes cellular differentiation failure, leading to drying, thickening, and keratinization of epithelial cells (e.g., Bitot''s spots, xerophthalmia).', '["enlargement of the liver","keratinization of epithelial cells","pale conjunctiva","muscle wasting"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:24:32.896Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813660137-160', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'A reasonable weight gain during pregnancy for a normal weight woman is about _____. *', '30 pounds', 'For a normal-weight woman carrying a single fetus, recommended total gestational weight gain ranges between 25 and 35 pounds (averaging about 30 pounds).', '["20 pounds","30 pounds","40 pounds","10 pounds"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:24:38.286Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813675371-161', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'Which of the following is a provision of the Milk Code? *', 'Banning of advertisements of infant formulas.', 'Executive Order No. 51 (The Philippine Milk Code) strictly regulates breast milk substitutes and mandates prohibitions against deceptive marketing, advertising, and free samples of infant formula to protect breastfeeding.', '["Sponsorship of milk companies to host seminars for mothers.","Giving of samples or other paraphernalia produced by milk companies.","Banning of advertisements of infant formulas.","Promotion of milk substitutes."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:24:42.005Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813684136-162', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'The blood test of a 7-year-old female showed a hemoglobin value of 12%. How will you interpret this result? *', 'The child has a normal hemoglobin value.', 'A hemoglobin value of 12 g/dL (often recorded as 12% in legacy notation scales) falls within normal reference limits for a school-age child, indicating a normal hemoglobin value.', '["The child is very sick.","The child is anemic.","The child has a normal hemoglobin value.","The child has leukemia."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:24:45.980Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813693051-163', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'Food production is a direct nutrition intervention. This is also true in the case of food fortification. *', 'Both statements are correct.', 'Statement 1 is correct: agricultural food production targeting nutritional yields serves as a direct agricultural nutrition intervention. 

