('anki-card-1758813703752-164', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'All are being experienced by the elderly except: *', 'increased diastolic blood pressure', 'Normal physiological aging involves arterial stiffening and increased systolic blood pressure, whereas diastolic blood pressure typically plateaus or declines slightly in later life, making increased diastolic blood pressure the correct exception.', '["sensitivity to taste","loss of teeth","increased diastolic blood pressure","decreased interest in food"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:24:58.919Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813713135-165', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'The latest government law on breastfeeding is: *', 'RA 10028', 'Republic Act No. 10028 (Expanded Breastfeeding Promotion Act of 2009) is the updated landmark law expanding lactation support and workplace lactation stations in the Philippines.', '["RA 8189","RA 10028","RA 7600","RA 1286"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:28:45.839Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813722517-166', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'The type of anemia characterized by a low hemoglobin value due to lack of iron, folate, vitamin B₁₂, and other nutrients: *', 'nutritional anemia', 'Nutritional anemia is defined clinically as a hemoglobin deficiency resulting directly from inadequate dietary intake or malabsorption of essential hemopoietic nutrients, specifically iron, folate, vitamin B12, and protein.', '["pernicious anemia","microcytic anemia","nutritional anemia","macrocytic anemia"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:25:52.155Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813758634-167', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'The most objective in the following nutritional assessment methods: *', 'analyzing blood composition', 'Analyzing blood composition (such as hemoglobin, hematocrit, serum ferritin, and plasma proteins) is considered the most objective and quantitative nutritional assessment method because it relies on direct laboratory measurement rather than subjective reporting or observation.', '["measuring height and weight","doing a dietary history","observing a meal consumption","analyzing blood composition"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:25:56.000Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813767449-168', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'A temporary measure to correct nutrient deficiency by giving pharmaceutically prepared vitamins and minerals: *', 'micronutrient supplementation', 'Micronutrient supplementation refers to the temporary public health measure of providing concentrated, pharmaceutically prepared vitamin and mineral capsules or drops to correct specific deficiencies.', '["supplementary feeding","food fortification","expanded immunization","micronutrient supplementation"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:26:00.047Z"'::jsonb),
