('anki-card-1758813840729-176', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'The food items that should be fortified in accordance to RA 8976 are: I. rice II. fruit juices III. salt IV. cooking oil *', 'I and IV', 'Under Republic Act No. 8976 (Philippine Food Fortification Act), mandatory food fortification applies specifically to staple foods: rice (fortified with iron) and cooking oil (fortified with vitamin A).', '["II and III","I and IV","III and IV","I and II"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:26:45.787Z"'::jsonb),
