Statement 2 is incorrect because dawdling does not inherently mean eating too little and a limited number of foods (which describes food neophobia or picky eating).', '["Both statements are correct.","The first statement is incorrect but the second statement is correct.","Both statements are incorrect.","The first statement is correct but the second statement is incorrect."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:26:56.304Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813859378-178', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'The following are examples of direct nutrition intervention: I. Supplementary feeding III. Income-generating activities II. Home food production IV. Infrastructure development *', 'I & II', 'Direct nutrition interventions are actions that directly improve nutrient intake and health status, including supplementary feeding (I) and home food production (II). Income generation and infrastructure represent indirect interventions.', '["III & IV","II & IV","I & III","I & II"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:27:01.453Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813872594-179', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'An orientation meeting is held with the Municipal Nutrition Committee on the steps in planning the municipal nutrition program. Which of the following is included in program monitoring and implementation? *', 'priority targets to be reached', 'During program implementation and monitoring orientation, reviewing the established priority targets to be reached is a core operational parameter used to track performance against goals.', '["mortality rates of 1-4 year-old children","reports of accomplishments of various interventions","priority targets to be reached","list of possible additional nutrition committee members"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:27:05.978Z"'::jsonb),
