('anki-card-1758813915709-184', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'Marasmus can result in low resistance to disease. It affects physical development but not mental development. *', 'The first statement is correct but the second statement is incorrect.', 'Statement 1 is correct: marasmus leads to severe muscle wasting and suppressed immunity, causing low disease resistance. 

Statement 2 is incorrect because severe early-life protein-energy malnutrition (including marasmus) profoundly impairs both physical and cognitive/mental development.', '["Both statements are correct.","The first statement is correct but the second statement is incorrect.","The first statement is incorrect but the second statement is correct.","Both statements are incorrect."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:27:38.252Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813924058-185', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'Lucy eats French fries and brownies occasionally. This practice demonstrates which principle of planning diets? *', 'moderation', 'Enjoying dense, high-calorie snack items like French fries and brownies only occasionally demonstrates the diet planning principle of moderation (limiting discretionary items without strict deprivation).', '["moderation","nutrient density","variety","balance"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:27:43.301Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813930490-186', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'The recommended frequency of weighing children from birth to the age of 1 year: *', 'monthly', 'Public health guidelines mandate that infants from birth to 1 year of age must be weighed monthly (via Operation Timbang Plus and growth monitoring) to track normal growth velocity.', '["twice a month","monthly","every 3 months","at birth only"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:27:47.575Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813939575-187', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'Nutrient bioavailability means: *', 'The amount of a nutrient in foods that is absorbed by the body.', 'Nutrient bioavailability refers specifically to the fraction of an ingested nutrient that is successfully digested, absorbed, and utilized by the body''s metabolic pathways.', '["The number of kilocalories in foods.","The amount of a nutrient in foods that is absorbed by the body.","The amount of a nutrient in foods.","The amount of food available in a given area."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:27:52.074Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813947640-188', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'This is not a healthy option for an overweight woman: *', 'Follow a weight loss diet during pregnancy.', 'Pregnant women—including those who are overweight—should never follow a restrictive weight loss diet during pregnancy, as caloric restriction starves the developing fetus of vital nutrients.', '["Postpone weight loss until after pregnancy.","Try to achieve a healthy weight before becoming pregnant.","Follow a weight loss diet during pregnancy.","Limit weight gain during pregnancy."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:27:55.958Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813965006-189', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'Which of the following is a concern of the Local Government Code? *', 'The transfer of some government personnel and functions to provinces and municipalities.', 'The Local Government Code (RA 7160) mandated the devolution and transfer of government personnel and basic services/functions (including health and nutrition services) to local government units (provinces and municipalities).', '["The expansion of the membership of the National Nutrition Council.","The transfer of the National Nutrition Council from the Department of Agriculture to the Department of Health.","The transfer of some government personnel and functions to provinces and municipalities.","The delineation of responsibilities of various national agencies."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:28:01.715Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813973590-190', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'Which of the following statements is true? *', 'Television advertising influences family food purchases.', 'Extensive communication and consumer research confirm that aggressive television and media advertising heavily shapes children''s food preferences and directly influences family food purchasing decisions.', '["There is no relationship between TV watching and increased snacking among children.","Watching television encourages children to choose the right food for them.","Watching television encourages the physical and mental stimulation among children.","Television advertising influences family food purchases."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:28:05.212Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813981337-191', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'The nutrition education component of the PPAN has a high rate of success. It is due to the active participation of parents. *', 'Both statements are incorrect.', 'Both statements are false: while PPAN education components are robust, attributing success solely to parental participation overlooks multi-sectoral planning, local governance, and resource inputs.', '["Both statements are incorrect.","Both statements are correct.","The first statement is correct but the second statement is incorrect.","The first statement is incorrect but the second statement is correct."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:30:00.332Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813989087-192', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'The effect of a lactating mother’s diet that is lacking in energy or protein: *', 'There is a reduction in the amount of milk produced.', 'If a lactating mother''s diet is severely deficient in energy and protein, her body prioritizes infant protection by drawing on maternal tissues, but persistent severe deficits eventually lead to a reduction in the total volume of milk produced rather than altering milk quality.', '["This has no effect on her milk production.","There is a reduction in the amount of milk produced.","The milk produced is of low quality.","The mother experiences a general weakness."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:30:03.820Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758813996987-193', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'These are effective teaching techniques used in educating mothers in nutrition except: *', 'doing a lecture', 'Passive lectures are the least effective technique for educating mothers compared to interactive, skill-building methods such as cooking demonstrations, role-playing, and case discussions.', '["role playing","using a case study","doing a lecture","doing a demonstration"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:30:10.419Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758814007989-194', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'The practical and nutritionally correct way of preventing constipation among the elderly is: *', 'increasing their intake of fruits and vegetables', 'The practical, physiologically correct dietary approach to preventing and managing constipation among older adults is increasing dietary fiber and fluid intake through whole fruits and vegetables.', '["drinking prune juice everyday","removing fat in the diet","increasing their intake of fruits and vegetables","increasing their intake of rice and root crops"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:30:14.663Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758814015611-195', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'These vitamins are needed in high amounts during pregnancy because of their role in red blood cell formation: I. folate II. vitamin E III. vitamin C IV. cobalamin *', 'I & IV', 'Pregnancy increases requirements for red blood cell formation, requiring higher intakes of folate (I) for DNA synthesis and cobalamin / Vitamin B12 (IV) for erythropoiesis.', '["II & III","I & IV","I & II","III & IV"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:28:09.721Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758814024637-196', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'Retention of information is best at the beginning and end of a teaching session. The attention span of participants is 2 hours. *', 'Only the first statement is correct.', 'Statement 1 is correct: cognitive retention during a teaching session peaks at the beginning and the end (primacy and recency effects). 

Statement 2 is incorrect because the average adult attention span in structured lectures is typically much shorter (approx. 15–20 minutes), not 2 hours.', '["Both statements are correct.","Both statements are incorrect.","Only the first statement is correct.","Only the second statement is correct."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:28:16.999Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758814039086-197', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'It is a distinct characteristic of a 2-year-old: *', 'The child wants to eat independently.', 'A distinctive psychosocial and developmental milestone of a 2-year-old toddler is striving for autonomy, including a strong desire to eat independently.', '["The child becomes taller.","The child is not interested in food.","The child wants to eat independently.","The child is sickly and is prone to infections."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:28:21.050Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758814050869-198', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'Why does a 60-year-old man need less thiamin than an active 18-year-old teenager? *', 'His caloric/energy output is generally less.', 'Thiamin (Vitamin B6/B1) requirements are tied directly to energy metabolism; an older adult requires less thiamin than an active teenager because his overall caloric and energy output is lower.', '["His thiamin excretion is less.","His need for protein is less.","His caloric/energy output is generally less.","His tissues have been saturated throughout the years."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:28:25.911Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758814058151-199', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'What is the main role of the agricultural sector in the country’s nutrition program? *', 'Encouraging home production of vegetables and fruits.', 'The primary role of the agricultural sector in national nutrition programming is promoting food security by encouraging home and community food production of nutrient-dense fruits and vegetables (gardening).', '["Conducting researches on foods rich in nutrients.","Fortification of staple foods.","Rural livelihood programs.","Encouraging home production of vegetables and fruits."]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.265Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T12:28:29.876Z"'::jsonb),
