('anki-card-1754976514874-66', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608899092-1790433139852-81xmm', 'An intervention where the government controls and/or reduces the prices of staple food to make these foods available and accessible to the target group of nutrition programs.', 'Food Subsidy', 'Answer: Food Subsidy', '["Food Subsidy","PD 1211","7160\n1991","Eat a variety of foods every day to get the nutrients needed by the body.\n\n2. Breastfeed infant exclusively from birth up to 6 months..\n\n3. Eat more vegetables and fruits to get the essential vitamins, minerals, and fiber for regulation of body processes.\n\n4. Consume fish, lean, meat, poultry, egg, dried beans, or nuts daily for growth and repair of body tissue.\n\n5. Consume milk, milk products, and other calcium-rich food ...\n\n6. Consume safe foods and water to prevent diarrhea and other disease ..\n\n7. Use iodized salt to prevent IDD\n\n8. Limit intake of salty, fried, datty, and sugar-rich foods\n\n9. Attain normal body weight through proper diet ...\n\n10. Be physically active, make healthy food choices, manage stress, avoid alcoholic beverage"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":1}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.930Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-08T12:24:43.573Z"'::jsonb),
