D. Vitamin A and iron - wheat flour', '["Vitamin A","Iron","Iodine","Vitamin A and Iron"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 2, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-10-25T15:34:21.999Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.3,"repetitions":1}'::jsonb, '"2026-10-24T15:34:21.999Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.310Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-24T15:34:22.204Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1754292691495-110', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783608953857-1790433145942-e1oub', 'Under the mandatory food fortification program, refined sugar is fortified with:', 'Vit A', 'See RA 8976 (Philippine Food Fortification Act of 2000):

A. Vitamin A – oil, sugar
