('anki-card-1755589579476-107', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609155594-1790433139836-6hvft', 'Sentence A: During rigor mortis, actomyosin dissociates to actin and myosin resulting in tough meat.
Sentence B: Rigor mortis is the stiffening of muscle.', 'Sentence B is correct', '“During rigor mortis, actomyosin dissociates to actin and myosin resulting in tough meat.”

This statement is incorrect. During rigor mortis, actomyosin, a complex formed by actin and myosin, is what actually causes muscle stiffening. The dissociation of actomyosin into actin and myosin happens after rigor mortis, during the resolution phase when the muscle starts to soften again.

“Rigor mortis is the stiffening of muscle.”

This statement is correct. Rigor mortis is the post-mortem stiffening of muscles due to chemical changes in the muscle fibers, primarily the formation of actomyosin as ATP is depleted.', '["Sentence A is correct","Sentence B is correct","Both sentences are correct","Both sentences are incorrect"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-08-30T20:00:00.000Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":2}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.839Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-07T14:32:00.423Z"'::jsonb),
