('anki-card-1758784336919-74', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Hydrolytic rancidity is accelerated by: *', 'action of lipases', 'Hydrolytic rancidity is accelerated by the enzymatic action of lipases (either naturally present in food or produced by psychrotrophic microbes), which hydrolyze ester bonds in fats to release free fatty acids.', '["exposure to air","action of lipases","presence of metals","all of the above"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:59:01.411Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784345000-75', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Factor that promotes discoloration of carrots: *', 'exposure to air', '', '["treatment with acid","heating","exposure to air","treatment with baking soda"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784352501-76', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'The ingredient which serves as substrate for yeast fermentation in dough. *', 'sugar', 'Fermenting yeasts metabolize simple hexose sugars (glucose and fructose) as their primary substrate, producing carbon dioxide gas and alcohol during bread dough fermentation.', '["salt","fat","sugar","acid"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:59:06.892Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784363085-77', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'A dispersion which has the smallest particle size: *', 'true solution', 'A true solution is a homogeneous mixture where solute particles are of molecular or ionic dimensions (<1 nanometer), representing the smallest particle size among dispersions (compared to colloidal dispersions and coarse suspensions).', '["true solution","colloidal dispersion","none of the above","suspension"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:59:19.975Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784371851-78', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'The first organ used to judge food quality. *', 'eyes', 'The eyes serve as the first organ used to judge food quality visually (evaluating color, gloss, shape, and freedom from defects) before smelling, touching, or tasting.', '["tongue","nose","eyes","none of the above"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:00:30.790Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784381551-79', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Organic compound responsible for the characteristic flavor of butter. *', 'fatty acid', 'Diacetyl (along with acetoin) is the primary volatile organic compound and aromatic diketone responsible for the characteristic buttery flavor and aroma of butter.

• Glycerol / Fatty acid / Beta-carotene: Structural lipids or pigments, but diacetyl drives the distinct flavor profile.', '["glycerol","fatty acid","beta carotene","diacetyl"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:00:34.674Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784389383-80', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'A flour also known as soft or weak flour due to its low protein content. *', 'cake flour', 'Cake flour is milled from soft wheat and has a low protein content (~7–9%), making it a soft or weak flour ideal for tender, delicate cakes.

• Bread flour: Hard wheat with high protein (~12–14%).
• Pastry flour: Intermediate protein (~9–10%).
• All-purpose flour: General-purpose blend (~10–12%).', '["pastry flour","bread flour","cake flour","all-purpose flour"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:00:48.890Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784396832-81', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Ingredient in baking powder that leavens: *', 'baking soda', 'Baking soda (sodium bicarbonate) is the alkaline chemical leavening agent that reacts with acid to release carbon dioxide gas in baking powder formulations.', '["acid","baking soda","cornstarch","flour"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:00:53.090Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784406815-82', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'All soups are based on: *', 'stock', 'Stock—a flavorful liquid simmered from bones, mirepoix, and aromatics—serves as the foundational base for virtually all classical soups.', '["water","bouillon","garni","stock"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:00:56.528Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784419799-83', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Shortenings are solid at room temperature since they have gone through: *', 'hydrogenation', 'Hydrogenation is the chemical process of adding hydrogen atoms across unsaturated double bonds in liquid vegetable oils, turning them into solid or semi-solid shortenings at room temperature.', '["fermentation","clarification","emulsification","hydrogenation"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:01:00.190Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784597141-84', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Cream which contains 30% - 36% milk fat. *', 'light whipping cream', 'Light whipping cream contains approximately 30% to 36% milk fat, making it suitable for whipping into light foams.

• Heavy cream: Contains 36% to 40%+ milk fat.
• Half and half: Contains 10.5% to 18% milk fat.', '["heavy cream","medium cream","light whipping cream","half and half cream"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:01:07.227Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784834276-85', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Examples of this shellfish are lobsters, crabs, shrimps, and crayfish. *', 'crustaceans', 'Crustaceans are a category of shellfish characterized by segmented bodies and hard exoskeletons, including lobsters, crabs, shrimps, and crayfish.

• Mollusks: Soft-bodied shellfish like clams, oysters, and squids.', '["mollusks","finfishes","crustaceans","cuttle fish"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:01:12.300Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784851496-86', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Sauce of eggyolk, butter, and vinegar. *', 'béarnaise', 'Béarnaise sauce is a rich classical emulsion sauce derived from hollandaise, flavored with egg yolk, clarified butter, vinegar/white wine reduction, and tarragon/shallots.

• Allemande / Hollandaise: White or butter-lemon emulsion sauces without tarragon reduction.', '["allemande","hollandaise","béarnaise","borsch"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:01:16.786Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784859093-87', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Process of pouring meat drippings over the surface of meat while broiling. *', 'basting', 'Basting is the culinary technique of spooning or pouring melted fat, pan drippings, or sauces over the surface of roasting or broiling meat to prevent drying out and enhance flavor.', '["braising","basting","salting","marinating"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:01:21.020Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784866576-88', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Example of a poultry part classified as white meat. *', 'breasts', 'Chicken and poultry breasts consist predominantly of fast-twitch muscle fibers with low myoglobin content, classifying them as white meat.

• Drumstick / Wings: Dark meat containing higher myoglobin and fat content due to postural support.', '["drumstick","neck","wings","breasts"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:01:25.016Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784876109-89', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Method of cooking egg in which it is broken out of the shell and dropped in simmering water. *', 'poaching', 'Poaching is a gentle moist-heat cooking method where food (such as a shelled egg) is submerged and cooked in simmering liquid maintained just below the boiling point (82°C–96°C).', '["poaching","scrambled","boiling","soufflé"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:12:23.126Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784885845-90', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Property of sugar which is relevant in keeping baked products moist and soft. *', 'hygroscopic ability', 'Sugar is highly hygroscopic (it readily attracts and binds moisture from the surrounding air), a functional property that helps retain moisture, keeping baked goods soft and preventing rapid staling.', '["solubility","effect of crystallization","hygroscopic ability","intensity of sweetness"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:12:26.886Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784893759-91', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Too much kneading results in a/an ____ dough. *', 'inelastic', 'Excessive, prolonged kneading breaks down and over-stretches the gluten protein strands, resulting in an overly tough, rigid, and inelastic dough that snaps back or resists proper shaping.', '["soft","uniform","inelastic","non-sticky"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:12:33.349Z"'::jsonb)
