('anki-card-1758784912626-92', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Locally known as “pata”. *', 'knuckles', '"Pata" is the local Filipino culinary term for pork knuckles or hocks (front or hind leg joints).

• Spare ribs / Shoulder butt / Jowl: Distinct anatomical cuts of pork.', '["spare ribs","knuckles","shoulder butt","jowl"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:48:52.463Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784921574-93', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Light, fluffy, baked or steamed egg dish. *', 'soufflé', 'A soufflé is a light, airy, baked or steamed egg-based dish structured by beaten egg whites folded into a flavored base cream or purée.

• Omelet / Scrambled: Folded or stirred egg dishes without the puffed baked soufflé structure.
• Fondue: Melted cheese dish.', '["scrambled","fondue","omelet","soufflé"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:49:06.218Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784933358-94', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Ice cream with fruits or chocolate syrup. *', 'parfait', 'A parfait is a layered dessert typically featuring ice cream interspersed with fruits, syrups, liqueurs, or whipped cream.

• Mousse: Lightly whipped, aerated chilled dessert cream.
• Sherbet: Frozen fruit-based dessert containing milk solids.', '["mousse","sherbet","parfait","soufflé"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:49:11.601Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784942374-95', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'A light, airy crystalline candy containing a large amount of egg white which is added to the syrup while still very hot. *', 'divinity', 'Divinity is a light, airy, crystalline confectionery candy made by beating a hot sugar-corn syrup mixture directly into stiffly whipped egg whites.

• Brittle / Fudge / Fondant: Confections with different sugar crystal structures and cooking methods.', '["divinity","brittle","fudge","fondant"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:49:19.687Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784950473-96', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'A process of fermenting starch like in beer making. *', 'malting', 'Malting is the specialized process of steeping, germinating, and drying cereal grains (like barley) to activate starch-converting enzymes for brewing and distilling.

• Dextrinization: Partial breakdown of starch into dextrins via dry heat.', '["dextrinizing","brewing","gelation","malting"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:49:23.759Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784959988-97', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Process of allowing the dough to rise before baking under controlled temperature: *', 'proofing', 'Proofing is the final fermentation stage of allowing shaped yeast dough to rise under controlled temperature and humidity conditions right before baking.

• Kneading: Mechanical development of gluten.
• Punching: Deflating fermented dough to redistribute yeast and gases.', '["proofing","punching","kneading","fermenting"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:49:28.636Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784981640-98', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Method of mixing flour mixture applied to butter cake and pound cake. *', 'conventional method', 'The conventional method (cream-butter method) involves creaming fat and sugar together, beating in eggs, and alternately adding dry and liquid ingredients, which is the standard procedure for butter and pound cakes.

• Muffin method: Liquid fats mixed with dry ingredients quickly.', '["muffin method","pastry method","conventional method","one-bowl method"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:49:32.764Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758784992506-99', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'The use of too much leavening produces a baked product with: *', 'a low volume', 'Excessive leavening (baking powder or soda) produces too much gas too rapidly before the gluten and starch structure can set, causing the cell walls to stretch and rupture, leading to structural collapse and a low volume.', '["a high volume","a low volume","smooth texture","moistness"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.352Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:49:38.289Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758785010138-100', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Thick soups or stews usually containing seafood, potatoes, and milk or cream. *', 'chowders', 'Chowders are rich, thick American soups or stews traditionally containing seafood (clams, fish), diced potatoes, onions, and milk or cream.

• Bisques: Smooth, cream-based puréed shellfish soups.
• Potages: General French term for thick or clear soups.', '["potages","chowders","stocks","bisques"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.715Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:50:30.160Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758785023971-101', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'To brown the surface of meat by a short application of intense heat. *', 'sear', 'Searing is the culinary technique of browning the outer surface of meat quickly using intense, high dry heat to develop rich Maillard flavors and color.', '["sear","steep","scald","singe"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.715Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:50:34.971Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758785032721-102', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'This refers to the process of reducing the number of pathogenic microorganisms in equipment and utensils. *', 'sanitization', 'Sanitization is the chemical or thermal process of reducing pathogenic microorganisms on cleaned equipment and utensils down to safe public health levels.

• Sterilization: Complete destruction of all microbial forms.
• Cleaning: Removal of visible soil.', '["sanitization","cleaning","sterilization","pasteurization"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.715Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:50:39.587Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758785042319-103', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Which is not a guideline in writing a menu? *', 'Do not provide descriptions of products.', 'This guideline is false, making it the correct exception. Effective menu writing should include appetizing, accurate descriptions of food products to guide customer expectations and stimulate sales.', '["Do not provide descriptions of products.","The main dish should be given the most prominent space.","Capitalize all words except articles.","Choose an easy-to-handle size."]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.715Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:50:44.462Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758785061269-104', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'A fish stock made with wine or lemon juice. *', 'fumet', 'A fumet is a concentrated fish stock simmered with fish bones, white wine, lemon juice, and aromatics.

• Veloute: A grand sauce made from stock and roux.', '["fumet","white stock","brown stock","veloute"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.715Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:50:49.325Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758785074551-105', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Which is not an institution-based food service? *', 'Mc Donalds', 'Commercial fast-food chains like McDonald''s operate as commercial retail foodservice establishments, whereas institutional foodservices include corporate canteens, university dining halls, military messes, and hospital kitchens.', '["SM employee cafeteria","Corporate canteen at the Asian Development Bank","Mc Donalds","Military foodservices"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.715Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:50:53.164Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758785083417-106', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'This tool is used to drain foods when they are lifted from liquid. *', 'slotted spoon', 'A slotted spoon features perforations that allow liquids to drain through while lifting solid food items out of pots or serving vessels.', '["spatula","slotted spoon","basting spoon","colander"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.715Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:50:58.187Z"'::jsonb),
