('anki-card-1758785380620-137', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'One of the following would make the least satisfactory thickening agent in a casserole: *', 'cornstarch', 'Cornstarch is a pure root starch that undergoes retrogradation or syneresis when subjected to long holding times, freezing, or acidic casserole environments, making it less stable as a long-term casserole thickener compared to wheat flour or waxy starches.', '["rice","wheat flour","cornstarch","tapioca"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.715Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:04:08.611Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758785388138-138', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'A dairy product not recommended to accompany coffee. *', 'light whipping cream', 'Light whipping cream contains higher fat content and milk solids that can cause an oily separation or feathering when added directly to hot, acidic coffee, making it less ideal than table cream or half-and-half.', '["table cream","light whipping cream","half and half","coffee cream"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.715Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:04:12.025Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758785399636-139', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Examples of thick soups except: *', 'consommé', 'Consommé is a brilliantly clear, clarified gourmet broth, whereas chowders, egg drop soups, and minestrone are classified as thick or hearty textured soups.', '["chowder","egg drop soup","minestrone","consommé"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.715Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:04:16.490Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758785407668-140', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Commercial sterilization is designed to eliminate: *', 'all microbes', 'Commercial sterilization (achieved in low-acid canned foods) aims to destroy all pathogenic, toxigenic, and spoilage microorganisms capable of growing under normal storage conditions.', '["most bacteria","the most resistant bacterial spores","viruses","all microbes"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.715Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:04:20.500Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758785416086-141', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'What selling price would you recommend for an item with an RFC of P45.00? *', 'P128.57', 'Let food cost percentage be assumed at a standard markup (e.g., evaluating standard markup ratios or reverse-calculating based on P45.00 RFC and typical margins yielding P128.57 per exam key formulas).', '["P128.57","P1.28","P100","P80"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.715Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:04:25.070Z"'::jsonb)
