('anki-card-1758785955961-192', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Agedashi is a Japanese dish of deep-fried _____. *', 'tofu', 'Agedashi tofu is a traditional Japanese dish consisting of small cubes of soft tofu that are lightly coated in potato starch, deep-fried until golden, and served in a hot dashi broth.', '["chicken","pork","tofu","fish"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.715Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:49:00.202Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758785965444-193', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'The foodservice system that requires the least kitchen skills. *', 'Assembly serve', 'Assembly-serve systems purchase foods fully prepared or highly processed, requiring the absolute least amount of on-site culinary cooking skills from kitchen staff.', '["Conventional","Assembly serve","Commissary","Ready-prepared system"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.715Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:11:45.689Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758785973258-194', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'The foodservice system concerned with providing dining service. *', 'Conventional', 'Conventional foodservice systems prepare foods from raw ingredients on-site and serve them directly to customers within the same facility.', '["Conventional","Assembly serve","Commissary","Ready-prepared system"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.715Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:11:54.225Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758785981559-195', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'The type of range used for short-order preparations: *', 'open burner', 'Open burner gas ranges provide rapid, adjustable heat control, making them ideal for short-order preparations and quick-service cooking stations.', '["induction top","closed burner","griddle top","open burner"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.715Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:11:58.036Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758785990059-196', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Which of the following is associated with salmonella? *', 'raw chicken', 'Raw poultry and chicken are universally recognized as primary reservoirs for Salmonella bacterial contamination.', '["hamburger","raw chicken","ground beef","steamed vegetables"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.715Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:12:01.503Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758786001558-197', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Foods remain unsafe when held in the temperature danger zone for more than ____: *', '4 hours', 'Public health food safety codes mandate that perishable foods held within the Temperature Danger Zone for a cumulative total of more than 4 hours must be discarded due to high pathogen proliferation risks.', '["1 hour","2 hours","3 hours","4 hours"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.715Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:12:06.552Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758786011208-198', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Qualitative and quantitative research methods can be used in foodservice studies. Incidence reports, surveys, and interviews are some of the commonly-used research tools. *', 'Both statements are correct.', 'Statement 1 is correct: both qualitative and quantitative research methods are valuable in foodservice studies. 

Statement 2 is correct: incidence reports, structured surveys, and interviews are standard research data-gathering tools.', '["Only the second statement is correct.","Both statements are incorrect.","Only the first statement is correct.","Both statements are correct."]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.715Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:12:13.107Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758786020890-199', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609268127-1790433136748-a3r8j', 'Which is not a corrective action? *', 'Rejecting a new shipment of chicken.', 'Rejecting an incoming raw food shipment at the loading dock is a preventive receiving control or prerequisite purchasing action, whereas correcting an active deviation during food production constitutes a formal HACCP corrective action.', '["Continuing to cook hamburger until it reaches a minimum internal temperature of 155°F for 15 seconds.","Discarding cooked chicken that has been held at 120°F for 5 hours.","Sanitizing a preparation table before starting a new task.","Rejecting a new shipment of chicken."]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.715Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:12:18.193Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758814712978-0', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'Pigments that are very soluble in cooking water. *', 'anthocyanins', 'Anthocyanins are water-soluble flavonoid pigments (found in red cabbage, berries, and black rice) that leach readily into cooking water, changing hue based on pH.

