('anki-card-1758815652655-92', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'The process that prevents the separation of fat to the aqueous portion of milk. *', 'homogenization', 'Homogenization mechanically forces milk under extreme pressure through microscopic valves, breaking fat globules down so small that they remain permanently suspended without separating or creaming to the top.', '["creaming","homogenization","pasteurization","coalescence"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.388Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:46:20.794Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758815664006-93', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'Leafy greens when blanched in water intensify their color because: *', 'air cells are removed', 'Blanching green vegetables expels microscopic pockets of trapped air surrounding plant tissues, allowing light to reflect uniformly and intensifying the vivid green chlorophyll color.', '["phytol is cut","air cells are removed","it becomes soluble","acids interact with the pigment"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.388Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:46:24.721Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758815699539-94', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'Which of the following explains how sugar slows down pectin solubilization? *', 'sugars compete for water', 'Sugar molecules form strong hydrogen bonds with water molecules, decreasing water activity and competing with pectin for hydration, which slows down pectin solubilization and extraction during preserve making.', '["sugars hydrolyze pectin molecules to shorter molecules","sugars complex with pectin resulting in insoluble salts","sugars compete for water","sugars increase water activity"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.388Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:27:03.540Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758815707038-95', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'The ideal internal temperature of a well-done pork: *', '77°C', 'According to culinary and food safety safety standards, pork must be cooked to an internal temperature of at least 77°C (170°F) to ensure doneness and pathogen destruction.', '["77°C","77°F","70°C","70°F"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.388Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:46:28.676Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758815714537-96', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'The main meat ingredient of “Callos” is: *', 'tripe', 'Tripe (the muscular inner lining of bovine stomach chambers) is the primary traditional meat ingredient used in Spanish-Filipino stew dishes like Callos.', '["brisket","liempo","tenderloin","tripe"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.388Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:46:33.133Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758815723070-97', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'An important consideration when cooking legumes: *', 'use soft water in cooking legumes', 'Soft water (low in calcium and magnesium) is ideal for cooking dried legumes because hard water minerals react with plant pectins to form insoluble salts that toughen bean skins and prolong cooking time.', '["use soft water in cooking legumes","add salt at the beginning of the cooking process","add an acid at the beginning of the cooking process","use hard water in cooking legumes"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.388Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:46:37.316Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758815744502-98', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'What ice cream will keep best? *', 'chocolate', 'Chocolate ice cream contains cocoa butter, milk solids, and stabilizers that provide a rich, stable emulsion structure, allowing it to maintain its texture and store better against freezer crystallization compared to lighter fruit flavors.', '["strawberry","vanilla","chocolate","all of the above"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.388Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:46:41.648Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758815752653-99', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'All are vegetables except: *', 'potato', 'Botanically and culinary, potatoes are classified as starchy tubers, whereas carrots (roots), garlic (bulbs), and onions (bulbs) are classified under vegetable classifications.', '["carrot","garlic","onion","potato"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.388Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:26:04.013Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758815760850-100', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'Which of the following is not a principle of HACCP? *', 'spot-checking of finished products', 'Spot-checking finished products is a verification or quality control activity, whereas Hazard Analysis Critical Control Point (HACCP) is a preventive management system built on 7 core principles: hazard analysis, critical control points (CCPs), critical limits, monitoring procedures, corrective actions, verification procedures, and record-keeping.

• Analyze hazard: Principle 1 of HACCP.
• Establish corrective actions: Principle 5 of HACCP.
• Establish critical limits: Principle 3 of HACCP.', '["analyze hazard","establish corrective actions","spot-checking of finished products","establish critical limits"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:25:04.883Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758815776985-101', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'What is not true about the Work Simplification study? *', 'It decreases the overall productivity of employees.', 'A work simplification study aims to streamline tasks, eliminate waste, and increase or optimize operational productivity rather than decrease it.', '["It was developed by Frank and Lillian Gilbreth.","It emerged under the Classical Scientific Management Theory.","It decreases the overall productivity of employees.","It has important contributions in scheduling."]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:25:12.319Z"'::jsonb),
