Sentence 2 is correct: it is commonly referred to as the Nutritionist-Dietitian Code of Ethics.', '["Only the first sentence is correct.","Only the second sentence is correct.","Both sentences are correct.","Both sentences are incorrect."]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:27:15.346Z"'::jsonb),
