('anki-card-1758815808949-104', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'The managerial function involved in the creation of policies and rules in an organization. *', 'Planning', 'Planning is the foundational managerial function that involves establishing organizational goals, policies, rules, and courses of action.

