('anki-card-1758815815716-105', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'A component of Emotional Quotient that describes the ability of the employee to identify his/her strengths. *', 'self-awareness', 'Self-awareness is the core Emotional Intelligence (EQ) component defined as the ability of an individual to accurately recognize and understand their own emotions, strengths, limitations, and drivers.', '["empathy","self-awareness","self-regulation","social skills"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:45:12.112Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758815823465-106', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'Price increase may be applied to these popular items with low profitability: *', 'plow horse', 'In menu engineering matrix models, "plow horses" are menu items that exhibit high sales volume or popularity but yield low profit margins. Management often applies strategic price increases or cost-control measures to improve their profitability.

• Star items: High popularity, high profit.
• Puzzle: Low popularity, high profit.
• Dog: Low popularity, low profit.', '["star items","puzzle","plow horse","dog"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:45:17.249Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758815831114-107', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'According to PD 856 IRR for foodservice establishments, the intensity of illumination recommended for tasks requiring discrimination of fine details should b: *', '100 footcandles', 'According to the Implementing Rules and Regulations (IRR) of Presidential Decree No. 856 (Code on Sanitation of the Philippines) for food service establishments, food preparation and inspection areas requiring discrimination of fine details must maintain an illumination intensity of at least 100 footcandles (approx. 1,000 lux).', '["100 footcandles","120 footcandles","140 footcandles","80 footcandles"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:26:09.145Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758815838915-108', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'A system of regular, scheduled inspection and service of equipment which may break, wear out, or become impaired is: *', 'preventive maintenance', 'Preventive maintenance is a scheduled system of routine inspections and servicing designed to prevent equipment breakdowns, wear, and operational impairment.

• Periodic maintenance / Regular repair: Reactive or intermittent maintenance rather than structured scheduled prevention.', '["periodic maintenance","preventive maintenance","regular repair","critical control point"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:26:14.751Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758815848529-109', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'The floor and wall material recommended for use in storerooms, receiving areas, and laundry areas: *', 'concrete', 'Concrete floors and walls provide durable, non-absorbent, and easily scrubbable surfaces ideal for high-traffic or heavy-load areas like storerooms, receiving docks, and laundry facilities.

