('anki-card-1758815889677-113', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'Ideal space in between the wall of the storage area and the storage shelves: *', '3 inches', 'Food storage sanitation standards mandate that storage shelves must be placed at least 6 inches off the floor and maintain a minimum clearance of 3 inches away from walls to ensure adequate air circulation and pest inspection access.', '["6 inches","2 inches","3 inches","12 inches"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:26:43.709Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758815898612-114', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'A ____ deals with the arrangement of the physical facilities for the foodservice operation. *', 'layout', 'Facility planning terminology defines a layout as the specific spatial arrangement of physical equipment, workstations, and interior facilities within a foodservice operation.

