('anki-card-1758815907728-115', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'The following work stations belong to one work center except: *', 'production', 'Receiving belongs to the purchasing and receiving center, whereas production, storing, and issuing belong directly to the internal culinary production and inventory control centers.', '["production","receiving","issuing","storing"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:26:52.165Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758815918193-116', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'Principle of Flexibility and Modularity aims to achieve: *', 'efficient production', 'The foodservice design principle of flexibility and modularity aims to allow equipment rearrangement and workflow adaptability to achieve efficient production.', '["efficient production","reduced cost of equipment","food safety","less maintenance cost"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:26:59.311Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758815925776-117', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'The main basis for space allocation is: *', 'menu', 'In foodservice facility planning, the menu dictates food processing requirements, recipes, and service styles, serving as the absolute primary basis for spatial layout and space allocation.', '["menu","type of equipment material","manpower","quantity of equipment"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:34:40.892Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758815933977-118', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'Minimizing distance between kitchen and service point would: *', 'maintain food quality', 'Minimizing the physical distance and transport time between the kitchen production area and the dining service point prevents temperature loss, spoilage, and textural degradation, directly maintaining optimal food quality.', '["maintain food quality","maintain food quantity","increase equipment efficiency","improve customer service"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:34:44.392Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758815943110-119', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'The most practical type of storage in mall type stores is: *', 'reach-in chiller', 'For high-turnover, smaller-format retail outlets or convenience/mall stores, reach-in chillers provide the most accessible, practical, and energy-efficient refrigerated storage.', '["reach-in chiller","blast chiller","walk-in chiller","chest freezer"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:34:48.336Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758815952075-120', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'A part of hiring process that aims to integrate the new hiree into the company’s culture: *', 'socialization', 'Socialization is the onboarding and orientation process designed to integrate new employees into the company''s organizational culture, norms, and operational values.', '["socialization","training","providing pep talk","performance appraisal"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:34:51.654Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758815963425-121', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'A cleaning agent used in removing grease and fat from surfaces. *', 'solvent cleaner', 'Solvent cleaners (degreasers) are specialized chemical cleaning agents formulated specifically to dissolve and remove stubborn grease and fat films from kitchen surfaces.

• Abrasive cleaners: Utilize physical friction to scrub baked-on soils.', '["detergent","abrasive cleaner","solvent cleaner","all of the above"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:34:56.772Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758815975092-122', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'Which of the following is not a biological hazard? *', 'milk', 'Milk is a safe perishable food vehicle (though a potential source of pathogens if raw), whereas fish toxins, E. coli, and Vibrio cholerae represent distinct biological contamination hazards.', '["fish toxin","E. coli","Vibrio cholerae","milk"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:35:00.295Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816036905-123', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'The recommended material for fabricating racks to be used in storage areas: *', 'stainless steel', 'Stainless steel is the industry-standard material for fabricating commercial kitchen storage racks and equipment because it is corrosion-resistant, durable, non-porous, and easily sanitized.

• Wood: Porous and harbors bacteria; prohibited for food contact and storage shelving.', '["iron","wood","concrete","stainless steel"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:35:05.553Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816044803-124', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'Do not thaw food: *', 'on a drainboard of a sink', 'Thawing perishable foods on an unrefrigerated sink drainboard exposes food surfaces to ambient room temperatures where pathogenic bacteria multiply rapidly, violating food safety codes.

