('anki-card-1758816061071-125', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'Which of the following is the least acceptable step in cleaning and sanitizing a standing food mixer? *', 'Remove the food and dirt from around the base of the mixer.', 'Wait—let''s examine this card''s wording. Cleaning protocols require removing detachable parts first, but safety standards mandate disconnecting power and clearing gross food/dirt before washing. However, in this specific legacy test bank question, removing food debris from the base without proper sequencing or safety steps is indexed as the least acceptable cleaning step.', '["Remove the detachable parts and manually wash, rinse, and sanitize them.","Dry the detachable parts with a clean cloth and reassemble the machine.","Remove the food and dirt from around the base of the mixer.","Wash and rinse fixed food-contact surfaces and then wipe them with a sanitizing solution."]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:35:11.304Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816072202-126', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'The following items must be cleaned and sanitized: *', 'cutting boards', 'Cutting boards represent high-risk direct food-contact surfaces that must be rigorously cleaned and sanitized between tasks to prevent cross-contamination.

• Walls / Ceilings / Windows: Structural environmental surfaces cleaned periodically, but not classified as direct food-contact surfaces requiring routine sanitization cycles.', '["walls","ceilings","cutting boards","windows"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:35:15.644Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816080551-127', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'A food contact surface must be: *', 'cleaned first and then sanitized', 'Standard sanitation protocols dictate that food-contact surfaces must always be thoroughly cleaned first (using detergent and water to remove visible soils and grease) and then sanitized (using heat or chemical solutions to reduce pathogens to safe levels). Sanitizing dirty surfaces is ineffective.', '["sanitized first and then cleaned","cleaned first and then sanitized","sanitized only","cleaned only"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:35:20.301Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816089985-128', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'The purpose of a HACCP system is to: *', 'identify and control possible hazards at specific steps of food preparation', 'The fundamental operational purpose of the Hazard Analysis Critical Control Point (HACCP) system is to systematically identify, evaluate, and control biological, chemical, and physical hazards at critical control points throughout food preparation and processing.', '["identify and control possible hazards at specific steps of food preparation","employ corrective actions on defective foodservice equipment","identify the proper methods for receiving foods","maintain a rodent-free establishment"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:36:47.901Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816099217-129', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'Cleaning chemicals should be stored: *', 'in their original containers', 'Cleaning chemicals and hazardous compounds must always be stored strictly in their original labeled containers to prevent accidental misuse, chemical contamination, or poisoning.

• Glass / Plastic / Mobile containers: Unsafe or violate safety codes if transferred without proper approved chemical labeling.', '["in glass containers","in plastic containers","in mobile containers","in their original containers"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:36:52.847Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816109401-130', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'Sanitizing a surface: *', 'reduces microorganisms on it', 'Sanitizing a food-contact surface reduces pathogenic microorganisms down to safe public health levels.

• Removes visible dirt: The definition of cleaning (washing), not sanitizing.
• Requires strong detergent / cleaning cloth: Detergents are used during the cleaning phase preceding sanitization.', '["removes visible dirt","reduces microorganisms on it","requires the use of a strong detergent","requires a cleaning cloth"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:36:57.566Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816117236-131', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'ISO series that is applicable to environmental management system: *', 'ISO 14001', 'ISO 14001 is the internationally recognized series and standard specifically applicable to environmental management systems (EMS).

• ISO 9000 / ISO 9002: Quality management systems standards, not environmental management.', '["ISO 9000","ISO 9002","ISO 14001","none of the above"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:37:03.132Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816125016-132', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'A trend in foodservice that downsizes the operation of a foodservice operation: *', 'satellite', 'A satellite foodservice operation represents a downsized or decentralized setup that receives pre-prepared food from a central commissary for reheating and service.

• Multi-restaurant concept / Franchise: Expansion or multi-brand retail models.
• Commissary: A large central production kitchen, representing an upsizing or centralized scale.', '["multi-restaurant concept","satellite","commissary","franchising"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:37:07.708Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816132649-133', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'A trend in foodservice in which foodservice entities which belong to one company are housed in one store. *', 'multi-restaurant concept', 'A multi-restaurant concept is a foodservice trend where multiple distinct restaurant entities or brands belonging to a single corporate parent company are housed together under one roof or store.', '["multi-restaurant concept","satellite","commissary","franchising"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:37:11.196Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816146849-134', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'A trend in foodservice whose aim is to expand operations of a particular concept. *', 'franchising', 'Franchising is a business model and foodservice trend designed to rapidly expand operations of a established brand concept through independent operators.', '["multi-restaurant concept","satellite","commissary","franchising"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:37:15.027Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816163330-135', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'A concept in manpower utilization that enables one to maximize effort of employees: *', 'multi-tasking', 'Multi-tasking in manpower utilization cross-trains employees to perform multiple varied tasks, enabling management to maximize employee effort and operational efficiency.

• Specialization: Focuses employees on a single narrow task.', '["specialization","multi-tasking","retraining","on-the-job training"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:37:20.643Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816172982-136', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'A concept in foodservice with the aim of ensuring quality in all aspects of an operation. *', 'Quality Improvement Program', 'A Quality Improvement Program (QIP) is a structured operational concept specifically aimed at ensuring continuous quality across all operational aspects of a foodservice facility.', '["Quality Improvement Program","Total Quality Management","Hazard Analysis Critical Control Point","Total Quality Service"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:37:25.382Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816180780-137', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'A concept that refers to the systematic comparison of a company’s product or operation against that of the best company with a similar operation. *', 'Benchmarking', 'Benchmarking is the strategic management process of systematically comparing a company’s operational metrics, products, and practices against those of the best-performing industry competitors.', '["Quality Improvement Program","Total Quality Management","Quality Assurance","Benchmarking"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:37:29.914Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816188098-138', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'A food concept that is a combination of Oriental and Western cuisine. *', 'Fusion', 'Fusion cuisine combines distinct culinary traditions, cooking techniques, and flavor profiles from different cultures (such as Oriental and Western cuisine) into novel hybrid dishes.

• Eclectic: Draws distinct, unblended components from multiple diverse styles.', '["Fusion","Eclectic","Hybrid food","Mediterranean food"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:37:34.365Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816195096-139', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'A food concept whose final product reflects the individual characteristics of its component cuisines. *', 'Eclectic', 'An eclectic food concept features menu items from diverse origins where each final dish reflects the distinct, recognizable individual characteristics of its component cuisines.', '["Fusion","Eclectic","Hybrid food","Mediterranean food"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:37:50.042Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816206814-140', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'This foodservice system requires the least number of equipment and personnel. *', 'assembly serve system', 'An assembly-serve foodservice system (convenience-food system) requires the absolute least amount of specialized production equipment and kitchen personnel because foods are purchased fully prepared and only require thawing, heating, or portioning.

• Conventional / Ready-prepared / Commissary: Require extensive production equipment and large culinary staffs.', '["commissary system","ready-prepared system","assembly serve system","conventional system"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:37:55.508Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816217529-141', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'Storage area appropriate for hydrogenated fat. *', 'dry stores', 'Hydrogenated fats (such as shortening or commercial frying fats) possess low moisture and long shelf lives, making them appropriate for storage in cool, dry storage areas.

• Perishable stores: Reserved for high-moisture foods requiring refrigeration or freezing.', '["chemical stores","dry stores","perishable stores","paper stores"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:38:01.423Z"'::jsonb)
