('anki-card-1758816226796-142', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'A cleaning agent used to remove proteins and organic materials: *', 'alkaline cleaner', 'Alkaline cleaners (detergents) are formulated to break down, saponify, and remove heavy organic soils, fats, and stubborn food proteins from equipment surfaces.

• Acid cleaners: Used specifically to remove mineral scale and lime deposits.', '["acid cleaner","chlorine cleaner","quats","alkaline cleaner"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:38:36.591Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816235064-143', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'This portion control tool may be used in the efficient and effective dish-up of cheese sauce: *', 'ladle', 'A standardized volumetric ladle is the ideal portion control tool used for liquid or semi-fluid items like cheese sauces, gravies, and soups.', '["weighting scale","ladle","cup","spoon"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:38:40.856Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816242929-144', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'A type of door recommended to be installed in dry storage areas. *', 'Dutch door', 'A Dutch door (divided horizontally into upper and lower halves) is recommended for dry storage areas to allow ventilation and visual monitoring while preventing unauthorized entry or pests.', '["Aluminum door","Dutch door","Double door","Motion-sensitive door"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:38:45.291Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816250462-145', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'A small ornate table used in French style of service: *', 'gueridon', 'A gueridon is a small, ornate movable trolley or table used in classic French tableside (service) style to prepare, flame, or plate food in front of guests.

• Rechaud: A portable heating burner.', '["gueridon","rechaud","shelf truck","tray"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:38:49.881Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816258595-146', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'Night differential is equivalent to: *', '10% of regular wage', 'Under Philippine labor law (Labor Code), night shift differential pay is legally mandated as an additional compensation equivalent to at least 10% of the regular wage for each hour of work performed between 10:00 PM and 6:00 AM.', '["10% of regular wage","20% of regular wage","25% of regular wage","100% of regular wage"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:38:53.835Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816273244-147', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'A type of catering arrangement where the caterer brings his facilities and equipment for production, transport, and service to the customer. *', 'off-premise catering', 'Off-premise catering involves a caterer transporting food, facilities, equipment, and service staff to a customer''s chosen outside venue.

• On-premise catering: Conducted within the caterer''s permanent banquet hall or establishment.', '["off-premise catering","accommodator","social catering","on-premise catering"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:39:08.398Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816285660-148', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'This section of the food preparation area is also known as the range section: *', 'hot food preparation area', 'The hot food preparation station in a kitchen layout—where ranges, broilers, and ovens are housed—is commonly referred to as the range section or hot food preparation area.

• Garde manger: Cold food and salad preparation station.', '["pantry","hot food preparation area","garde manger","pre-preparation area"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:39:13.562Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816293675-149', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'A 7-inch plate used for several purposes such as plating desserts and as underliner for stemware. *', 'salad plate', 'A standard 7-inch plate in tableware is classified as a salad or dessert plate, frequently utilized for plating desserts or serving as an underliner for stemware.

• Dinner plate: Typically 9 to 10+ inches.', '["cereal plate","salad plate","dinner plate","luncheon plate"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:39:18.365Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816307158-150', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'The amount of space to be allotted for one employee’s work area: *', '120 – 180 cm', 'Standard kitchen ergonomic guidelines recommend allocating approximately 120 to 180 cm of linear work counter space for one employee''s comfortable operational work area.', '["60 – 75 cm","240 cm","175 cm","120 – 180 cm"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:39:22.274Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816316308-151', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'When a non-expendable equipment is to be condemned, it should be filed under which of the following documents? *', 'memorandum receipt', 'When non-expendable government or institutional property/equipment is to be condemned, written off, or disposed of, it is formally documented and processed through a memorandum receipt or property disposal report.', '["receiving record","non-expendable equipment record","memorandum receipt","report of waste materials"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:39:26.531Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816326491-152', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'Which of the following alcoholic beverages should be stored in the lowest shelf of the storage area? *', 'white wine', 'White wines are delicate, low in tannins, and best served chilled; they should be stored on the lowest or coldest shelves of a wine cellar or refrigerator. Red wines are stored higher at slightly warmer cellar temperatures.', '["sherry","red wine","fortified wine","white wine"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:39:30.195Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816335974-153', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'A monthly food cost report allows managers to: *', 'make judgments about the effectiveness of current operations', 'A monthly food cost report provides management with financial feedback to evaluate recipe yields, control waste, monitor budgets, and make managerial judgments regarding current operational efficiency.', '["have documented evidence of spoilage and pilferage","monitor inventory","provide employee meals at a pre-established cost","make judgments about the effectiveness of current operations"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:39:34.010Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816345207-154', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'If the cost of a whole cake is P500, having a yield of 10 slices and selling price is P90 per slice, what is the food cost percentage? *', '55.56%', 'To calculate food cost percentage:

Total cost of the cake = P500. Yield = 10 slices. Cost per slice = P500 ÷ 10 = P50.

Selling price per slice = P90.

Food cost percentage = (Cost per slice ÷ Selling price per slice) × 100 = (P50 ÷ P90) × 100 = 55.56%.', '["5.56%","18%","55.56%","none of the above"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:39:39.182Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816359773-155', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'An element of Herzberg 2-Factor Theory which ensures the maintenance of current level of efficiency: *', 'Hygiene factors', 'According to Herzberg''s Two-Factor Motivation Theory, hygiene factors (such as salary, working conditions, and company policy) do not motivate employees, but their presence is essential to prevent dissatisfaction and maintain the current level of operational efficiency.

• Motivational factors: Factors like achievement and recognition that actively drive job satisfaction and superior performance.', '["Hygiene factors","Motivational factors","Physiological factors","Esteem factors"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:39:45.093Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816368688-156', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'A human resource process which determines if employees are doing the right things and if they are doing it right. *', 'Performance management', 'Performance management is the comprehensive human resource process that sets expectations, monitors progress, and evaluates whether employees are doing the right things and doing them right.', '["Performance planning","Career","Discipline","Performance management"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:39:50.161Z"'::jsonb),
