('anki-card-1758816415370-159', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'What is the selling price of a Cheese Sandwich that has a raw food cost of P5.00 and the food cost percentage is 40%? *', 'P12.50', 'To calculate selling price based on food cost percentage:

