('anki-card-1758816424735-160', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'Which of the following is true about autocratic leadership? *', 'The leader makes decision and then informs his/her subordinates.', 'Under an autocratic (authoritarian) leadership style, the leader exercises unilateral authority, makes all decisions independently, and simply informs subordinates of the directives to execute.', '["The leader makes decision and then informs his/her subordinates.","The leader identifies purpose and tentative plans of actions but asks inputs from subordinates.","The leader makes decision and motivates subordinates to abide by it.","The leader does not want to make decisions but waits for management action."]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:40:07.183Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816432467-161', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'Table appointments placed to the left of the plate: *', 'forks and napkins', 'In formal table setting etiquette, forks and folded napkins are placed to the left of the dinner plate, while knives, spoons, and glassware are placed to the right.', '["knives and spoons","tumblers","forks and napkins","goblets"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:40:10.731Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816441334-162', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'Sanitary permits of food establishments are issued by the _____ upon the recommendation of the sanitary inspectors. *', 'City/Municipal Health Officer', 'Under the sanitation code, sanitary permits for food establishments are formally issued by the local City or Municipal Health Officer (MHO) upon the favorable recommendation of sanitary inspectors.', '["City/Municipal Health Officer","DOH Veterinarian","Municipal/City Agriculturist","Regional Health Officer"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:40:14.176Z"'::jsonb),
