('anki-card-1758816459401-164', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'It uses ultrahigh frequency energy waves which directly penetrate the food. *', 'microwave oven', 'A microwave oven utilizes ultrahigh frequency electromagnetic waves (radio waves) that directly penetrate food, agitating polar water molecules to generate rapid internal frictional heat.', '["convection oven","salamander","Dutch oven","microwave oven"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:40:22.361Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816467967-165', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'It is not ideal in a kitchen layout: *', 'The dishwashing area is far from the dining room.', 'In an ideal kitchen layout, the dishwashing area should be positioned close to the dining room exit (soiled dish return) and adjacent to pot-washing and storage areas to prevent cross-traffic contamination. Placing it far from the dining room is poor design.', '["The dishwashing area is far from the dining room.","The storage area for dry foods is near the delivery platform.","A U-shaped layout is better than the line layout.","The office of the Food Service Director is located centrally."]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:40:28.306Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816475717-166', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'Method of classifying foodservice institutions: *', 'by method of serving to the customers', 'Foodservice institutions are classically classified and categorized based on their method of service to customers (e.g., cafeteria, table service, tray service, counter service).', '["by capital investment","by the average number of customers","by method of serving to the customers","by architectural plan"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:40:32.469Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816484134-167', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'It is a guide in storing flour: *', 'keep flour away from strong odors', 'Flour is hygroscopic and readily absorbs ambient moisture and volatile aromatic compounds, requiring it to be stored away from strong-smelling items, chemicals, or spices.', '["inspect and turn bags frequently","more than 6 sacks of flour can be cross piled on pallets","store flour away from light","keep flour away from strong odors"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:40:37.719Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816492065-168', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'You are serving Beef Caldereta. How many servings are there in 1 kilo of beef at 60grams per serving? *', '15', 'To calculate the number of servings from 1 kilo (1,000g) of beef:

