('anki-card-1758816633991-183', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'The Unity of Command principle states that each employee must know to whom he reports. The supervisor must also know who he directs. *', 'Only the second statement is correct.', 'Statement 1 is incorrect because Unity of Command states that each employee must report to only one designated supervisor (avoiding conflicting dual commands), not merely that they must know who they report to. 

