('anki-card-1758816644291-184', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'These vegetables should not be stored in the refrigerator except: *', 'mushroom', 'Mushrooms require cold, high-humidity refrigeration to maintain freshness and prevent rapid bacterial decay, whereas root crops, pumpkins/squash, and unripe tomatoes keep best at cool ambient room temperatures.

• Eggplant / Squash / Unripe tomatoes: Vegetables that suffer chilling injury or lose texture and flavor when stored in standard refrigerators.', '["eggplant","mushroom","squash","unripe tomatoes"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:43:56.351Z"'::jsonb),
