('anki-card-1758816673876-187', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'The primary cause of food-borne diseases in foodservice institutions: *', 'carelessness and poor personnel hygiene of food handlers', 'Epidemiological data consistently identifies poor personal hygiene, improper temperature controls, and food handler carelessness as the primary root causes of foodborne disease outbreaks in foodservice institutions.', '["lack of proper refrigeration","poor quality of ingredients","carelessness and poor personnel hygiene of food handlers","failure to thoroughly heat or cook foods"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:47:31.338Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816682189-188', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'This theory of management assumes that workers are lazy, irresponsible, and have little creativity: *', 'Theory X', 'Douglas McGregor’s Theory X management assumes that average workers inherently dislike work, are lazy, lack ambition, avoid responsibility, and require close supervision and external coercion.

• Theory Y: Assumes workers are self-motivated, creative, and seek responsibility.', '["Theory A","Theory Z","Theory Y","Theory X"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:47:37.285Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816692523-189', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'Rank the following milk products from lowest to highest based on their fat content. I. Buttermilk II. Canned whole evaporated milk III. Canned whole sweetened condensed milk IV. Whipping cream V. Whole milk *', 'I, V, II, III, IV', 'Ranking dairy products from lowest to highest fat content:

Buttermilk (I) - very low fat (residual liquid after butter churning).

Whole milk (V) - approx. 3.25% to 3.5% fat.

Canned whole evaporated milk (II) - approx. 7.5% to 8% fat.

Canned whole sweetened condensed milk (III) - approx. 8% to 9% fat.

Whipping cream (IV) - high fat content ranging from 30% to 36%+.', '["III, II, I, V, IV","I, V, II, III, IV","II, III, V, IV, I","II, I, III, IV, V"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:44:14.455Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816703023-190', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'Being clean in foodservice means free from visible soil or the goods are aesthetically clean. Sanitary means the foods are free from disease-causing organisms and contaminants. *', 'Both statements are correct.', 'Statement 1 is correct: "clean" in foodservice means free from visible soil and aesthetically presentable. 

Statement 2 is correct: "sanitary" means the reduction of disease-causing microorganisms and biological contaminants to safe public health levels.', '["Both statements are incorrect.","Both statements are correct.","The first statement is incorrect but the second statement is correct.","The first statement is correct but the second statement is incorrect."]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:44:26.593Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758816710939-191', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609279327-1790433140276-ah6lq', 'These foods are the common sources of Staphylococcal food poisoning: *', 'ham & meat', 'Staphylococcus aureus is a bacterium commonly harbored on human skin, hands, and nasal passages, making protein-rich, handled prepared items like cured ham, sliced meats, and protein salads classic vehicles for staphylococcal food intoxication.

• Cooked rice & pasta: Classic vehicles for Bacillus cereus.', '["cooked rice & pasta","soups & sauces","ham & meat","fruits & vegetables"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:44:32.192Z"'::jsonb)
