Statement 2 is correct: shellfish like shrimp and squid contain significantly higher dietary cholesterol concentrations compared to fin fish.', '["Only the second statement is correct.","Both statements are incorrect.","Only the first statement is correct.","Both statements are correct."]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.872Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T09:47:21.076Z"'::jsonb),
