('anki-card-1755503137075-217', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609295725-1790433138921-hk7ah', 'Ground coffee is in constant contact with water; water is allowed to boil in a coffee pot, and measured coffee is put either directly into boiling water or tied loosely in a thin cloth bag. Heat is reduced (185-230F) and coffee is allowed to steep for 6-8 minutes. Medium ground coffee is used.', 'Steeping method', '', '["Steeping method","Drip method","Percolator","Vacuum"]'::jsonb, '["URE"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-08-27T20:00:00.000Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":2}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.455Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1755503190788-218', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609295725-1790433138921-hk7ah', 'Hot water is poured over the coffee grounds in a perforated basket lined with filter paper or cheese cloth; finely ground or pulverized coffee is used for maximum yield.', 'Drip method', '', '["Steeping method","Drip method","Percolator","Vacuum"]'::jsonb, '["URE"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-08-27T20:00:00.000Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":2}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.455Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1755503366131-219', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609295725-1790433138921-hk7ah', 'Jet of water is delivered by pressure over coffee grounds in a perforated container; coffee grounds are placed in perforated upper part of pot. Lower part if filled with measured amount of fresh water; upon boiling, water is forced upwards through the tube to the top of the pot where it is sprayed over the coffee. As it is drips down; flavor materials are extracted; coffee is percolated gently for 7-10 minutes. Medium or regular grind is used.', 'Percolator', '', '["Steeping method","Drip method","Percolator","Vacuum"]'::jsonb, '["URE"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-08-27T20:00:00.000Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":2}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.455Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
