('anki-card-1756173620546-60', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609355759-1790433142630-m8to1', 'This is a group of several similar ideas that evolved in the late 1800s and early 1900s. Pioneers in this theory were Fredrick W. Taylor, who was known as the Father of Scientific management.', 'Classical', '', '["Classical","Human relations theory","Management Science theory","System approach"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-16T20:00:00.000Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":2}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.985Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756173764590-61', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609355759-1790433142630-m8to1', 'Evolved during the 1920s through the 1950s. Introduced the behavioral sciences as an integral part of organization theory. View the organization as a social system and recognized the existence of the informal organization. Employee participation in management planning and decision-making yield positive effects in terms of morale and productivity.', 'Human relations theory', 'Human relations theory', '["Classical","Human relations theory","Management Science theory","System approach"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-16T20:00:00.000Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":2}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.985Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-08T12:24:43.573Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756173847252-62', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609355759-1790433142630-m8to1', 'Emphasized research on operations and the use of quantitative techniques to help managers make decisions. Extension includes the development of management information system (MIS), and program evaluation and review technique (PERT).', 'Management Science theory', 'Management Science theory', '["Classical","Human relations theory","Management Science theory","System approach"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-16T20:00:00.000Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":2}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.985Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-08T12:24:43.573Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756173957197-63', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609355759-1790433142630-m8to1', 'A set of interdependent parts that work together to achieve a common goal. Interdependency is the key concept in systems theory. Holism - a theory that says that the whole is more than sum of its part.', 'System Approach', '', '["Human relations theory","Management Science theory","System Approach","Contingency Approach"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-16T20:00:00.000Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":2}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.985Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756174053760-64', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609355759-1790433142630-m8to1', 'Individual motivation may be influenced by factors in the environment. Managers must adjust their leadership behavior to fit the particular situation. The structure of the organization must be designed to fit the organization, environment, and the technology it uses.', 'Contingency Approach', 'Contingency Approach', '["Human relations theory","Management Science theory","System Approach","Contingency Approach"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-16T20:00:00.000Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":2}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.985Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-08T12:24:43.573Z"'::jsonb),
