('anki-card-1756217770546-39', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609369423-1790433139853-3jf91', 'A wine steward or wine expert responsible for selecting and serving wines in a restaurant.', 'Sommelier', '• Executive Chef: In the traditional kitchen brigade system, which was developed by Georges Auguste Escoffier, the Executive Chef holds the highest authority and responsibility in the kitchen. This role involves overseeing all aspects of the kitchen operations, including menu planning, food preparation, kitchen staff management, and ensuring culinary standards and quality control.

• Garde Manger: The Garde Manger, also known as the pantry chef, is responsible for cold food preparation, such as salads, appetizers, and sometimes desserts.

• Sous Chef: The second-in-command in the kitchen, assisting the Executive Chef in managing kitchen staff, overseeing food production, and ensuring kitchen operations run smoothly.', '["Garde manger","Sommelier","Executive Chef","Sous Chef"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 2, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-10-15T13:17:38.628Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":1}'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T13:17:38.628Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.891Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T13:17:38.628Z"'::jsonb),
