('anki-card-1756218416451-49', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609369423-1790433139853-3jf91', 'Vitamin C, Vitamin E, BHT, and BHT and sulfites are all:', 'antioxidants', 'Antioxidants are substances that inhibit oxidation processes, which can lead to the deterioration of food products. They help prevent or slow down the oxidation of fats and oils, thus extending the shelf life of foods. Examples include vitamin C (ascorbic acid), vitamin E (tocopherol), BHA (butylated hydroxyanisole), BHT (butylated hydroxytoluene), and sulfites.

• Flavor enhancers: These substances are added to food to enhance or modify its taste and flavor.
• Antimicrobial agents: These are substances that inhibit or kill microorganisms, helping to preserve food by preventing microbial spoilage or contamination.
• Incidental food additives: These are substances that may be present in food as a result of manufacturing, processing, packaging, or storing, but are not intentionally added.', '["flavor enhancers","antioxidants","antimicrobial agents","incidental food additives"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 2, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-10-15T13:05:54.898Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":1}'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T13:05:54.898Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.891Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T13:05:54.898Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756218466880-50', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609369423-1790433139853-3jf91', 'An example of aseptic packaging:', 'tetra pack drinking boxes', 'Aseptic packaging refers to a method of packaging food and beverages in a sterile environment to maintain freshness without the need for refrigeration or additives. Tetra Pak is a well-known brand that produces aseptic packaging solutions, such as drinking boxes for juices, milk, and other beverages. These packages are designed to keep the contents safe from contamination and maintain their quality over an extended period without the need for preservatives or refrigeration until opened.

• Paper bag: Generally used for dry goods and not aseptically packaged.
• Milk carton: While milk cartons can be sealed aseptically, Tetra Pak specifically refers to the brand of aseptic packaging.
• Plastic bread bag: Used for packaging bread and typically not aseptic.', '["tetra pack drinking boxes","paper bag","milk carton","plastic bread bag"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 2, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-10-15T13:04:21.898Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":1}'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T13:04:21.898Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.891Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T13:04:21.898Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756218549445-51', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609369423-1790433139853-3jf91', 'Of the pork cuts, the most tender is:', 'loin', 'The loin is known for being the most tender cut of pork. It comes from the area along the back of the pig and includes cuts such as pork chops and pork tenderloin. This area of the pig does less work, resulting in more tender meat.', '["pork chop","loin","shank","pigue"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 2, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-10-15T13:59:29.113Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":1}'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T13:59:29.113Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.891Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T13:59:29.113Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756218612158-52', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609369423-1790433139853-3jf91', 'The Philippines'' abundant use of rice is reflected on its wide selection of rice-based desserts. Example of rice-based delicacies include the following EXCEPT:', 'Etag', 'Etag is a type of preserved meat, specifically salted and smoked pork, not a rice-based dessert.

• Tibok-Tibok: A Filipino dessert made from carabao’s milk and rice flour, often flavored with latik (coconut caramel).
• Kalamay: A sticky sweet delicacy made from glutinous rice, coconut milk, and sugar.
• Puto Calasiao: A type of steamed rice cake that originates from Calasiao, Pangasinan, made from fermented rice batter.', '["Tibok-tibok","Kalamay","Etag","Puto Calasiao"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 2, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-10-15T13:48:10.584Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":1}'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T13:48:10.584Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.891Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T13:48:10.584Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756218734785-53', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609369423-1790433139853-3jf91', 'The similarities in food culture between the Southern Philippines, Malaysia, and Indonesia are attributed to common religion. The similarity in food culture between the Philippines and Latin America is the history of colonization.', 'Both sentences are correct', 'Sentence A is correct. The southern Philippines, Malaysia, and Indonesia share a significant Muslim population, and their food cultures reflect Islamic dietary laws, including the use of halal ingredients and specific cooking practices.

Sentence B is also correct. The Philippines was colonized by Spain for over 300 years, which influenced Filipino cuisine with techniques and dishes similar to those found in Latin America, which were also Spanish colonies. Examples include the use of ingredients like tomatoes, garlic, and onions, as well as dishes like adobo and empanadas.', '["Only the first sentence is correct","Only the second sentence is correct","Both sentences are correct","Both sentences are incorrect"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 2, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-10-15T14:05:27.830Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":1}'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T14:05:27.830Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.891Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T14:05:27.830Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756218800082-54', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609369423-1790433139853-3jf91', 'Considered as the healthiest among cuisines of Southeast Asia because of the use of a profusion of green leafy vegetables, bean sprouts, nuts, fresh herbs and lean meat.', 'Vietnamese', 'Vietnamese cuisine is renowned for its fresh ingredients, balanced flavors, and minimal use of oil. Dishes often incorporate a variety of vegetables and herbs, lean proteins, and rice, creating a light and nutritious meal profile. Popular dishes like pho, fresh spring rolls (goi cuon), and various salads (goi) highlight these healthy components.', '["Vietnamese","Myanmar","Thai","Lao"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 2, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-10-15T13:08:53.378Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":1}'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T13:08:53.378Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.891Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T13:08:53.378Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756218884295-55', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609369423-1790433139853-3jf91', 'A known Tausug dish. It is also called the black soup: because of its color. It is served hot and spicy, made from beef or chicken, flavored with ginder, tumeric, and burned coconut meat.', 'Tiula Itum', 'Tiula Itum is a traditional Tausug dish from the Sulu Archipelago in the southern Philippines. Its distinctive black color comes from the use of burned or charred coconut meat, which is combined with spices such as ginger and turmeric to create a flavorful and aromatic soup.

• Linat-an: A Visayan soup dish made with pork or chicken, vegetables like gabi (taro), corn, and green leafy vegetables, seasoned with ginger and other spices. It is comforting and mildly flavored.
• Batchoy: A hearty noodle soup originating from Iloilo, Batchoy is made with a flavorful pork and beef broth, round noodles, and topped with pork offal, crushed pork cracklings, garlic, and an egg. It’s savory, rich, and often served hot.
• Piarun: Also known as “Piyanggang,” this is a dish from the Tausug people of Mindanao, made with chicken or fish marinated in spices and burnt coconut, then grilled or stewed. It has a rich, smoky flavor with a complex blend of spices.', '["Linat-an","Tiula Itum","Batchoy","Piarun"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 2, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-10-15T13:07:39.635Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":1}'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T13:07:39.635Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.891Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T13:07:39.635Z"'::jsonb),
