• Piarun: Also known as “Piyanggang,” this is a dish from the Tausug people of Mindanao, made with chicken or fish marinated in spices and burnt coconut, then grilled or stewed. It has a rich, smoky flavor with a complex blend of spices.', '["Linat-an","Tiula Itum","Batchoy","Piarun"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 2, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-10-15T14:16:04.210Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.3,"repetitions":1}'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T14:16:04.210Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.891Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T14:16:04.210Z"'::jsonb),
