('anki-card-1756875397012-50', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609405436-1790433139823-mldgr', 'The principle which states that “each employee must know to whom he reports,” refers to', 'unity of command', 'Unity of command prevents conflicting directives, ambiguity in accountability, and operational confusion by establishing a singular, direct line of authority where a subordinate receives orders from and is accountable to only one immediate superior. In clinical and foodservice management, this structural hierarchy ensures clear communication channels, precise delegation of tasks, and efficient chain-of-command execution during critical operational or patient care workflows.', '["departmentation","delegation of authority","unity of command","delegation of responsibility"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:35:40.426Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-07T14:32:00.423Z"'::jsonb),
