('anki-card-1756875540521-58', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609405436-1790433139823-mldgr', 'Which theory says workers are lazy and must be directed and forced to do their work?', 'Theory X

Developed by Douglas McGregor, this management theory breaks leadership styles about worker motivation.

❌ Theory Y: assumes the opposite—that workers are committed to their job and want to achieve meaningful results.
❌ Maslow’s Theory: hierarchy of human needs (physiological, safety, love, esteem, self-actualization).
❌ Hawthorne’s Theory: phenomenon where workers improve their performance simply because they know they are being observed.', '', '["Maslow’s Theory","Hawthorne’s Theory","Theory X","Theory Y"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:35:40.426Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756875558423-59', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609405436-1790433139823-mldgr', 'Which theory describes workers as committed to their job and want to achieve meaningful results?', 'Theory Y
C. Theory X


❌ Theory X: workers are lazy and must be directed and forced to do their work.
❌ Maslow’s Theory: hierarchy of human needs (physiological, safety, love, esteem, self-actualization).
❌ Herzberg’s Theory: also known as the Motivation-Hygiene Theory, states that there are two distinct sets of factors in the workplace that directly influence employee motivation and job satisfaction.', '', '["Maslow’s Theory","Herzberg’s Theory","Theory X","Theory Y"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:35:40.426Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756875575620-60', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609405436-1790433139823-mldgr', 'Which management function involves inspiring and motivating staff to willingly get the work done?', 'Leading', '', '["Planning","Organizing","Leading","Controlling"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:35:40.426Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
