('anki-card-1756875669334-64', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783609405436-1790433139823-mldgr', 'A detailed outline of routine tasks and side duties for each job position is called', 'Job description', 'A job description outlines the tasks, duties, responsibilities, and working conditions of a specific position. It acts as a detailed guide of what the employee is expected to do on a daily basis, including their routine tasks and any minor side duties.

	• Job Specification: This focuses on the human qualities needed for the job. It lists the minimum qualifications, skills, education, experience, and physical traits a person must have to perform the tasks. (A simple trick: Descriptions detail the tasks; Specifications detail the person).
	• Job Standards: These define the expected level of performance or measurable targets for the work being done (e.g., "wash 50 pans per hour").
	• Job Classification: This is the system of grouping similar jobs together into classes or grades based on difficulty and responsibility, usually for determining pay scales.', '["Job standards","Job description","Job specification","Job classification"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:35:40.426Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-07T14:32:00.423Z"'::jsonb),
