('anki-card-1758605854758-24', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783610451953-1790433140293-winqs', 'With a doubling time of 10 minutes and a starting population of 1 x 105, how many cells will be present after an hour, assuming that there is no death of cell.*', '6,400,000', '1. Find the number of generations (doublings)
