False', 'True', 'The initial enzymatic steps of purine nucleotide biosynthesis (de novo purine synthesis) take place entirely within the soluble cytoplasm (cytosol) of the cell.', '["True","none of the above","decrease insulin sensitivity","zein"]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.690Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T03:07:01.113Z"'::jsonb),
