True




False', 'False', 'The principles of plant-based eating involve placing a strong emphasis on nutrient-dense plant food sources, but they do not strictly require the absolute elimination of all animal product sources (as seen in flexible plant-forward, flexitarian, or Mediterranean dietary patterns), making the absolute elimination claim false.', '["False","zein","Parietal cells","Glucose"]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.690Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T03:08:28.006Z"'::jsonb),
