False', 'True', 'Intermittent fasting and caloric restriction protocols improve insulin sensitivity by lowering baseline circulating insulin levels, enhancing cellular glucose uptake efficiency, and reducing systemic inflammation.', '["True","Cellulose","Glyconegenolysis","Passive diffusion"]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.690Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T03:06:29.971Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757928025925-94', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783610525132-1790433140279-g2fd9', 'Ketogenic and Intermittent fasting can be used with supervision for those with Atherosclerotic Cardio Vascular Disease.





True




False', 'False', 'Therapeutic fasting or ketogenic diets must be approached with extreme clinical caution and are generally contraindicated or require rigorous medical supervision for patients with established Atherosclerotic Cardiovascular Disease (ASCVD) due to potential risks associated with dyslipidemia and cardiac stress, making the blanket approval statement false.', '["False","secretin","Glucagon","lysozomes"]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.690Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T03:06:35.107Z"'::jsonb),
