False', 'False', 'Acceptable Macronutrient Distribution Ranges (AMDR) for protein expressed as a percentage of total energy intake remain relatively stable across healthy adult lifespans (typically 10-35% of total calories), meaning the acceptable percentage range does not universally scale upward as one ages.', '["False","Glyconegenolysis","Glycolysis","Passive diffusion"]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.690Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T02:58:39.046Z"'::jsonb),
