('anki-card-1757928170648-105', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783610525132-1790433140279-g2fd9', 'If you use the malate aspartate shuttle you trade cytoplasmic NADH for mitochondrial FADH2 for 2 more ATP than the glycerophosphate shuttle.





