False', 'True', 'The malate-aspartate shuttle transfers cytosolic NADH equivalents into the mitochondrial matrix via malate dehydrogenase, yielding approximately 3 ATP equivalents per NADH (compared to the glycerol-phosphate shuttle which yields ~2 ATP via FAD), resulting in a net trade yielding 2 more ATP.', '["True","autophagy","Chylomicron","they enter the epithelial cells by diffusion"]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.910Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T03:08:45.876Z"'::jsonb),
