('anki-card-1756883280111-11', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783610563139-1790433136793-gn4oo', 'All are intrinsic factors that affect the growth of microorganisms, except:', 'Humidity', 'Humidity is an extrinsic environmental storage factor, whereas pH, moisture content, and nutrient content are intrinsic factors inherent to the food matrix itself.

