('anki-card-1756883341956-15', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783610563139-1790433136793-gn4oo', 'Microorganisms that grow in dry environments.', 'xerophile', 'Xerophiles are microorganisms adapted to grow and multiply successfully in extremely dry environments with low water activity.

