• Mesophile: Thrives at moderate ambient temperatures.
• Xerophile: Thrives in dry environments.', '["Xerophile","Thermophile","Mesophile","Psychrophile"]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.526Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:18:02.063Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756883427488-19', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783610563139-1790433136793-gn4oo', 'Microorganisms that can grow well at 35°C.', 'Mesophile', 'Mesophiles are microorganisms that grow best at moderate, warm temperatures, with optimum growth typically occurring around 35°C (human body temperature).', '["Xerophile","Thermophile","Mesophile","Psychrophile"]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.526Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:22:50.625Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756883443587-20', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783610563139-1790433136793-gn4oo', 'Microorganisms that can grow well at below 20°C.', 'Psychrophile', 'Psychrophiles are cold-loving microorganisms that grow exceptionally well at refrigeration or sub-polar temperatures below 20°C (with optima around 10°C–15°C).', '["Xerophile","Thermophile","Mesophile","Psychrophile"]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.526Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:22:54.675Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756883458251-21', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783610563139-1790433136793-gn4oo', 'he optimum temperature range of thermophiles is _____.', '55-65°C', 'Thermophiles exhibit high optimum temperature growth ranges spanning between 55°C and 65°C.', '["55-65°C","25-35°C","20-30°C","10-15°C"]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.526Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-11-09T10:22:58.304Z"'::jsonb),
