('anki-card-1756794842762-78', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783610598974-1790433142628-tj9iq', 'A procedure when the entire colon is bypassed, and opening is created from the ileum that is attached directly to the anus.', 'Ileorectal anastomosis', 'An anastomosis is a surgical term that means connecting or joining two distinct structures inside the body.

When the entire colon is removed or bypassed, the small intestine (specifically the ileum) must be carefully brought down and surgically sewn directly to the remaining rectum or anus to allow waste to leave the body naturally without needing a permanent external pouch or stoma bag.', '["Tonsillectomy","Cholecystectomy","Hemorrhoidectomy","Ileorectal anastomosis"]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 2, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-10-31T11:16:00.045Z","interval":3,"easeFactor":2.35,"repetitions":2}'::jsonb, '"2026-10-28T11:16:00.045Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.801Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-28T11:16:00.218Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756795127167-79', NULL, 'anki-deck-1783610598974-1790433142628-tj9iq', 'Assessment criteria for classification of BP for adults:

Normal:
Prehypertensive:
