('mc:the third step in a three-stage hand-washing dishes is::::sanitizing', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb, 'the third step in a three-stage hand-washing dishes is:', 'Sanitizing', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"There are three parts to hand-washing dishes: wash, rinse, and sanitize. In order to accomplish all three, your facility must have a three-compartment dishwashing sink. The sink must be clean and sanitized before beginning the washing process.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Sanitizing\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"There are three parts to hand-washing dishes: wash, rinse, and sanitize. In order to accomplish all three, your facility must have a three-compartment dishwashing sink. The sink must be clean and sanitized before beginning the washing process.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Rinsing, Drying, Air-drying"}'::jsonb),
