('mc:an unpaid form of promotion in which satisfied customers tell other people how much a product or service is favored.:::word-of-mouth', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb, 'an unpaid form of promotion in which satisfied customers tell other people how much a product or service is favored.', 'Word-of-mouth', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Word-of-mouth (WOM) marketing relies entirely on authentic human recommendations. It is completely unpaid because it happens naturally when satisfied customers organically share their positive experiences, reviews, or favorite products with friends, family, or colleagues.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Word-of-mouth\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Word-of-mouth (WOM) marketing relies entirely on authentic human recommendations. It is completely unpaid because it happens naturally when satisfied customers organically share their positive experiences, reviews, or favorite products with friends, family, or colleagues.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Social media advertising, Personal selling, Radio commercials"}'::jsonb),
