e tasks, processes, and resources efficiently. It includes planning, organizing, coordinating, and controlling activities within the organization. Administrative skills are essential for all levels of management but are typically more operational in nature compared to conceptual skills.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Conceptual skill, Technical skill, Administrative skill"}'::jsonb),
