('mc:in preparing for program planning and management, the first step is::::identifications/mobilization of lnc or planning core group', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb, 'in preparing for program planning and management, the first step is:', 'Identifications/mobilization of LNC or planning core group', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Establishing the group responsible for leading the planning process is the necessary first step before any assessment, goal-setting, or plan preparation can occur. ","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Identifications/mobilization of LNC or planning core group\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Establishing the group responsible for leading the planning process is the necessary first step before any assessment, goal-setting, or plan preparation can occur. \n\nAssessment or diagnostic analysis, setting goals and objectives, and preparing the plan of operation are all important subsequent steps, but they require an organized planning group to already be in place to carry them out.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Assessment or Diagnostic Analysis, Setting of goals and objectives, Preparation of plan of operation"}'::jsonb),
('mc:re-planning is a necessary step in nutrition program planning and management. in doing so, the following are revisited::::all of the above', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb, 're-planning is a necessary step in nutrition program planning and management. in doing so, the following are revisited:', 'All of the above', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Re-planning revisits the nutrition situation, the goals and objectives, and the strategies for targeting and implementing interventions together. Re-planning is triggered by monitoring and evaluation findings that suggest the current approach needs adjustment, and effective re-planning requires reassessing the full planning cycle.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"All of the above\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Re-planning revisits the nutrition situation, the goals and objectives, and the strategies for targeting and implementing interventions together. Re-planning is triggered by monitoring and evaluation findings that suggest the current approach needs adjustment, and effective re-planning requires reassessing the full planning cycle.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Nutrition situation, Goals and objectives, Strategies in targeting for and implementation of nutrition interventions"}'::jsonb),
