• Option C is TRUE: Parametric tests (like the t-test or ANOVA) carry strict assumptions about data structure, requiring variables to be continuous and measured on an interval or ratio scale, alongside approximately normal distributions. Non-parametric tests are used for nominal or ordinal data.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: The tests of significance deal with probability not certainty, Generally speaking, a parametic test of significance should be used when the data represent interval or ratio scale, As a researcher decreases the chances of committing a Type I error, the researcher increases the probability of committing a Type II error"}'::jsonb),
('mc:the first president of the dietetic association of the philippines::::presentation perez', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb, 'the first president of the dietetic association of the philippines:', 'Presentation Perez', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Presentation Perez - first president of the Dietetic Association of the Philippines.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Presentation Perez\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Presentation Perez - first president of the Dietetic Association of the Philippines.\n\n• Preciosa Irma Florentin - established the first dietetic internship program in the Philippines; the first hospital-based Nutrition Clinic; and the first metabolic unit at the Philippine General Hospital (PGH) in 1952.\n• Adelisa Ramos - first RND head of DOH Nutrition Service\n• Tecla San Andres - first woman in the Philippines to top the Bar Examinations for law graduates","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Preciosa Irma Florentin, Adelisa Ramos, Tecla San Andres"}'::jsonb),
('mc:the first president of the dietetic association of the philippines::::', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb, 'the first president of the dietetic association of the philippines:', NULL, true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Presentation Perez - first president of the Dietetic Association of the Philippines.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Presentation Perez\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Presentation Perez - first president of the Dietetic Association of the Philippines.\n\n• Preciosa Irma Florentin - established the first dietetic internship program in the Philippines; the first hospital-based Nutrition Clinic; and the first metabolic unit at the Philippine General Hospital (PGH) in 1952.\n• Adelisa Ramos - first RND head of DOH Nutrition Service\n• Tecla San Andres - first woman in the Philippines to top the Bar Examinations for law graduates","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Preciosa Irma Florentin, Adelisa Ramos, Tecla San Andres"}'::jsonb),
('mc:a function of public health nutritionist which focuses on assisting the community to assesses the program’s success or failure by evaluating program activities.:::program evaluator', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb, 'a function of public health nutritionist which focuses on assisting the community to assesses the program’s success or failure by evaluating program activities.', 'Program Evaluator', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Program Evaluator since this function specifically involves to evaluate whether a program met its objectives by systematically assessing its activities and results. ","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Program Evaluator\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Program Evaluator since this function specifically involves to evaluate whether a program met its objectives by systematically assessing its activities and results. \n\n• Program Assessor focuses on measurement and is a more common term in educational settings. \n• Program Organizer focuses on assembling resources and stakeholders before or during implementation. \n• Program Implementer focuses on carrying out planned activities, not evaluating them afterward.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Program Assessor, Program Organizer, Program Implementer"}'::jsonb),
