('mc:it is an art and science of promoting health thru an organized effort of improving the food and nutrition system.:::public health nutrition', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb, 'it is an art and science of promoting health thru an organized effort of improving the food and nutrition system.', 'Public Health Nutrition', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Public Health Nutrition – narrower definition; focused on food, diet, and nutrition issues within the population context.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Public Health Nutrition\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Public Health Nutrition – narrower definition; focused on food, diet, and nutrition issues within the population context.\n\n• Community Nutrition – narrowest definition; focused on the local implementation and tailored needs of a smaller geographic or demographic area.\n• Public Health – broadest definition; encompasses all health issues (infectious disease, injury, environment, etc.).","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Community Nutrition, Public Health, All of the above"}'::jsonb),
