('mc:which is an example of audio material?:::podcast', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb, 'which is an example of audio material?', 'Podcast', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"• Video - audio visual","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Podcast\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"• Video - audio visual\n• Vodcast - audio visual\n• Podcast - audio\n• TV - audio-visual","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Video, Vodcats, TV"}'::jsonb),
