('mc:a multi-level tool for promoting and sustaining risk-reducing behavior change in individuals and communities by distributing tailored specific messages thru variety of channels:::behavior change communication', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb, 'a multi-level tool for promoting and sustaining risk-reducing behavior change in individuals and communities by distributing tailored specific messages thru variety of channels', 'Behavior Change Communication', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"• Nutrition Education - narrower activity focused on knowledge/skill transfer","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Behavior Change Communication\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"• Nutrition Education - narrower activity focused on knowledge/skill transfer\n• Learning Strategies - specific pedagogical techniques\n• Health Promotion (D) - broader umbrella concept encompassing BCC as one of its strategic tools","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Nutrition Education, Learning Strategies, Health Promotion"}'::jsonb),
