('mc:which of the following best describes the role of a nutrition surveillance system in public health emergencies?:::it can be used as an early warning system for food crises', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb, 'which of the following best describes the role of a nutrition surveillance system in public health emergencies?', 'It can be used as an early warning system for food crises', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Nutrition surveillance systems can be used as an early warning system for food crises, allowing timely detection of deteriorating food security or nutritional status before a full-blown crisis occurs.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"It can be used as an early warning system for food crises\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Nutrition surveillance systems can be used as an early warning system for food crises, allowing timely detection of deteriorating food security or nutritional status before a full-blown crisis occurs.\n\n• Choice A is incorrect because surveillance is valuable during both stable and emergency periods, not just stable ones. \n• Choice C is incorrect because surveillance is, highly useful for assessing disaster impact through rapid nutritional assessments. \n• Choice D is too narrow, since surveillance in emergencies focuses on acute malnutrition trends as well, not just chronic malnutrition..","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: It is relevant during stable periods, It is not useful for assessing the impact of disasters, It focuses on tracking chronic malnutrition"}'::jsonb),
('mc:which of the following best describes the role of a nutrition surveillance system in public health emergencies?:::', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb, 'which of the following best describes the role of a nutrition surveillance system in public health emergencies?', NULL, true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Nutrition surveillance systems can be used as an early warning system for food crises, allowing timely detection of deteriorating food security or nutritional status before a full-blown crisis occurs.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"It can be used as an early warning system for food crises\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Nutrition surveillance systems can be used as an early warning system for food crises, allowing timely detection of deteriorating food security or nutritional status before a full-blown crisis occurs.\n\n• Choice A is incorrect because surveillance is valuable during both stable and emergency periods, not just stable ones. \n• Choice C is incorrect because surveillance is, highly useful for assessing disaster impact through rapid nutritional assessments. \n• Choice D is too narrow, since surveillance in emergencies focuses on acute malnutrition trends as well, not just chronic malnutrition..","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: It is relevant during stable periods, It is not useful for assessing the impact of disasters, It focuses on tracking chronic malnutrition"}'::jsonb),
('mc:what is a key characteristic of a well-functioning nutrition surveillance system?:::it provides information that is relevant, timely, and accessible for decision-making', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb, 'what is a key characteristic of a well-functioning nutrition surveillance system?', 'It provides information that is relevant, timely, and accessible for decision-making', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"A well-functioning system provides information that is relevant, timely, and accessible for decision-making, since data that arrives too late or is not actionable fails the core purpose of surveillance.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"It provides information that is relevant, timely, and accessible for decision-making\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"A well-functioning system provides information that is relevant, timely, and accessible for decision-making, since data that arrives too late or is not actionable fails the core purpose of surveillance.\n\n• It relies solely on data from clinical settings – incorrect; effective systems draw on multiple data sources, not clinical data alone.\n• It focuses on individual nutritional assessments rather than population-level trends - incorrect; surveillance is specifically oriented toward population-level trends not individual assessments.\n• It has a limited scope and only tracks a few indicators – incorrect; comprehensive systems typically track a broad and appropriately scoped set of indicators, not just a limited few.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: It relies solely on data from clinical setting, It focuses on individual nutritional assessments rather than population-level trends, It has a limited scope and only tracks a few indicators"}'::jsonb),
('mc:the 2022 expanded national nutrition survey (enns) was designed with a special purpose. what was this purpose?:::to compare nutrition and health indicators before and during the pandemic', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb, 'the 2022 expanded national nutrition survey (enns) was designed with a special purpose. what was this purpose?', 'To compare nutrition and health indicators before and during the pandemic', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"The correct answer is to compare nutrition and health indicators before and during the pandemic, reflecting the ENNS''s specific timing and design to capture the COVID-19 pandemic''s impact on the nutritional status of Filipinos.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"To compare nutrition and health indicators before and during the pandemic\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"The correct answer is to compare nutrition and health indicators before and during the pandemic, reflecting the ENNS''s specific timing and design to capture the COVID-19 pandemic''s impact on the nutritional status of Filipinos.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: To assess the impact of climate change on food security, To evaluate the effectiveness of the national immunization program, To monitor the implementation of local government unit projects"}'::jsonb),
