('mc:compute the percent shrinkage of pork, casim (raw weight: 850 g, cooked weight: 600 g).:::29.41%', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb, 'compute the percent shrinkage of pork, casim (raw weight: 850 g, cooked weight: 600 g).', '29.41%', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Percent Shrinkage: (raw weight - cooked weight) / raw weight * 100= (850 g - 600 g) / 850 g * 100 = 29.41%","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"29.41%\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Percent Shrinkage: (raw weight - cooked weight) / raw weight * 100= (850 g - 600 g) / 850 g * 100 = 29.41%","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: 25.00%, 38.30%, 41.67%"}'::jsonb),
