('mc:it is a statement of general thrust of the organization.:::mission', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb, 'it is a statement of general thrust of the organization.', 'Mission', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"A mission statement articulates an organization''s general thrust or overarching purpose, why it exists and what it broadly seeks to accomplish, distinct from a vision (the aspirational future state it seeks to achieve), a goal (a broad long-term aim derived from the mission), and an objective (a specific, measurable, time-bound target that operationalizes a goal).","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Mission\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"A mission statement articulates an organization''s general thrust or overarching purpose, why it exists and what it broadly seeks to accomplish, distinct from a vision (the aspirational future state it seeks to achieve), a goal (a broad long-term aim derived from the mission), and an objective (a specific, measurable, time-bound target that operationalizes a goal).","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Vision, Objective, Goal"}'::jsonb),
