('mc:what are the four components of pimam? i. community mobilization and outreach ii. outpatient department iii. counseling iv. outpatient therapeutic care v. home visit vi. inpatient therapeutic care vii. supplementary feeding program viii. referral:::i-iv-vi-vii', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb, 'what are the four components of pimam? i. community mobilization and outreach ii. outpatient department iii. counseling iv. outpatient therapeutic care v. home visit vi. inpatient therapeutic care vii. supplementary feeding program viii. referral', 'I-IV-VI-VII', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"The four components of the Philippine Integrated Management of Acute Malnutrition (PIMAM) are:","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"I-IV-VI-VII\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"The four components of the Philippine Integrated Management of Acute Malnutrition (PIMAM) are:\n\n1. I. Community mobilization and outreach\n2. IV. Outpatient Therapeutic care (OTC)\n3. VI. Inpatient Therapeutic care (ITC)\n4. VII. Supplementary Feeding Program (SFP) (also known as Targeted Supplementary Feeding Program / Management of MAM)","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: I-II-III-IV, V-VI-VII-VIII, I-III-V-VIII"}'::jsonb),
('mc:you are training bns on opt plus. what topic should you discuss with them first?:::role of the bns, their tasks, and skills needed', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb, 'you are training bns on opt plus. what topic should you discuss with them first?', 'Role of the BNS, their tasks, and skills needed', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Standard BNS training protocols begin with orienting new volunteers to their overall role, responsibilities, and the skills they will need, before proceeding to technical tasks such as operating equipment or conducting anthropometric measurement (NNC, n.d.). Establishing this foundational understanding of the BNS''s purpose and duties ensures BNS grasp why the technical skills that follow matter within the Operation Timbang Plus (OPT Plus) activity.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Role of the BNS, their tasks, and skills needed\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Standard BNS training protocols begin with orienting new volunteers to their overall role, responsibilities, and the skills they will need, before proceeding to technical tasks such as operating equipment or conducting anthropometric measurement (NNC, n.d.). Establishing this foundational understanding of the BNS''s purpose and duties ensures BNS grasp why the technical skills that follow matter within the Operation Timbang Plus (OPT Plus) activity.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: History of the Philippine Nutrition Program, How to do weighing, Parts of a weighing scale"}'::jsonb),
